\id ACT - Akawaio New Testament Translation Project 
\h INKUPɄ'PɄ 
\toc1 Papa A'kwarʉ Nʉkupʉ'pʉ Sises Nennoko'san Itekare Ekamai' Yawɨrɨ 
\toc2 Inkupʉ'pʉ 
\toc3 Inkupʉ'pʉ 
\mt1 Papa A'kwarʉ Nʉkupʉ'pʉ 
\mt2 Sises Nennoko'san Itekare Ekamai' Yawɨrɨ 
\imt1 Ekamanin 
\ip \bk Papa A'kwarʉ Nʉkupʉ'pʉ Sises Nennoko'san Itekare Ekamai' Yawɨrɨ\bk* esi itekare \bk Ʉru'\bk* nʉmenuka'pʉ pʉ'kʉ pe rɨ. Inkupʉnʉ kuru esi, wapiyaro' kon Sises pɨkɨron kon uya iku'to' pe Wakʉ A'kwarʉ uya to' kupʉ'pʉ Wakʉ Itekare ato' pe to' uya Sises pɨ', “Surusiran awɨrɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isutiya, Sameriya awɨrɨ'ne rɨ, siya rɨ non u'matʉ pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ” (1:8). Sises pɨkɨron kon pantomʉ pe iyesi Esuwerʉ amʉ' koro'tau iye'sara'tɨ'pʉ tanporon kon pata emʉ' kaisaron kon uya apurɨto' pe. Imenukanin esi'pʉ tʉnmenuka'pʉ ennin nan uya i'tuto' pe Sises pɨkɨron kon esi Roman amʉ' esi pata epuru pe enari'panin pe pen, Sises pɨkɨron kon napurɨnʉ esi Esuwerʉ amʉ' enurikʉ'pʉ ipɨ' a'ku'tɨnin pe. 
\ip \bk Inkupʉ'pʉ\bk* ekanpai iyesi osorʉwau eke ton ite'ma yau, enei'ma nai awɨrɨ Sises pɨ', Wakʉ Itekare usekama'pʉ so'si e'sara'tɨ'pʉ utɨn pɨ' mɨ awɨrɨ: 1) Sises pɨkɨron kon nʉkupʉnʉ e'sara'tɨ'pʉ Surusiran po Sises enuku'pʉ e'ma'pʉ pe; 2) Parestin pʉ'kʉ ton nɨ ti'ma'kapɨ'se iyepamʉ'pʉ; 3) miyarɨ rɨ iyepamʉ'pʉ Mete'teriyan nono poro rɨ Ron nɨ tepose. 
\ip Usennakan parɨ pen esi mɨrɨ \bk Inkupʉ'pʉ\bk* iye'sa' rʉ'pʉ tʉmeruntɨrʉ ke Sises apurɨnin nan pona Surusiran po Penti'kas weyu a'tai, mɨrɨpan nɨ esi miyarɨ rɨ so'si esa' pe imeruntɨtanʉkʉ pɨ' rɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itepuru ton nɨ, iye'ku'pɨ'sa' usekamasa' na'ne' awɨrɨ kareta yau. Iye'sara'tɨ a'taino kon Sises pɨkɨron kon ekareei amʉranʉ'sa' to'ken esi mɨrɨ tu'kan nɨ to' nekamapɨtʉ'pʉ itekare yau, iye'ku'sa' rʉ'pʉ e'menukasa' na'ne' iye'ku'sa' rʉ'pʉ uya rɨ ekama meruntɨ pe itekare esi'pʉ Sises apurɨnin nan yau mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ so'si tawon kon yau rɨ. 
\iot Iyawon Ekamanin 
\io1 Ekonekan ensa' rʉ'pʉ ekamanin pe (1:1-26) 
\io2 a. Te'nonka pe Sises usaurokʉ'pʉ (1:1-14) 
\io2 b. Isutas pata'pʉ iyakan anʉmʉ'pʉ (1:15-26) 
\io1 Surusiran po tʉnene'pʉ kon ekama'pʉ enno'sa' kon uya (2:1—8:3) 
\io1 Isutiya, Sameriya po tʉnene'pʉ kon ekama'pʉ enno'sa' kon uya (8:4—12:25) 
\io1 Paarʉ e'tʉrawasoma'pʉ (13:1—28:31) 
\io2 a. Iye'sara'tɨ pe itekare ekamai' itɨ'pʉ (13:1—14:28) 
\io2 b. Surusiran po eke pe mitin pɨ' to' esi'pʉ (15:1-35) 
\io2 c. Iyakon ite'kwa pe itekare ekamai' itɨ'pʉ (15:36—18:22) 
\io2 d. Itosorʉwano ite'kwa pe itekare ekamai' itɨ'pʉ (18:23—21:16) 
\io2 e. A'sisa' pe Paarʉ esi'pʉ, Surusiran, Sisariya, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Ron po (21:17—28:31) 
\c 1  
\s1 Sises Enuku'pʉ Epʉn Pona 
\p  
\v 1 Eke Tiyo'peras, wapiyaro' ukaretaai yau imenukasa' uya man, tanporon nɨ Sises nʉkupʉ'pʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' enupa'pʉ iya rʉ'pʉ  
\v 2 iyenuku pona rɨ Epʉn pona. Mɨrɨ rawɨrɨ, Papa meruntɨrʉ ke tʉuta'kwarʉ'tɨi', tʉneporo'san tʉnenno'ton kon pe itekare ekamai' apiyo'ma'pʉ iya tʉtʉrawasooi kon ku'to' pe to' uya.  
\v 3 Sises ekota'ma'pʉ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ iyerikʉ'pʉ tʉpo kurusu' po, to' piya' isenpoikapɨtʉ'pʉ inke ite'kwa rɨ, to' uya te'mʉ'sa'kasa' apurɨto' pe. Inke rɨ to' piya' isenpoikapɨtʉ'pʉ 40 kaisa rɨ wʉi ton u'matʉ koro'tau terikʉ tʉpo te'mʉ'sa'kasa' a'tai, mɨrɨpan usaurokʉ'pʉ Papa e'to' esa' wannɨ pe pɨ'.  
\v 4 Tʉron nɨ a'tai to' piyau tesi koro'tau, to' auro'ka'pʉ iya, “Surusiran apai kʉtɨtʉu, e'tane ukʉipʉnʉ usauro'sa' rʉ'pʉ ipɨ' enupɨkɨrɨ me'tʉi' usaurokʉ rɨ metata'tʉine'nokon ipɨ'.\x - \xo 1:4 \xt Ʉru' 24:49\x* 
\v 5 Isaan uya ka'pon amʉ' pa'taisimapɨtʉ'pʉ tuna ke, e'tane serɨ pe iwa'ne rɨ Papa uya apa'taisimapɨtʉ kon mɨrɨ Wakʉ Ta'kwarʉ ke,” ta'pʉ iya.\x - \xo 1:5 \xt Ma'siu 3:11; Ma' 1:8; Ʉru' 3:16; Isaan 1:33\x* 
\p  
\v 6 Sises pokon pe kanan tamʉrasa' kon a'tai, to' uya ekama'po'pʉ, “Ina epuru, serɨ a'tai pe' urɨ'nokon Esuwerʉ amʉ' e'to' itesa' pe na'po auya serɨ?” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 7 Mɨrɨpan uya ta'pʉ to' pɨ', “Iweyu i'tuto' auya'nokon kuru pʉra rɨ iyesi. Ukʉipʉnʉ uya ikoneka mɨrɨ tʉweyu a'tai rɨ.  
\v 8 E'tane Wakʉ A'kwarʉ uye'sa' a'tai ɨpona'nokon, meruntɨ pe ɨyena kon mɨrɨ, mɨrɨpan uyekareei ekama auya'nokon mɨrɨ Surusiran po, Isutiya po, Sameriya po, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ siya rɨ non emʉ' kaisa rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya.\x - \xo 1:8 \xt Ma'siu 28:19; Ma' 16:15; Ʉru' 24:47-48\x* 
\p  
\v 9 Serɨ ta'pʉ iya tʉpo, itanʉmʉ'pʉ to' enu airɨ rɨ, mɨrɨpan onamʉ'pʉ kapuru' uya to' enu apai.\x - \xo 1:9 \xt Ma' 16:19; Ʉru' 24:50-51\x* 
\p  
\v 10 To' esi'pʉ ka'ta' tenu kon tʉtʉse enpɨtʉ pɨ' iyenu'tane. Mɨrɨ koro'tau, ite'kwanau pʉra rɨ, asa'ron kon inserʉ amʉ' e'soto'kasa' esi'pʉ to' piyau.  
\v 11 “Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon, Kiyarari pon kon, ɨ'rɨ pɨ' serɨ yau ɨye'soto'pɨ'sa' kon uya ka'ta' ɨyenu kon tʉpɨtʉ? Pʉse rɨ Sises enuku menyatʉine' Epʉn pona uye'to' oton, itɨ ene'pʉ auya'nokon kasa rɨ,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\s1 Ma'tayas Ena'pʉ Isutas Pata'pʉ Yakan Pe 
\p  
\v 12 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, enno'sa' kon enna'po'pʉ Surusiran pona Are' Wʉpʉ poi, ɨnnɨ kuru pʉra rɨ, 1 mayirʉ o'koi' rɨ pata pona.  
\v 13 Pata eposa' tʉuya'nokon a'tai, pata tʉto' tʉuya'nokon itau, ka'tawon ɨutɨ ta' to' utɨ'pʉ. Pʉsamoro iyamʉrasa' kon esi'pʉ; Pi'ta, Isaan, Isens, Anturu, Piri', Tamas, Pa'taramiu, Ma'siu, Isens (Arʉ'piyas mu), Saiman (Usera' tukai' tesa'sen\f + \fr 1:13 \fq Usera' \ft - Roman amʉ' enapai temo'ka kon i'sero'.\f*), mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isutas (tʉron nɨ Isens mu).\x - \xo 1:13 \xt Ma'siu 10:2-4; Ma' 3:16-19; Ʉru' 6:14-16\x* 
\v 14 To' amʉrapɨtʉ'pʉ ɨsewenapai rɨ ɨpʉremai'. Uri'sami'si amʉ', Sises san Meri, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sises akon non esi'pʉ to' koro'tau. 
\p  
\v 15 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Pi'ta e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ tʉtonpa ton Sises apurɨnin nan koro'tau. 120 kaisaron kon esi'pʉ mɨrɨ yau.  
\v 16 “Utonpa ton, kin Tepi' poro Wakʉ A'kwarʉ usauro'sa' rʉ'pʉ Isutas pɨ' si uta'ku'tɨsa' man. Sises a'si ton kon anin pe iyena'pʉ.  
\v 17 Isutas esi'pʉ anʉnsa' rʉ'pʉ ina tonpa pe itekare ekama pɨ' iye'tʉrawasomato' pe,” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya. 
\p  
\v 18 (Ɨri eseru ku'sa' tʉuya epe'pʉ ke Isutas uya non e'ma'pʉ, mɨrɨpan yau ita'mo'ka'pʉ, iye'toi'kwa'pʉ tʉwenu'pɨ takanʉ'se.  
\v 19 Tanporon kon Surusiran pon kon uya itekareei eta'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon uya mɨrɨ non ese'tɨ'pʉ A'ketama tukai', Mʉn Pata'se' ta e'kwa pe.)\x - \xo 1:19 \xt Ma'siu 27:3-8\x* 
\p  
\v 20 Miyarɨ rɨ Pi'ta usaurokʉ'pʉ, “Iye'menukasa' man Eren yau, 
\q1 “‘Tɨwɨ itawon pʉra itiwʉ' nesii, 
\q2 ɨnʉ' rɨ kʉse'nin itau,’\f + \fr 1:20 \ft Eren 69:25\f* 
\m mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ, 
\q1 “‘Tɨwɨ tʉron nɨ itepuru pe te'ton ipata'pʉ anʉmʉi,’\f + \fr 1:20 \ft Eren 109:8\f* 
\m tukai'.  
\v 21 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', Isutas pata'pʉ iyakan epopai'nokon, pena rɨ Sises a'tai uya'kɨrɨ'nokon iye'sa' rʉ'pʉ,  
\v 22 Isaan uya epa'taisiman ekareei ekama'pʉ si'kɨrɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sises enuku pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ iye'sa' rʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan e'to' pe utonpa kon pe Sises e'mʉ'sa'kasa' ene'pʉ tʉuya ekamanin pe,” ta'pʉ iya.\x - \xo 1:22 \xt Ma' 16:19; Ʉru' 24:51\x* 
\p  
\v 23 Mɨrɨpan kon uya asa'rɨ ka'pon amʉ' anʉmʉ'pʉ; Isose', Parʉsapas tukai' to' nesakʉnʉ, Isu'su'tas tato' to' uya ipɨ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Ma'tayas.  
\v 24 Mɨrɨpan tanporo mɨrɨ yau te'san ɨpʉrema'pʉ, “Ina epuru, tanporon kon usenuminkato' i'tu auya. Apʉne ekamakɨ nai kʉrɨ rupɨ anʉnsa' auya pʉsamoro asa'ron kon ka'pon amʉ' apai  
\v 25 enno'sa' pe iye'to' pe, Isutas pata'pʉ iyakan pe. Isutas uya ina nonkasa' man tʉpata'se' ya' tʉutɨ pɨ',” tukai' to' ɨpʉrema'pʉ.  
\v 26 I'tun nɨto' ike ke to' i'tu'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan i'ki'ma tane to' uya ita'mo'ka'pʉ Ma'tayas winɨkʉi', mɨrɨpan Ma'tayas ena'pʉ 11 pan kon enno'sa' kon tonpa pe. 
\c 2  
\s1 Papa A'kwarʉ Uyee'pʉ Sises Poitorʉ Rʉ'san A'kwarʉ'tɨi' 
\p  
\v 1 Penti'kas tato' weyu e'seposa' a'tai,\x - \xo 2:1 \xt E'sotas 23:16; 34:22; Ripaiti'kas 23:15-21; Isu'taronomi 16:9-12\x*\f + \fr 2:1 \fq Penti'kas\ft —To' Epoi Itɨ'pʉ Weyu Rʉ'pʉ pe, 50 pe wʉi tʉpo Esuwerʉ amʉ' amʉrasa' ti'kiyari kon a'nai' akʉ'pʉsa' anʉmʉ tʉuya'nokon weyu pɨ'.\f* tanporo Sises apurɨnin nan amʉrasa' esi'pʉ tikin nɨ ipata Surusiran po.  
\v 2 Mɨrɨ yau, ite'kwanau pʉra rɨ, pata a'merumʉ'pʉ, eke pe a'setun kasa, ka' winɨpai, mɨrɨpan ewomʉ'pʉ to' iwʉ' ta',  
\v 3 mɨrɨpan kon uya apo' waraino ene'pʉ, mɨrɨpan e'ta'nʉkʉ'pʉ to' kaisa rɨ to' i'pai pona'ne ereutai'.  
\v 4 Tanporo to' uta'kwarʉ'tɨ'pʉ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke, mɨrɨpan kon e'sara'tɨ'pʉ usauro'nɨ pɨ' tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' maimu\f + \fr 2:4 \fq maimu, \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq ani \ft Kiri' maimu yau.\f* yau'ne, Iya'kwarʉ uya tʉusauro'to' kon pe tʉkupʉ kon pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 5 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Esuwerʉ amʉ' amʉrasa' esi'pʉ mɨ awɨrɨ'nan nɨ, pata emʉ' apaino kon Surusiran pona.  
\v 6 Pata a'merumʉ tetai', to' amʉra'pʉ Sises apurɨnin nan pata'se' ya'. To' usewansiuka'pʉ tʉmaimu kon tau'ne to' usaurokʉ eta tʉuya'nokon pɨ'.  
\v 7 Ipan pe to' usewansiuka'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon uya ta'pʉ, “Pʉsamoro nʉsauro'ai'ne' nan sa'ne Kiyarari ko' amʉ' ko!  
\v 8 Ɨ'rɨ kasa ken si umaimu kon tau'ne to' usaurokʉ eta serɨ?  
\v 9 Tʉron kon sa'ne uye'pɨ'sa' man ko, Pa'tiya winɨpai, Metiya winɨpai, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Eran winɨpai, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon kanan Me'sa'po'temiya, Isutiya, Ka'pato'siya, Pontas, Eisa Mʉre'pʉ,  
\v 10-11 Pʉrekiya, Panperiya, Isi', Ripiya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Ron piyaworo' nan nɨ uye'sa' man ko, Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen e'tane, Esuwerʉ amʉ' napurɨnʉ apurɨnin nan. Tʉron kon kanan Kʉri' winɨpaino kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Arepiya winɨpaino kon, e'tane si umaimu kon tau'ne to' usaurokʉ eta'nokon, eke rɨ Papa nʉkupʉ'pʉ ekareei pɨ'!” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 12 Tanporon kon usewansiuka'pʉ, i'tu tʉuya'nokon pʉra iyesi pɨ'. “Ɨ'rɨ ekamanin pe serɨ esi?” tukai' to' usekama'popɨtʉ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 13 E'tane tʉron kon uta'kɨrɨ'pʉ to' pɨ' to' sapema pe rɨ. “To' e'taripasa' man,” ta'pʉ to' uya. \fig Apo' waraino ene'pʉ to' uya.|src="CN01890B.tif" size="span" loc="ACT 2:1-13" copy="David C. Cook" ref="2:3" \fig* 
\s1 Pi'ta Uya Itekare Ekama'pʉ 
\p  
\v 14 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Pi'ta e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ 11 pan kon tʉtonpa ton pokon pe, anpisin ka'pon amʉ' koro'tau, mɨrɨpan usaurokʉ'pʉ eke pe, “Utonpa ton, Esuwerʉ amʉ' tʉron nɨ pata winɨ'nan mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Surusiran po tʉuko'mansan, apʉne etatɨ'! Ɨ'rɨ ta e'kwa pe serɨ e'ku'sa' tukai' ekama uya.  
\v 15 Ipoken pʉra rɨ ɨusenuminka kon ina e'taripasa' tukai'. Awanakʉi' rɨ marɨ pata man, 9 a'kʉra' rɨ marɨ. Ɨnʉ' e'taripa pʉra rɨ iyesi mɨrɨ a'tai.  
\v 16 E'tane pu'kena' Isowerʉ nekama'pʉ rʉ'pʉ uta'ku'tɨ serɨ, 
\q1  
\v 17 “‘Papa uya se kasa tasa': Se ton kupʉ uya mɨrɨ non weyu u'matʉ a'tai: 
\q2 Uya'kwarʉ enno'to' uya oton tanporon kon pona. 
\q1 Ɨmu kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨyensi kon amʉ' uya umaimu ekamato' oton, 
\q2 moineri'san enu uta'kwakasa' uya ento' oton, 
\q2 mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ kɨɨyi' amʉ' e'ne'pɨ'to' oton. 
\q1  
\v 18 Mɨrɨ rɨken pe pʉra, upoitorʉ ton, warawoti'si amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ uri'sami'si amʉ' pona 
\q2 uya'kwarʉ enno'to' uya oton nɨ marɨ, 
\q2 mɨrɨpan kon uya umaimu ekamato' oton. 
\q1  
\v 19 A'kwarʉpɨ'nin ku'to' uya oton ka' yau, 
\q2 mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ i'tuto' ipɨ' non po kanan. 
\q1 Mɨrɨ a'tai, mɨrɨ yau mʉn e'to' oton, apo' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ipun pe ikɨrɨsin e'to' oton. 
\q2  
\v 20 Wʉi enu ewarumanto' oton, 
\q2 mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ kapʉi usuitato' oton mʉn kasa. 
\q2 Eke rɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ wakʉ rɨ Itepuru Weyu uyepʉ rawɨrɨ tanporo serɨ ton e'ku'to' oton. 
\q1  
\v 21 Ɨnʉ' rɨ kʉrɨ rɨ Itepuru ekama'ponin nʉ'pʉ tʉpika'tɨnin pe, 
\q2 epika'tɨto' oton tasa' iya,’\f + \fr 2:21 \ft Isowerʉ 2:28-32\f* 
\m ta'pʉ rʉ'pʉ Isowerʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 22 “Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon Esuwerʉ amʉ', serɨ umaimu etatɨ'! Pʉse rɨ Sises, Nasare' pon, ɨ'koro'tau'nokon iyesi'pʉ Papa nennoko'pʉ. Tu'kan nɨ eke Papa tʉrawasooi, a'kwarʉpɨ'nin, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ i'tuto' ipɨkɨrɨ rɨ ku'to' pe iya ɨyena'nokon. Papa uya enpoika'pʉ ɨyena'nokon inkupʉnʉ winɨ, Papa nennoko'pʉ tukai' i'tu kon pa, mi'tuyatʉi'ne' kasa rɨ.  
\v 23 Pena rɨ Papa uya iku'sa' esi'pʉ ɨyena'nokon itʉto' pe tʉuya, mɨrɨpan tʉrʉ'pʉ auya'nokon ɨri ton ena' to' uya kurusu' pona ipokapɨ'to' pe, iyeri'to' pe.\x - \xo 2:23 \xt Ma'siu 27:35; Ma' 15:24; Ʉru' 23:33; Isaan 19:18\x* 
\v 24 E'tane Papa uya i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ eri'nɨto' meruntɨrʉ apai, eri'nɨto' uya a'sisa' ko'manʉkʉ namai'.\x - \xo 2:24 \xt Ma'siu 28:5-6; Ma' 16:6; Ʉru' 24:5\x* 
\v 25 Pena Tepi' uya Itepuru maimu ekama'pʉ, 
\q1 “‘Papa, Itepuru ene uya inke rɨ upiyau. 
\q2 Mɨrɨ uriya', usi'nʉkʉ pen. 
\q1  
\v 26 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', pori' pe uyewan yau esii'ma, uyesen uya epori'mato' enpoika. 
\q2 Ayapurɨ uya, Papa, 
\q1 eri'sa' rɨ e'tane, 
\q2 upun uko'mamʉ te'ku'to' yau, 
\q1  
\v 27 apʉne pʉra uruwai' yau esi i'se pʉra ɨwesi pɨ', 
\q2 mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ wakʉ, urɨ ɨpoitorʉ ukɨta i'se pʉra ɨwesi. 
\q1  
\v 28 Ɨko'manse'na utɨto' e'ma enpoikasa' auya man; 
\q2 pori' pe uku'to' auya oton, apʉne pʉra tɨwɨ rɨ upiyau ɨwesi pɨ',’\f + \fr 2:28 \ft Eren 16:8-11\f* 
\m ta'pʉ Tepi' uya,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 29 Pi'ta usaurokʉ'pʉ tɨpiyɨ'se pʉra, “Utonpa ton, eke utamokori kon Tepi' erikʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uruwasii esi serɨ pona rɨ.  
\v 30 Tepi' esi'pʉ pu'kena', mɨrɨpan uya Papa uya, ‘Ikupʉ uya kuru rɨ mɨrɨ,’ tukai' tauro'ka'pʉ rʉ'pʉ si i'tu'pʉ: tikin nɨ ipayan amʉ' tonpa ku'to' oton Papa uya itepuru pe, Papa munkɨ amʉ' esa' pe, Tepi' esi'pʉ to' esa' pe kasa, tawon.\x - \xo 2:30 \xt Eren 132:11; 2 Sanwerʉ 7:12-13\x* 
\v 31 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', Tepi' uya nin si Kʉrai\f + \fr 2:31 \fq Kʉrai \ft (Kiri' maimu yau), mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq Me'saya \ft (Ipuru maimu yau), asa'rɨ rɨ marɨ iyesi, \fq Papa Nanʉmʉnʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe; v. 36 kanan.\f* e'mʉ'sa'kato' oton i'tusa' tʉuya pɨ' ekama'pʉ, uruwai' yau iko'manto' oton pen nɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ipun ukɨta pen nɨ, tukai'. 
\p  
\v 32 “Pʉse rɨ Sises, iyeri'sa' rʉ'pʉ i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ Papa uya. Ina si iya'kɨron kon nʉ'san uya iye'mʉ'sa'kasa' ene'pʉ.  
\v 33 Papa uya eke pe kuru ikupʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan ereutanʉ'sa' iya tenwo'netʉ winɨ, mɨrɨpan uya apiyo'ma'pʉ ta'kwarʉ enno'to' pe iya tʉpoitorʉ ton pona, tʉusaurokʉ'pʉ awɨrɨ rɨ. Sises uya si eke pe kuru rɨ ina repasa' Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke menyatʉi'ne' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ metayatʉi'ne'.  
\v 34 Tepi' enu'sa' pʉra iyesi tʉpun yau Epʉn pona, e'tane Tepi' uya ta'pʉ, 
\q1 “‘Itepuru uya ta'pʉ uyepuru pɨ'; 
\q2 “Uyenwo'netʉ winɨkʉi' ereutatanʉ'kɨ Itepuru pe ɨwesi pa, 
\q1  
\v 35 apʉne ɨyeyaton non entai ɨwesi pa ɨku'tane uya to' esa' pe ɨwesi pa,”’\f + \fr 2:35 \ft Eren 110:1\f* 
\m tasa'. 
\p  
\v 36 “Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporo rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya i'tu i'se esi i'napai rɨ kuru iyesi tukai': Pʉse rɨ si Sises ɨnwɨnɨ'pʉ kon ku'sa' Papa uya man Itepuru pe mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Kʉrai pe,” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya. 
\p  
\v 37 Ka'pon amʉ' uya serɨ etasa' a'tai, ipan pe to' ewan poka'pʉ iya, mɨrɨpan kon uya Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itonpa ton ekama'po'pʉ, “Ina tonpa ton, ɨ'rɨ ken si kupʉ ina uya serɨ?” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 38 Pi'ta uya to' maimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon tikin pa'ne me'atʉi'ne' kaisa rɨ amakooi kon apai era'tɨtɨ', ina uya apa'taisimato' kon pe Sises ese' yau amakooi kon pɨ' usentu'man nɨto' pe, mɨrɨpan uya Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke ɨrepa kon mɨrɨ.  
\v 39 Papa uya tʉusaurokʉ'pʉ kupʉ mɨrɨ ɨpɨ'nokon, apayan kon nʉ'san pɨ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ sunwaron kon pɨ' nɨrɨ, tanporon kon Itepuru, itese' pɨ' e'nɨto' Papa nʉkɨ'manʉ ton pɨ' rɨ nɨrɨ,” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya. 
\p  
\v 40 Miyarɨ rɨ Pi'ta usaurokʉ'pʉ to' emiya'pontɨnin pe, “Epika'tɨtɨ' ɨri ton serɨ a'taino kon piyapai,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 41 Pi'ta maimu apurɨnin nʉ'san pa'taisima'pʉ enno'sa' kon uya, mɨrɨpan 3,000 kaisaron kon ena'pʉ to' tonpa pe. 
\p  
\v 42 Inke rɨ tenupato' kon awɨrɨ kuru rɨ to' e'pɨtʉ'pʉ, tʉusi'nʉnka kon ke to' amʉrapɨtʉ'pʉ, to' uta're'tɨpɨtʉ'pʉ\f + \fr 2:42 \fq to' uta're'tɨpɨtʉ'pʉ; \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra, \fq to' enta'napɨtʉ'pʉ Itepuru enta'na'pʉ eseru rʉ'pʉ yau; \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra, \fq to' enta'napɨtʉ'pʉ Itepuru tenupa'pʉ kon awɨrɨ.\f* mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' ɨpʉremapɨtʉ'pʉ a'samʉtʉ yau. 
\s1 Enno'sa' Kon Uya I'tuto' Ipɨkɨrɨ Ku'pɨtʉ'pʉ 
\p  
\v 43 Tu'ke rɨ a'kwarʉpɨ'nin mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ i'tuto' ipɨkɨrɨ kupʉ'pʉ enno'sa' kon uya, mɨrɨpan pɨ' tanporon kon enari'nʉmʉ'pʉ.  
\v 44 Tanporo Sises apurɨnin nan amʉrapɨtʉ'pʉ a'samʉtʉ yau, mɨrɨpan kon e'repapɨtʉ'pʉ tanporon ke rɨ tʉtonpa kon pokon pe,\x - \xo 2:44 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 4:32-35\x* 
\v 45 mɨrɨpan kon uya tʉnono kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ timamin kon tonpa kʉrʉpo'pomapɨtʉ'pʉ. Mɨrɨ epe'pʉ ke tʉtonpa kon repapɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya i'se iye'to' airɨ.  
\v 46 Wʉi kaisa rɨ to' amʉrapɨtʉ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' pʉ'kʉ ta', tanporo tamʉrapɨ'se to' uta're'tɨpɨtʉ'pʉ tiwʉ' kon tau'ne pori' pe, amʉre' pe pʉra to' usekanpɨtʉ'pʉ.  
\v 47 Papa apurɨpɨtʉ pɨ' to' esi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' esi'pʉ pori' pe to' pɨ'. Wʉi kaisa rɨ Itepuru uya tʉnkoneka'san ke to' tonpa'tɨ'pʉ. 
\c 3  
\s1 Pi'ta Uya Ise'mesa' Epi'tɨ'pʉ 
\p  
\v 1 Tʉron nɨ wʉi a'tai, Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan pokon utɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' ta' ɨpʉreman weyu a'tai, ko'mamʉ pe, 3 a'kʉra'.  
\v 2 Mɨrɨ yau, ka'pon esi'pʉ ise'mesa' iyentu'pʉ si'kɨron nɨ to' napɨtʉnʉ “Akorʉwan Mʉra'ta” tukai' to' nesakʉnʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' pʉrorooi mʉra'ta na'. Mɨrɨ yau, to' uya inonkapɨtʉ'pʉ tʉpʉrataai oton ekama'poto' pe iya ka'pon amʉ' tewonsan pɨ'.  
\v 3 Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan pokon ewontane tʉpʉrataai oton pɨ' to' ekama'po'pʉ iya.  
\v 4 Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan uya to'sa rɨ ene'pʉ. “Apʉne, ina enkɨ,” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya ipɨ',  
\v 5 mɨrɨpan kon ene'pʉ iya, pʉrata ke to' uya tʉrepa tukai'. 
\p  
\v 6 Pi'ta uya ta'pʉ, “Pʉrata pʉra man, e'tane itesa' pe rɨ e'ai'ne' ke ɨrepa uya: Sises Kʉrai Nasare' pon ese' yau, e'mʉ'sa'ka', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ asakɨ,” ta'pʉ iya ise'mesa' pɨ'.  
\v 7 Itenwo'netʉ winɨ itemekon a'si'pʉ iya iye'mʉ'sa'ka tane, mɨrɨpan i'ta ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ipʉrakon amʉ' ena'pʉ pana' pe inke pʉra rɨ.  
\v 8 Mɨrɨpan e'sanʉmʉ'pʉ iye'sara'tɨ'pʉ usarɨn pɨ'. To' a'kɨrɨ iyewomʉ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' ta', iye'sanʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ Papa apurɨpɨtʉ pe.  
\v 9 Tanporo ka'pon amʉ' mɨrɨ yau te'san uya isarɨ ene'pʉ Papa apurɨpɨtʉ pɨ',  
\v 10 mɨrɨpan kʉrɨ rɨ teta'kwanʉnsen tukai' to' ni'tunʉ Akorʉwan Mʉra'ta tato' yau Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' mʉra'ta nau te'sen pe ti'tuse, ipan pe to' usewansiuka'pʉ, iye'ku'sa' na'ne' ipɨ' pɨ'. 
\s1 “Sises Uya Ka'pon Epi'tɨsa',” Ta'pʉ Pi'ta Uya 
\p  
\v 11 Pʉse rɨ si ka'pon uta'sisa' esi'pʉ Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan pokon pɨ', mɨrɨpan ka'pon amʉ' usewansiukasa' eka'tumʉ'pʉ to' piya' Saraman Epa'kato' Iya' tato' ya'.  
\v 12 Ka'pon amʉ' ensa' Pi'ta uya a'tai, ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ', “Utonpa ton, Esuwerʉ amʉ', ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' ɨusewansiukasa' kon serɨ pɨ'? Ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' ina enpɨtʉ auya'nokon? Tʉmeruntɨrʉ kon ke mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Papa pori'manin nan pe tesi kon pɨ' ina uya epi'tɨsa' pen mɨrɨ.  
\v 13 Utamokori kon amʉ' Epʉra'an, Aisi', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Seko' e'to' itese' pɨ'\x - \xo 3:13 \xt E'sotas 3:15\x* Papa uya tʉpoitorʉ Sises ku'sa' eke pe, mɨrɨpan Paire' piya' inee'pʉ auya'nokon iwɨto' pe iya. Inonka tane iya rɨ, ‘Sises i'se pʉra ina man,’ ta'pʉ auya'nokon Paire' pɨ'.  
\v 14 Sises esi'pʉ wakʉ, ipokena' rɨ e'tane, ‘I'se pʉra ina man,’ ta'pʉ auya'nokon. Sises ɨnnonkapai Paire' esi'pʉ, e'tane ka'pon amʉ' wɨpɨ'nin nʉ'pʉ enna'pʉ auya'nokon inonkato' pe iya.\x - \xo 3:14 \xt Ma'siu 27:15-23; Ma' 15:6-14; Ʉru' 23:13-23; Isaan 19:12-15\x* 
\v 15 Inke ka'pon amʉ' uko'manto' sara'tɨnin nʉ'pʉ wɨnɨ'pʉ auya'nokon e'tane, Papa uya i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ iyeri'sa' apai. Ina esi serɨ ennin nʉ'san pe mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ekamanin nan pe.  
\v 16 Ina mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ pʉse rɨ ka'pon uya Sises apurɨ uriya' pʉse rɨ e'mʉ'sa'kasa' pana' pe. Sises apurɨ ina uya uriya', pʉse rɨ ise'mesa' usepi'tɨsa' tanporon kon pe menyatʉi'ne'. 
\p  
\v 17 “Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itepuru ton uya serɨ kupʉ'pʉ Sises pɨ' ɨnkupʉnʉ kon i'tu auya'nokon pʉra iyesi pɨ'.  
\v 18 E'tane pʉra rɨ, Papa uya pu'kena' amʉ' auro'kasa' rʉ'pʉ pena rɨ awɨrɨ serɨ e'kupʉ'pʉ, pʉse rɨ Kʉrai\f + \fr 3:18 \fq Kʉrai, \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq Me'saya—Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe; v. 20 airɨ rɨ marɨ.\f* ekota'mato' oton tawon.  
\v 19 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', amakooi kon inonkatɨ', Papa winɨkʉi' era'tɨtɨ'. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Papa usentu'ma ɨpɨ'nokon uya tanporo amakooi kon korʉkato' pe. Mɨrɨ a'tai, wakʉ pe rɨ Papa uya ɨmeruntɨtanʉkʉ kon mɨrɨ,  
\v 20 mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Kʉrai, Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ ennoko iya mɨrɨ—Sises rɨ.  
\v 21 Pʉse rɨ Sises si e'to' oton Epʉn po Papa uya tanporon koneka emenna' pe pona rɨ, pena rɨ tʉusaurokʉ'pʉ kasa wakʉ ton pu'kena' amʉ' yai.  
\v 22 Apʉne pʉra Mosi' uya ekama'pʉ, ‘Papa, Itepuru uya pu'kena', uwaraino anʉnto' oton ɨtonpa kon nɨ. Tanporon inekamanʉ main awɨrɨ me'tʉi'.  
\v 23 Kʉrɨ rɨ si pu'kena' maimu awɨron pen esi a'tai, Papa uya ima'tanʉ'to' oton tʉmunkɨ amʉ' koro'tapai,’\f + \fr 3:23 \ft Isu'taronomi 18:15, 18-19\f*” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya to' pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 24 Miyarɨ rɨ Pi'ta usaurokʉ'pʉ, “Serɨ pe si ne'ku'ai'ne' esi penaro' rɨ tanporon kon pu'kena' amʉ' nekama'pʉ Sanwerʉ esi'pʉ si'kɨrɨ rɨ.  
\v 25 Papa uya ta'pʉ rʉ'pʉ atamokori kon pɨ' pu'kena' amʉ' awɨrɨ tʉnku'ton kuru pɨ'. To' uya si eporo'pʉ, ɨmɨrɨ'nokon uya rɨ nɨrɨ kanan eporo. Epʉra'an auro'ka'pʉ Papa uya i'tutɨ': ‘Tanporon kon ka'pon amʉ' pʉrema uya mɨrɨ apayan nʉ'san poro,’\f + \fr 3:25 \ft Iseneses 22:18; 26:4\f* tasa' iya rʉ'pʉ,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 26 Te'nonka pe, Pi'ta uya ta'pʉ, “Papa uya, tʉron kon piya' ennoko tʉuya wapiya kuru, tʉni'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ, tʉpoitorʉ ennoko'pʉ ɨpiya'nokon, ɨpʉrema kon pe, ɨri ɨyeseru kon tʉnonkai' ɨwesi kon pa,” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya to' pɨ'. 
\c 4  
\s1 Pi'ta Mɨrɨ Awonsi'kɨ Isaan Esi'pʉ Konsʉrʉ Amʉ' Piyau 
\p  
\v 1 Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan, Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' erasu ton epuru, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Satu'si amʉ' uyee'pʉ, Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan pokon nɨ marɨ usaurokʉ koro'tau.  
\v 2 Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' usakorota'pʉ se kasa iyesi pɨ', asa'ron kon enno'sa' kon uya ka'pon amʉ' enupa esi'pʉ Sises e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ pɨ' teri'sa' apai. Serɨ enta', iyeri'sa' kon e'mʉ'sa'ka ekamanin pe.  
\v 3 Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan a'si'pʉ to' uya pariki'si ta'; pata uko'mansa' pɨ', tʉron nɨ wʉi emakʉ pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ.  
\v 4 E'tane tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' uya itekare etaka'sa' esi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon uya apurɨ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon e'tonpa'tɨsa' esi'pʉ 5,000 kaisa rɨ. 
\p  
\v 5 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Main pɨ' enupanin nan amʉra'pʉ Surusiran pona.  
\v 6 Mɨrɨ yau, Anas, Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru pe te'sen esi'pʉ, Kaya'pas a'kɨrɨ te'san, Isaan, Arisanta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon nɨ esi'pʉ itepuru tonpa ton pe te'san.  
\v 7 Tʉpiya'nokon Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan nepʉ'pʉ to' uya to' ekama'popɨ'to' pe tʉuya'nokon, “Nai kasa ikupʉ'pʉ auya'nokon? Ɨnʉ' meruntɨrʉ yau, ɨnʉ' ese' yau ikupʉ'pʉ auya'nokon?” tukai'. 
\p  
\v 8 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Pi'ta, uta'kwarʉ'tɨsa' Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke uya ta'pʉ to' pɨ', “Eke ton ka'pon amʉ' epuru ton,  
\v 9 serɨ pe ina ekama'po auya'nokon ise'mesa' epi'tɨsa' ina uya pɨ', ɨ'rɨ kasa isepi'tɨsa' tukai'.  
\v 10 Serɨ i'tutɨ' ɨmiyamoro ka'pon amʉ' Esuwerʉ amʉ'; Nasare' pon, Sises ese' uya pʉse rɨ warawo' epi'tɨsa' e'mʉ'sa'kasa' esi ɨpiyau'nokon. Ɨnpokapɨtʉ'pʉ kon kurusu' pona iyeri'to' pe i'mʉ'sa'kasa' Papa uya.  
\v 11 Papa Maimu uya tasa' na'ne' Sises pɨ', 
\q1 “‘Serɨ tɨ' ɨmɨrɨ'nokon amɨnin nan newaruma'tɨ'pʉ 
\q2 enasa' man amɨnin nan uya amɨto' apon pe kuru,’\f + \fr 4:11 \ft Eren 118:22\f* 
\m tasa'.  
\v 12 Makooi apai epika'tɨn nɨto' e'seposa' Sises poro rɨken, tanporo serɨ non po ɨnʉ' rɨ Papa nʉtʉrʉ'pʉ pika'tɨnin wannɨ pe pʉra rɨ iyesi mɨrɨ,” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya. 
\p  
\v 13 Itepuru ton usewansiuka'pʉ, ɨpiyɨ'ke' pe pʉra Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan ene tʉuya'nokon pɨ' sepa' nan nɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ isenupasa' kon pen nɨ, e'tane to' uya to' to'ka'nʉkʉ'pʉ Sises a'kɨron kon nʉ'san pe.  
\v 14 E'tane si ka'pon to' nepi'tɨ'pʉ e'mʉ'sa'kasa' ene'pʉ to' uya to' piyau. Mɨrɨ a'tai, ɨ'rɨ rɨ tato' to' uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan pɨ'.  
\v 15 Konsʉrʉ amʉ' uya to' enpa'ka'pʉ tiwʉ' kon tapai, mɨrɨpan kon e'sara'tɨ'pʉ usauro'nɨ pɨ' tʉtonpa kon amʉ' pokon pe,  
\v 16 “Ɨ'rɨ pe to' kupʉ serɨ, tanporon kon Surusiran po tʉuko'mansan uya rɨ tanporo to' nʉkupʉ'pʉ i'tu, mɨrɨpan wapu'tɨ poken pʉra iyesi.  
\v 17 E'tane serɨ ereutanʉ'pai iyesi iye'ta'nʉ'kapʉ wapiya ka'pon amʉ' koro'tawɨrɨ. To' enari'papai'nokon, mɨrɨ entakasa' auya'nokon a'tai ɨkota'ma kon mɨrɨ tukai',” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 18 Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' kanan kɨ'makaa'pʉ to' uya. Ta'pʉ to' uya to' pɨ', “Serɨ tʉpo ɨnʉ' rɨ kʉsauro'katʉu, kʉsenupatʉu Sises ese' pɨ',” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 19 E'tane Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan pokon uya to' maimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon pe i'tutɨ', ipoken pe' ɨwesi kon Papa enu yau, amaimu kon awɨrɨ e'nɨ yau Papa Maimu tentakai'?  
\v 20 Ina e'pakapʉ poken pʉra man ina nene'pʉ ton, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ina neta'pʉ ekamato' tʉuya'nokon piyapai,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 21 Ipan pe to' enari'pa tʉuya'nokon tʉpo, Konsʉrʉ amʉ' uya to' nonka'pʉ. Nai kasa to' kota'mato' tʉuya'nokon tukai' to' uya i'tu pʉra rɨ iyesi'pʉ, apʉne pʉra tanporon kon uya rɨ Papa apurɨpɨtʉ pɨ' iye'ku'sa' rʉ'pʉ pɨ'.  
\v 22 Warawo' isepi'tɨsa' na'ne' esi'pʉ 40 kaisaron entaino rɨ iwʉipiyaai. \fig “Serɨ tʉpo ɨnʉ' rɨ kʉsauro'katʉu, kʉsenupatʉu Sises ese' pɨ'!”|src="CN01901B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 4:1-22" copy="David C. Cook" ref="4:18" \fig* 
\s1 Pi'ta Mɨrɨ Awonsi'kɨ Isaan Pokon Ɨpʉrema'pʉ 
\p  
\v 23 Tʉnonkasa' kon a'tai, Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan enna'po'pʉ tʉtonpa kon amʉ' koro'ta', ekamase'na tanporon nɨ use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton eke ton kuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itepuru ton uya ta'pʉ tʉpɨ'nokon nʉ'pʉ.  
\v 24 Serɨ etasa' tʉuya'nokon a'tai, to' ɨpʉrema'pʉ ɨsewan ya' tenai' Papa pɨ'. “Itepuru, Ɨmɨrɨ nʉkoneka'pʉ Epʉn mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ non mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ parau mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporon nɨ mɨrɨ yawon.\x - \xo 4:24 \xt E'sotas 20:11; Ne'imaya 9:6; Eren 146:6\x* 
\v 25 Ausaurokʉ'pʉ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ awɨrɨ ina tamokori, ɨpoitorʉ Tepi' poro rɨ, se kasa tukai': 
\q1 “‘Ɨ'rɨ pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen usakorota; 
\q2 ɨ'rɨ pɨ' ka'pon amʉ' e'kama, epoton kon kasa rɨ? 
\q1  
\v 26 Kin amʉ' e'kama, 
\q2 mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ non esanon nɨ amʉra ɨsipokon pe, 
\q2 Papa, Itepuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ inanʉmʉ'pʉ, Kʉrai\f + \fr 4:26 \fq Kʉrai \ft (Kiri' maimu yau), mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq Me'saya \ft (Ipuru maimu yau), asa'rɨ rɨ marɨ iyesi, \fq Papa Nanʉmʉnʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe.\f* ewa'nomase'na,’\f + \fr 4:26 \ft Eren 2:1-2\f* 
\m tukai'.  
\v 27 I'napai rɨ Era' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ kopʉna Ponsiyas Paire' pokon amʉra'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen ka'pon amʉ' Esuwerʉ pon kon pokon pe serɨ pata yau, wakʉ ayapiyo' Sises ananʉmʉ'pʉ ewa'noma pɨ' te'to' kon pe ekonekai'.\x - \xo 4:27 \xt Ma'siu 27:1-2; Ma' 15:1; Ʉru' 23:1; Isaan 18:28-29\x* 
\v 28 To' amʉrasa' tanporon nɨ ɨmeruntɨrʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨyeseru awɨrɨ iye'ku'to' pe ɨnkupʉ'pʉ ku'se'na.  
\v 29 Mɨrɨpan, serɨ pe si enkɨ, Papa: ina enari'pa to' uya; ina, ɨpoitorʉ ton iku'kɨ wakʉ pe, tepiyɨ'se pʉra amaimu ekamato' pe ina uya.  
\v 30 Ɨyemiyatʉ tɨnkai' rɨ usepi'tɨn iku'kɨ, tɨwɨ i'tuto' ipɨkɨrɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ a'kwarʉpɨ'nin nɨrɨ iku'kɨ, wakʉ ɨpoitorʉ Sises ese' yau,” tukai' to' ɨpʉrema'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 31 Tʉwɨpʉrema kon tʉpo, to' e'nonkasa' a'tai, to' e'to' yau usi'ki'ma'pʉ. Tanporo to' uta'kwarʉ'tɨ'pʉ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke, mɨrɨpan kon uya Papa Maimu ekama'pʉ tepiyɨ'se pʉra. 
\s1 Sises Apurɨnin Nan Esi'pʉ Amʉre' Ton Pen 
\p  
\v 32 Sises apurɨnin nan esi'pʉ tikin nɨ rɨ isenuminkato', tikin nɨ rɨ itewan. Ɨnʉ' uya rɨ uiwano' serɨ ta pʉra rɨ, e'tane tiwano' kon ke rɨ te'repasan pe to' esi'pʉ.\x - \xo 4:32 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 2:44-45\x* 
\v 33 Meruntɨ pe kuru esii'ma enno'sa' kon uya Itepuru Sises e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ terikʉ'pʉ apai ekama'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon pona eke pe rɨ wakʉ nonkasa' tanporo to' pona.  
\v 34 Ɨnʉ' rɨ tekota'masen kuru rɨ pʉra iyesi'pʉ to' koro'tau, kamoro tʉmainarʉ ke, tiwʉ' ke rɨ te'san uya ikʉrʉpo'pomapɨtʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan epe'pʉ rʉ'pʉ ne'pɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya  
\v 35 enno'sa' kon ena', mɨrɨpan ekanpɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya to' kaisa rɨ ipʉra kuru to' esi pɨ' tense. 
\p  
\v 36 Mɨrɨ kasa si, Isose' esi'pʉ mɨrɨ, Ripai pa rʉ'pʉ pe te'sen, Sai'pʉras po iyentusa' rʉ'pʉ, Panapas tukai' enno'sa' kon nesakʉnʉ (Pori'mapɨ'nin ta e'kwa pe).  
\v 37 Tʉmainarʉ kʉrʉpo'poma'pʉ iya, mɨrɨpan epe'pʉ nee'pʉ iya enno'sa' kon ena'. 
\c 5  
\s1 Ananayas, Ino'pʉ Sa'paira 
\p  
\v 1 Ananayas, ino'pʉ Sa'paira uya kanan tʉnono kon kʉrʉpo'poma'pʉ.  
\v 2 Itepe'pʉ tonpa'ka'pʉ to' uya tʉno'pʉ ya' rɨ esii'ma tiwano' kon pe iye'to' pe, mɨrɨpan tonpa'pʉ nee'pʉ iya enno'sa' kon ena'.  
\v 3 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Pi'ta uya ta'pʉ, “Ananayas, ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' ɨri rɨ Se'tan\f + \fr 5:3 \fq Se'tan\ft —Makoi ese' isakon, \fq Papa eseru ewaruma'tɨnin \ft ta e'kwa pe.\f* ewonsa' ɨyewan ya', kasi pe rɨ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ enku'tɨ pa, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itonpa rɨ kupʉ'pʉ esii'ma ɨpiyau?  
\v 4 Ikʉrʉpo'poma auya wapiya pe' ɨiwano' pe iyesi'pʉ pen mɨrɨ? Mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ikʉrʉpo'poma tʉpo, itepe'pʉ esi'pʉ ɨiwano' pe pen nɨ pe' mɨrɨ? Ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' tʉku'sen pen nɨ kupʉ'pʉ auya? Ka'pon amʉ' pɨ' pe' kasi pe ɨwe'sa' pe ekama auya e'tane, kasi pe ɨwe'sa' Papa pɨ',” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 5 Serɨ etasa' tʉuya a'tai, Ananayas uta'mo'ka'pʉ eke' pe, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ipan pe rɨ serɨ etanin nʉ'san enari'nʉmʉ'pʉ iye'ku'sa' rʉ'pʉ pɨ'.\x - \xo 5:5 \xt Susana 55\x* 
\v 6 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, moine ton warawo' amʉ' uyee'pʉ itekepu ontɨse'na, mɨrɨpan enpa'ka'pʉ to' uya iu'na'tɨto' pe tʉuya'nokon. 
\p  
\v 7 Osorʉwau ite'kwa kʉra' emiya era'tɨsa' tʉpo'ne rɨ, ino'pʉ uyee'pʉ, ɨ'rɨ e'ku'sa' tukai' i'tu iya pʉra iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 8 Pi'ta uya ekama'po'pʉ, “Serɨ rɨken pe' Ananayas ya' ɨnono kon epe'pʉ pe ɨneporo'pʉ kon?” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p “Ewai', mɨrɨ rɨken itepe'pʉ,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 9 Pi'ta uya ta'pʉ ipɨ', “Ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' Itepuru A'kwarʉ i'tupɨtʉ kon pa ɨyekoneka'pʉ kon?” ta'pʉ iya. “Apʉne enkɨ, ataan'pʉ u'na'tɨnin nʉ'san nɨ marɨ esi moro mʉra'ta nau, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' uya rɨ marɨ ɨyenpa'ka mɨrɨ,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 10 Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, ipiyau ita'mo'ka'pʉ eke' pe, mɨrɨpan moine ton warawo' amʉ' ewomʉ'pʉ itekepu ekare pɨ'. Itekepu arɨ'pʉ to' uya iu'na'tɨto' pe itaan'pʉ piyau rɨ.  
\v 11 Mɨrɨ pɨ', ipan pe rɨ Sises apurɨnin nan mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporon kon serɨ etanin nʉ'san enari'nʉmʉ'pʉ. 
\s1 Enno'sa' Kon Uya E'ne' Ton Epi'tɨ'pʉ 
\p  
\v 12 Enno'sa' kon uya tu'kan nɨ i'tuto' ipɨkɨrɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ a'kwarʉpɨ'nin kupʉ'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' koro'tau, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporon kon Sises apurɨnin nan pe te'san esi'pʉ pʉroroi po, Saraman Epa'kato' Iya' tato' tau.  
\v 13 Tanporon kon nɨ esi'pʉ ɨpiyɨ'ke' pe to' koro'ta' enapai pʉra, ka'pon amʉ' uya ipan pe rɨ to' nama tane.  
\v 14 Mɨrɨ koro'tau rɨ, tu'kan kon warawoti'si amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ uri'sami'si amʉ' uya rɨ Itepuru apurɨ'pʉ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' tonpa pe to' era'tɨ'pʉ.  
\v 15 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ka'pon amʉ' uya e'ne' ton nepʉ'pʉ, asanta ta' to' nonka'pʉ to' uya to' e'kwe' po'ne to' apon po'ne rɨ, Pi'ta utɨ a'kwarʉ'pʉ uya rɨ to' epi'tɨto' pe.  
\v 16 Anpisin ka'pon amʉ' Surusiran woi tʉuko'mansan uya e'ne' ton, makoi a'kwarʉ yen ton nɨ nee'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon usepi'tɨ'pʉ. 
\s1 Enno'sa' Kon Ekota'ma'pʉ 
\p  
\v 17 Mɨrɨpan Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporon kon iya'kɨrɨ te'san Satu'si amʉ' tonpa ton ɨkɨntato' esi'pʉ ipan pe to' pɨ'.  
\v 18 To' uya enno'sa' kon a'si'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon uya to' tʉrʉ'pʉ pariki'si ta'.  
\v 19 E'tane ewarupɨ nau, Papa inserʉʉi uya pariki'si mʉra'taai a'koka'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya to' enpa'ka'pʉ.  
\v 20 “Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' ta' entantɨ', ka'pon amʉ' pɨ' tanporo serɨ main ekamatantɨ' emenna' pe uko'man nɨto' ekareei,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 21 Pata ema'sa' a'tai, to' ewomʉ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' ta' tauro'ka'pʉ kon awɨrɨ rɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' e'sara'tɨ'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' enupa pɨ'. 
\p Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itonpa ton uye'sa' a'tai, Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton kɨ'ma'pʉ to' uya—tanporo Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton—to' amʉrato' pe. To' uya Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' erasu pe te'san ennoko'pʉ pariki'si ta' a'sisa' rʉ'san enpa'kase'na.  
\v 22 E'tane to' utɨsa' pariki'si ta' a'tai, to' eporo to' uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ. Mɨrɨ pɨ' to' enna'po'pʉ ɨsekamase'na,  
\v 23 “A'kopɨ'sa' pe kuru rɨ pariki'si eporo'pʉ ina uya iterasu ton nɨ e'soto'pɨ'sa' esi'pʉ mʉra'ta nau, e'tane ina uya a'kokasa' a'tai, ɨnʉ' pʉra iyesi'pʉ itau,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 24 Serɨ tawon eta tʉuya a'tai, Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' erasu ton epuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' epuru ton usenu'mere'ma'pʉ mɨrɨ, “Ɨ'rɨ rɨ si e'kupʉ'pʉ serɨ ko? Ɨ'rɨ pe to' esi'pʉ?” tukai'. 
\p  
\v 25 Mɨrɨpan e'tane, ka'pon uyee'pʉ, “Apʉne entɨ', pariki'si ta' ana'si'pʉ kon amʉ' e'soto'pɨ'sa' use'man nɨto', ɨpʉreman nɨto' iwʉ' tau ka'pon amʉ' enupa pɨ',” tase'na.  
\v 26 Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, erasu ton epuru utɨ'pʉ tʉtonpa ton pokon pe enno'sa' kon ne'se'na. To' ta'kwarʉkai' to' ɨnne'pai pʉra to' esi'pʉ, apʉne pʉra ka'pon amʉ' uya tʉwɨnɨ kon tɨ' ke tukai' to' usenari'pa'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 27 Enno'sa' kon nepʉ'pʉ to' uya Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton piya', Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru uya to' ekama'popɨ'to' pe.  
\v 28 “E'se'ne' pe ina uya ta'pʉ ɨpɨ'nokon, ‘Sises ese' pɨ' ka'pon amʉ' kʉsenupatʉu,’ ta'pʉ e'tane rɨ, pata Surusiran emʉ' wɨsa' auya'nokon enupan nɨto' auya'nokon ike ke mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉmakooi ke ina esi pʉse rɨ mʉnʉ uriya' ta auya'nokon,”\x - \xo 5:28 \xt Ma'siu 27:25\x* ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 29 Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itonpa ton uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Papa Maimu awɨrɨ ina e'to' pe iyesi, ka'pon maimu awɨrɨ pen.  
\v 30 Papa, ina tamokori ton e'to' itese' pɨ', Sises i'mʉ'sa'kanin nʉ'pʉ iyeri'sa' apai ɨnwɨnɨ'pʉ kon tʉpokapɨ'se yʉi pona.  
\v 31 Papa uya i'mʉ'sa'kasa' tenwo'netʉ winɨ, iku'sa' iya esa' wannɨ pe mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ pika'tɨnin pe, Esuwerʉ amʉ' ra'tɨnin pe, to' makooi pɨ' isentu'ma ke.  
\v 32 Serɨ e'kupʉ ennin nʉ'san ina, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ uya rɨ nɨrɨ ene'pʉ, Papa nʉtʉrʉ'pʉ tʉmaimu awɨron kon ena',” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 33 Serɨ eta tʉuya'nokon a'tai, ipan pe rɨ to' usakorota'pʉ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' rɨ ɨnwɨpai to' ena'pʉ,  
\v 34 e'tane Pari'si, Main pɨ' enupanin nan tonpa, Kamariyerʉ itese', ka'pon amʉ' nʉnamanʉ rɨ e'soto'ka'pʉ to' piya', “Apʉne rʉ'kwɨ, kamoro warawo' amʉ' enpa'katɨ' aka'ne' pe,” ka'se'na.  
\v 35 Mɨrɨpan uya to' auro'ka'pʉ, “Esuwerʉ amʉ', ɨnkupʉnʉ kon ti'tui' e'tɨ' pʉsamoro ka'pon amʉ' pɨ'.  
\v 36 Pena sa'ne Tiyotas itese' ka'pon esi'pʉ ɨnʉ' pe rɨ e'kupʉ i'se. Tu'kan kon nɨ ka'pon amʉ', 400 kaisaron kon era'tɨ'pʉ ipoitorʉ pe. Iwɨnɨ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan poitorʉ ton nʉ'san e'ta'nʉkʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨ'rɨ pʉra rɨ iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 37 Kʉrɨ rɨ e'ma'pʉ ta', Isutas, Kiyarari ko' kanan esi'pʉ, ka'pon amʉ' ese' menukapɨ'to' a'tai, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ka'pon amʉ' kanan anin pe iyesi'pʉ. Kʉrɨ rɨ kanan wɨnɨ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan poitorʉ rʉ'san e'ta'nʉkʉ'pʉ.  
\v 38 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', serɨ pe na'ne' pɨ' kapai e'ai' ɨpɨ'nokon: tɨwɨ pʉsamoro warawo' amʉ' nesii; tɨwɨ to' nʉtɨi. Serɨ te'ku'sen esi a'tai ka'pon eseru pe, iye'kupʉ pʉra iyesi mɨrɨ.  
\v 39 E'tane Papa winon pe iyesi a'tai, ɨnʉ' uya rɨ pʉsamoro ereutanʉkʉ pʉra rɨ iyesi. Papa ewa'noma auya'nokon pe rɨ iye'to' oton,”\x - \xo 5:39 \xt 2 Ma'kapis 7:19\x* ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 40 Serɨ ta iya pɨ', “Ewai' rɨ ka'wa,” ta'pʉ to' uya. Enno'sa' kon kɨ'ma'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon ari'po'pɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon uya ta'pʉ to' pɨ', “Sises ese' yau kasauro'tʉu serɨ tʉpo,” ta'pʉ to' uya. To' utɨto' pe to' nonka'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 41 Enno'sa' kon utɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton piyapai. Pori' pe to' esi'pʉ, apʉne pʉra Papa pona wakʉ pe rɨ iyesi pɨ' to' ekota'ma Sises ese' wenai.  
\v 42 Mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ wʉi kaisarɨ rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' tau, ka'pon amʉ' iwʉ' tau'ne tereutai' pʉra rɨ, Sises pɨ' to' enupa pɨ' to' esi'pʉ, wakʉ itekare ekama pɨ' to' esi'pʉ, Sises esi Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ, tukai'. 
\c 6  
\s1 7 Kaisaron Kon Utanʉmʉ'pʉ 
\p  
\v 1 Mɨrɨ a'tai, tu'ke rɨ Sises apurɨnin nan tu'kanoro epirikʉ'pʉ. Kiri' pe tʉusauro'san Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ patawon amʉ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' pokon pe to' e'manenpato' esi'pʉ, kiyari ke tʉtonpa kon uri'sami'si amʉ' itaan'pʉ ima'tasa' kon ɨnɨ to' uya pɨ'.  
\v 2 Mɨrɨ pɨ' si ka'pon amʉ' amʉranʉkʉ'pʉ 12 kaisaron kon uya tanporon kon Sises apurɨnin nan, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ta'pʉ to' uya, “Iye'to' pe pʉra iyesi mɨrɨ upona'nokon Papa Maimu tekamai' pʉra tʉron nɨ pɨ' e'nɨ a'tai usekan nɨ pɨ' rɨ.  
\v 3 Utonpa ton, 7 kaisaron kon ka'pon amʉ' epotɨ' ɨ'koro'tapai'nokon, i'tunin nan pe kuru ka'pon amʉ' ni'tunʉ ton, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke ita'kwarʉ'tɨsa' kon, serɨ i'se e'nɨto' tʉrawasomanin pe te'ton kon,  
\v 4 ɨpʉreman pɨ' parɨ ina e'to' pe ka'pon amʉ' enupa pɨ' Papa Maimu ke,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 5 Tanporon kon epori'ma'pʉ enno'sa' kon maimu pɨ', mɨrɨpan kon uya si Si'tipʉn anʉmʉ'pʉ Papa Maimu apurɨnin ye' kuru, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ yen; Piri' rɨ kanan to' tonpa pe; tʉron kon Pʉro'koras; Ni'kanorʉ; Timon; Parʉmenas; Ne'koras, Antiyo' winon, iyera'tɨsa' rʉ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' tonpa pe.  
\v 6 To' uya si pʉsamoro anʉnsa' kon nʉ'san tʉrʉ'pʉ enno'sa' kon piya', to' pʉremato' pe si to' uya, tʉtʉrawasooi kon si ku'to' pe to' uya. 
\p  
\v 7 Mɨrɨpan Papa Maimu usekama'pʉ miyarɨ rɨ tu'kan kon pɨ' rɨ tu'ke rɨ Sises apurɨnin nan tu'kanoro epirikʉ'pʉ Surusiran po. Use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan nɨ era'tɨ'pʉ tu'ke kuru rɨ Sises uya enupan nɨto' awɨrɨ te'to' kon pe. 
\s1 Si'tipʉn A'si'pʉ To' Uya 
\p  
\v 8 Si'tipʉn, eke rɨ Papa uya wakʉ nonkasa' esa' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉmeruntɨrʉ kenan uya, eke pe rɨ a'kwarʉpɨ'nin mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ i'tuto' ipɨkɨrɨ rɨ kupʉ'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' koro'tau.  
\v 9 E'tane tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' tau te'san tonpa ton Inonkasa' Kon tukai' tesa'san, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pe rɨ te'san, Sairini mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Arisantiriya winon kon ena'pʉ ewa'noma pɨ'. Kamoro mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' Siri'siya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Eisa Mʉre'pʉ winon kon pokon pe te'sepose Si'tipʉn pokon pe to' e'sei'pɨtʉ'pʉ.  
\v 10 E'tane ipoken pʉra rɨ iyesi tato' ipɨkɨrɨ pʉra rɨ iyesi'pʉ, apʉne pʉra isaurokʉ pɨ' i'tunin pe kuru Iya'kwarʉ uya iku'sa' ke. 
\p  
\v 11 Mɨrɨpan kon uya ama'ai ka'pon amʉ' anʉmʉ'pʉ eseru'tɨnin nan pe, “Si'tipʉn eta'pʉ ina uya Mosi' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Papa sapema pe rɨ isaurokʉ'pʉ,” taton kon. 
\p  
\v 12 Mɨrɨpan kon uya ka'pon amʉ', Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Main pɨ' enupanin nan nɨ tʉrʉnka'pʉ. To' uya Si'tipʉn a'si'pʉ, mɨrɨpan nepʉ'pʉ to' uya Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton piya'.  
\v 13 To' uya kasi pe rɨ Si'tipʉn eseru'tɨsa' tʉuya'nokon nʉ'pʉ ekama'pʉ Konsʉrʉ amʉ' pɨ'. “Iyereuta pʉra rɨ pʉse rɨ usauro'nɨ pɨ' man ɨri pe use'man nɨto', ɨpʉreman nɨto' iwʉ' pɨ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Main, Mosi' winon pɨ'.  
\v 14 Ina uya etasa' man ta iya pʉse rɨ Sises, Nasare' pon uya serɨ pata ma'tanʉkʉ tawon. Mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ensima iya uko'man nɨ eseru Mosi' nʉtʉrʉ'pʉ uyena'nokon,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 15 Tanporo ense'na iyamʉrasa' kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton iwʉ' ta' uya enpɨtʉ'pʉ itemʉ' poi rɨ, mɨrɨpan kon uya itemʉ' ene'pʉ inserʉ emʉ' kasa rɨ. 
\c 7  
\s1 Si'tipʉn Uya Esuwerʉ Amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi Ton Auro'ka'pʉ 
\p  
\v 1 Mɨrɨ a'tai, use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru uya Si'tipʉn ekama'po'pʉ, “I'napai rɨ pe' ka'pon amʉ' nʉsauro'ai'ne' ɨpɨ' esi?” tukai'. 
\p  
\v 2 Si'tipʉn uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon, tʉnamasan itepuru ton, apʉne etatɨ'. Papa usenpoika'pʉ Epʉra'an piya' Me'sa'po'temiya po Eran pona itɨ rawɨrɨ.  
\v 3 ‘Apata'se' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨtonpa ton inɨnkɨ, itɨkɨ mɨrɨ non sekamayai'ne' ya',’\f + \fr 7:3 \ft Iseneses 12:1\f* ta'pʉ Papa uya ipɨ'. 
\p  
\v 4 “Mɨrɨpan uya Karʉtiya pon kon nɨmɨ'pʉ. Eran po iyepatama'pʉ. Ikʉipʉnʉ uma'ta'pʉ tʉpo, Papa uya ennoko'pʉ serɨ mʉko'manyatʉi'ne' ya'.\x - \xo 7:4 \xt Iseneses 11:31; 12:4\x* 
\v 5 E'tane intʉrʉnʉ pe te'sen itimamin tʉsa' iya pʉra iyesi'pʉ, e'tane Papa usaurokʉ'pʉ iku'to' pe uya tukai', ‘Ɨmɨrɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ apayan nʉ'san, Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya non epoto' oton.’ Mɨrɨ a'tai, imʉre pʉra Epʉra'an esi'pʉ.\x - \xo 7:5 \xt Iseneses 12:7; 13:15; 15:18; 17:8\x* 
\v 6 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Papa usaurokʉ'pʉ, ‘Apayan nʉ'san, Esuwerʉ amʉ' e'to' oton ka'kʉran pe tʉron kon pata yau. Mɨrɨ yau, tapiyo' kon pe to' e'tane, to' kota'mato' oton to' uya 400 kaisa rɨ wʉipiya,  
\v 7 e'tane urɨ uya mɨrɨ eke pata kota'mato' oton. To' epa'kato' oton mɨrɨ eke pata yapai, serɨ pata ya' uyapurɨpɨ'se'na,’\f + \fr 7:7 \ft Iseneses 15:13-14; E'sotas 3:12\f* ta'pʉ Papa uya.  
\v 8 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Papa uya Epʉra'an auro'ka'pʉ tanporo warawo' amʉ' uya tʉyun kon pi'pɨ puturʉkapɨ'to' pe, tʉmunkɨ pe to' esi ekamanin pe. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Aisi', Epʉra'an mu entu'pʉ, 8 kaisa rɨ wʉi tʉpo, itun pi'pɨ puturʉka'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Aisi' mu, Seko' entu'pʉ, mɨrɨpan yun pi'pɨ puturʉka'pʉ iya. Seko' uya nɨrɨ 12 kaisaron kon tʉmunkɨ amʉ' yun pi'pɨ puturʉkapɨtʉ'pʉ.\x - \xo 7:8 \xt Iseneses 17:10-14; 21:2-4; 25:26; 29:31—35:18\x* 
\p  
\v 9 “Isose' esi'pʉ to' tonpa pe. Irunan nɨ ɨkɨnta'pʉ Isose' pɨ', mɨrɨpan kon uya ikʉrʉpo'poma'pʉ Isi' yawon kon poitorʉ pe. E'tane Papa esi'pʉ iya'kɨrɨ,\x - \xo 7:9 \xt Iseneses 37:11-28; 39:2, 21\x* 
\v 10 mɨrɨpan uya ipika'tɨ'pʉ tanporo ewankamanin apai. Isose' repa'pʉ iya ipu'ketʉ ke, mɨrɨpan uya iku'sa' esi'pʉ wakʉ pe kin Peero ewakiri pe. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Peero uya Isose' kupʉ'pʉ tanporo Isi' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉpata'se' epuru pe.\x - \xo 7:10 \xt Iseneses 41:39-41\x* 
\p  
\v 11 “Mɨrɨ a'tai, iwankan uta'mo'ka'pʉ tanporo Isi' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Kenan pata pona. Mɨrɨ a'tai, ka'pon amʉ' apʉ'kaa'pʉ iwan pɨ', utamokori kon amʉ' rɨ enta'nato' ipɨ' pʉra iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya eke rɨ ewankamanin nee'pʉ.\x - \xo 7:11 \xt Iseneses 42:1-2\x* 
\v 12 Seko' uya eta'pʉ, ‘Kiyari esi Isi' po,’ tawon, mɨrɨpan uya tʉmunkɨ amʉ', utamokori kon amʉ' ennoko'pʉ kiyari ennase'na.  
\v 13 Iyakon ite'kwa pe to' utɨsa' a'tai, Isose' usekama'pʉ tʉrui ton pɨ'. Mɨrɨ a'tai si, Peero uya Isose' tonpa ton i'tu'pʉ mɨrɨ.\x - \xo 7:13 \xt Iseneses 45:1-16\x* 
\v 14 Serɨ tʉpo, Isose' uya tʉmaimu ennoko'pʉ tʉkʉipʉnʉ uye'to' pe tanporo tʉtonpa ton pokon pe Isi' pona. 75 kaisa rɨ tanporo to' esi'pʉ.\x - \xo 7:14 \xt Iseneses 45:9-10, 17-18; 46:27\x* 
\v 15 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Seko' utɨ'pʉ Isi' pona, mɨrɨpan uma'ta'pʉ. Imunkɨ amʉ' rɨ nɨrɨ uma'tapɨtʉ'pʉ mɨrɨ yau.\x - \xo 7:15 \xt Iseneses 46:1-7; 49:33\x* 
\v 16 To' ekepu nee'pʉ to' uya Si'ken pona, mɨrɨpan kon u'na'tɨpɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya Epʉra'an ne'ma'pʉ yau Amorʉ munkɨ amʉ' winɨ, Si'ken po.\x - \xo 7:16 \xt Iseneses 23:3-16; 33:19; 50:7-13; Isa'suwa 24:32\x* 
\p  
\v 17 “A'ko pe iweyu uyepʉ koro'tau, Papa uya tʉusaurokʉ'pʉ ku'to' pe Epʉra'an pɨ', tu'ke kuru utonpa kon amʉ' epansa' esi'pʉ.  
\v 18 Mɨrɨ a'tai, tʉron nɨ kin, Isose' i'tunin pen ena'pʉ Isi' epuru pe.\x - \xo 7:18 \xt E'sotas 1:7-8\x* 
\v 19 Kʉrɨ rɨ e'kupʉ'pʉ to' wanmʉra ɨri pe to' ma'tanʉkʉ pɨ', urɨ'nokon tamokori ton kota'ma'pʉ to' uya. To' apiyo'ma'pʉ to' uya tentusan mʉre amʉ' eno'mato' pe to' uya, to' uma'tato' pe.\x - \xo 7:19 \xt E'sotas 1:10-11; 22\x* 
\p  
\v 20 “Mɨrɨ koro'tau, Mosi' entu'pʉ. Wakʉ pe rʉ'kwɨ iyesi'pʉ, mʉre e'pɨ'to' kasa pʉra. Osorʉwau kapʉi to' uya imainanpa'pʉ ikʉipʉnʉ iwʉ' tau.\x - \xo 7:20 \xt E'sotas 2:2\x* 
\v 21 To' uya enpa'kanʉ'sa' a'tai, Peero ensi uya anʉmʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan emo'ka'pʉ iya tʉmʉre kasa kuru rɨ.\x - \xo 7:21 \xt E'sotas 2:3-10\x* 
\v 22 Mosi' usenupasa' esi'pʉ tanporo Isi' pon kon eseru yau. Imaimu, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ inkupʉnʉ esi'pʉ meruntɨ pe. 
\p  
\v 23 “40 kaisa rɨ iwʉipiyaai Mosi' enasa' a'tai, tʉtonpa ton ka'kʉranpa pɨ' iye'kupʉ'pʉ.  
\v 24 To' tonpa Esuwerʉ pon wɨpɨtʉ Isi' ko' uya ene'pʉ iya, mɨrɨpan utɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ pon pika'tɨse'na. Mɨrɨpan e'ma'pʉ Mosi' uya, Isi' ko' tʉwɨse.  
\v 25 Mosi' usenuminka'pʉ tʉtonpa ton uya tʉto'ka'nʉkʉ tukai' Papa uya tʉku'sa' to' pika'tɨnin pe tukai', e'tane to' uya ito'ka'nʉkʉ pʉra iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 26 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, Mosi' uya asa'ron kon Esuwerʉ pon kon epanta'ma ene'pʉ, to' epanta'ma ereutanʉkʉ i'se iyesi'pʉ. Ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ', ‘Warawo' amʉ' ɨsitonpa pe ɨwesi kon mɨrɨ. Ɨtonpa kʉ'wɨpɨtʉi,’ ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 27 “E'tane warawo' tʉtonpa wɨpɨ'nin uya Mosi' a'tu'ma'pʉ, ‘Ɨnʉ' uya ɨku'sa' ina epuru pe, mɨrɨ pe pʉra ina eseru aimenkanin pe?  
\v 28 Uwɨpai pe' ɨwesi Isi' ko' wɨnɨ'pʉ auya kasa ko'mamiyau?’ tai'ma.  
\v 29 Mosi' uya mɨrɨ etasa' a'tai, iyapʉrʉmʉ'pʉ Metiyan pona. Mɨrɨ yau, iko'mamʉ'pʉ ka'kʉran pe. Mɨrɨ yau, asa'rɨ imu'ta'pʉ.\x - \xo 7:29 \xt E'sotas 2:11-15; 18:3-4\x* 
\p  
\v 30 “40 kaisa rɨ wʉipiya tʉpo, inserʉ usenpoika'pʉ Mosi' piya' yu' epo'tɨ yau, rɨmono' tau, a'ko pe Sainai Wʉpʉ piyau.  
\v 31 Mɨrɨ ensa' tʉuya a'tai, ipan pe isewansiuka'pʉ yu' epo'tɨ pʉra iyesi pɨ'. A'ko pe iwinɨkʉi' itɨ koro'tau, Papa maimu eta'pʉ iya:  
\v 32 ‘Papa urɨ, atamokori kon Epʉra'an, Aisi', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Seko' e'to' itese' pɨ'.’\f + \fr 7:32 \ft E'sotas 3:6\f* Mosi' enari'nʉmʉ e'tɨtɨtɨ'ka'pʉ, ɨnenpai pʉra.  
\v 33 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Papa uya ta'pʉ ipɨ', ‘Asapatooi imo'kakɨ! Mɨrɨ ɨye'mʉ'sa'kasa' na'ne' yau esi wakʉ pe.  
\v 34 Umunkɨ amʉ' ekota'ma ensa' uya man Isi' po. To' a'nʉmʉ etasa' uya man. Mɨrɨ pɨ' uye'sa' man to' mo'kase'na. Inke pʉra ɨsi'kɨ; ɨyennoko uya serɨ Isi' pona’\x - \xo 7:34 \xt E'sotas 3:5, 7-8, 10\x* ta'pʉ iya ipɨ'. 
\p  
\v 35 “Pʉse rɨ Mosi' Esuwerʉ amʉ' newaruma'tɨ'pʉ, ‘Ɨnʉ' uya ɨku'sa' ina epuru pe, ina eseru aimenkanin pe?’ ta'pʉ ipɨ' rʉ'pʉ, kʉrɨ rɨ ennoko'pʉ Papa uya to' epuru pe, to' pika'tɨnin pe nɨrɨ, inserʉ winɨ isenpoikasa' rʉ'pʉ yu' yau.\x - \xo 7:35 \xt E'sotas 2:14\x* 
\v 36 Mosi' kʉrɨ rɨ utamokori kon amʉ' anin nʉ'pʉ ɨnnɨ Isi' apai, a'kwarʉpɨ'nin mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ i'tuto' ipɨkɨrɨ rɨ kupʉ'pʉ iya, Papa uya imeruntɨɨi tʉsa' esi'pʉ. Mɨrɨ ton kupʉ'pʉ iya Isi' po, Isuweyu Parau kau mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ rɨmono' tau nɨrɨ 40 kaisa rɨ wʉipiya yau.\x - \xo 7:36 \xt E'sotas 7:3; 14:21; Nonpa 14:33\x* 
\p  
\v 37 “Pʉse rɨ Mosi', Esuwerʉ amʉ' auro'kanin nʉ'pʉ, ‘Papa uya pu'kena' anʉnto' oton ɨ'koro'tapai'nokon uwaraino,’ tawon nʉ'pʉ.\f + \fr 7:37 \ft Isu'taronomi 18:15, 18\f* 
\v 38 Pʉse rɨ Mosi' esi'pʉ to' koro'tau rɨmono' tau. Inserʉ, Papa winon uya auro'ka'pʉ Sainai Wʉpʉ po. Main, uko'man nɨto' ipɨ' ekama'pʉ iya ipɨ'.\x - \xo 7:38 \xt E'sotas 19:1—20:17; Isu'taronomi 5:1-33\x* 
\p  
\v 39 “E'tane utamokori kon amʉ' uya apurɨ pʉra iyesi'pʉ. To' uya inurunpa'pʉ. Tewan kon yau, enna'popai to' esi'pʉ Isi' pona.  
\v 40 Eran auro'ka'pʉ to' uya, ‘Papa tato' ipɨ' pe ika'sa' ɨnkoneka', uyanin kon pe te'ton. Pʉse rɨ Mosi', une'nin nʉ'pʉ kon Isi' apai e'tane, ɨ'rɨ pe rɨ nawon iyesi'pʉ tukai' ina uya i'tu pʉra man!’ ta'pʉ to' uya.\f + \fr 7:40 \ft E'sotas 32:1\f* 
\v 41 Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' uya papa tato' pe ipɨ' ika'sa' koneka'pʉ paka mʉre kasa, tʉuse'mato' kon nee'pʉ to' uya ipiya', mɨrɨpan kon userenka'pʉ, to' umanumʉ'pʉ tʉnkoneka'pʉ kon nama tʉuya'nokon ekamanin pe.\x - \xo 7:41 \xt E'sotas 32:2-6\x* 
\v 42 E'tane Papa usakorotasa' era'tɨ'pʉ to' piyapai, apʉne pʉra papa tato' ipɨ' ika'sa' konekasa' to' uya wenai. To' nonka'pʉ iya to' ɨpʉremato' pe wʉi enu, kapʉi, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ sirikɨ amʉ' pɨ'. Serɨ e'menukasa' esi'pʉ pu'kena' karetaai yau: 
\q1 “‘Esuwerʉ amʉ' rʉ'kwɨ, serɨ ɨuse'mato' kon nepʉ auya'nokon pʉra iyesi'pʉ uyena' 
\q2 40 kaisa rɨ wʉipiya rɨmono' tau ɨwesi kon a'tai. 
\q1  
\v 43 Papa tato' pe ipɨ' ika'sa' More' iwʉ' apɨtʉ'pʉ auya'nokon, 
\q2 sirikɨ pe ika'sa' ka'pon amʉ' nesakʉnʉ Re'pan tukai'. 
\q2 Ika'sa' ɨwɨpʉremato' kon ipɨ'. 
\q2 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ɨyenno'to' uya 'nokon oton ɨnnɨ’\f + \fr 7:43 \ft Emos 5:25-27 (LXX)\f* Paperan enta'. 
\p  
\v 44 “Utamokori kon amʉ' piyau Papa uya amʉranʉ'nɨto' ita' esi'pʉ rɨmono' tau. Iyekonekasa' esi'pʉ Mosi' pɨ' Papa nekama'pʉ awɨrɨ. Ikonekato' ipɨ' pe tʉnene'pʉ kasa.\x - \xo 7:44 \xt E'sotas 25:9, 40\x* 
\v 45 Utamokori kon amʉ' uya mɨrɨ amʉranʉ'nɨto' ita' eporo'pʉ tʉkʉipʉnʉ kon winɨ, mɨrɨpan arɨ'pʉ to' uya ta'kɨrɨ'nokon Isa'suwa a'kɨrɨ tʉutɨ kon a'tai non mo'kai'. Mɨrɨ non mo'ka'pʉ to' uya tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' enapai. Papa uya to' ainʉnpa'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya non mo'kato' pe. Iko'mamʉ'pʉ mɨrɨ pata yau Tepi' weyu e'seporo pona rɨ.\x - \xo 7:45 \xt Isens 3:14-17\x* 
\v 46 Kʉrɨ rɨ Papa ewakiri pe iye'sa' rʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya Papa ekama'po'pʉ ɨutɨ amɨto' pe tʉuya tʉmɨrɨ pe.\x - \xo 7:46 \xt 2 Sanwerʉ 7:1-16; 1 Kʉrono'kʉrʉs 17:1-14\x* 
\v 47 E'tane Saraman uya kuru ɨutɨ amɨ'pʉ.\x - \xo 7:47 \xt 1 Kin Amʉ' 6:1-38; 2 Kʉrono'kʉrʉs 3:1-17\x* 
\p  
\v 48 “Mɨrɨpan e'tane, Papa esi eke pe ka'pon namɨ'pʉ tau tʉuko'mansen pen. Pu'kena' amʉ' tonpa uya tasa', 
\q1  
\v 49 “‘Epʉn esi uyapon pe, 
\q2 non esi u'ta apon pe. 
\q1 Ɨ'rɨ warai ɨutɨ amɨ auya'nokon uiwʉ' pe? 
\qr ta Itepuru uya. 
\q2 Mɨrɨ pe pʉra nai yau umoronka'to' pata'se' esi? 
\q1  
\v 50 Unkoneka'pʉ ton pen pe' se ton tanporon nɨ?’\f + \fr 7:50 \ft Aisaya 66:1-2\f* 
\p  
\v 51 “Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon ɨri ton nɨ, sa'man ton nɨ ɨyewan kon! Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon e'makoima atamokori kon amʉ' esi'pʉ kasa. Ɨuko'mamʉ kon Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ewaruma'tɨ pɨ'.\x - \xo 7:51 \xt Aisaya 63:10\x* 
\v 52 Atamokori kon uya wapiyaro' kon pu'kena' amʉ' kota'ma'pʉ. To' uya rɨ Ipokena' Ka'pon uyepʉ ekamanin nan tʉ'ka'pʉ. Serɨ pe si eparanka'pʉ auya'nokon iteyaton non ena' to' uya iwɨto' pe.  
\v 53 Ɨmɨrɨ'nokon uya Papa Maimu eporo'pʉ mɨrɨ, Papa nʉtʉrʉ'pʉ atamokori kon ena'. Inserʉ amʉ' uya mɨrɨ tʉrʉ'pʉ atamokori kon ena'. Mɨrɨ e'tane, iyawɨrɨ pʉra ɨwesi kon,” ta'pʉ Si'tipʉn uya to' pɨ'. 
\s1 Tɨ' Ke Si'tipʉn Wɨnɨ'pʉ To' Uya 
\p  
\v 54 Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton uya pʉse rɨ Si'tipʉn maimu etasa' a'tai, ipan pe to' usakorota'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' uya tʉyɨ kon kɨtɨtɨi'ma'pʉ, ipan pe tʉusakorota kon pe.  
\v 55 E'tane, Si'tipʉn uya eke pe Wakʉ A'kwarʉ eposa' esi'pʉ, ka'ta' tenu tʉrʉ'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Papa a'kwarii ene'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Sises e'mʉ'sa'kasa' ene'pʉ iya Papa enwo'netʉ winɨ.  
\v 56 “Apʉne entɨ', Papa uya Epʉn mʉra'taai a'kokasa'! Sises e'mʉ'sa'kasa' esi Papa enwo'netʉ winɨ!” ta'pʉ Si'tipʉn uya. 
\p  
\v 57 Eke pe to' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ. Tanporo to' utɨ'pʉ itekare pɨ', temiyatʉ kon tʉpɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya tʉpana kon pona imaimu eta tʉuya'nokon namai'.  
\v 58 To' uya tʉpi'si'se enpa'ka'pʉ pata yapai, mɨrɨpan kon e'sara'tɨ'pʉ eke ton tɨ' ma'kɨrɨ pɨ' ipona, iwɨnɨ'pʉ to' uya. Ka'pon amʉ' iwɨnin nan uya tʉpon kon pʉro'pon kanka'pʉ, mɨrɨpan nonka'pʉ to' uya non pona moineri'pɨ, Saarʉ piyau. 
\p  
\v 59 Tɨ' ke to' uya tʉwɨnɨ koro'tau, Si'tipʉn ɨpʉrema'pʉ, “Uyepuru, Sises, uya'kwarʉ anʉnkɨ!” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 60 Tese'mu po ita'mo'ka'pʉ, eke pe iyɨpʉrema'pʉ, “Uyepuru, to' kʉ'kota'mai to' uya uwɨnɨ pɨ'!” ta'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ ta tʉpo, iyerikʉ'pʉ. \fig To' e'sara'tɨ'pʉ eke ton tɨ' ma'kɨrɨ pɨ' ipona, iwɨnɨ'pʉ to' uya.|src="CN01923B.tif" size="span" loc="ACT 7:54—8:1" copy="David C. Cook" ref="7:58" \fig* 
\c 8  
\p  
\v 1 Saarʉ esi'pʉ mɨrɨ yau iwɨtɨ' rɨ ta pɨ'. 
\s1 Saarʉ Uya Sises Apurɨnin Nan Kota'mapɨtʉ'pʉ 
\p Mɨrɨ a'tai, ka'pon amʉ' e'sara'tɨ'pʉ ipan pe Sises apurɨnin nan kota'ma pɨ' Surusiran po tʉuko'mansan. Mɨrɨ a'tai, tu'kan kon Sises apurɨnin nan apʉrʉmʉ'pʉ Isutiya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sameriya pona. Enno'sa' kon nɨken e'nɨnsa' esi'pʉ Surusiran po.  
\v 2 Papa uya tasa' kasa warawo' amʉ' uya Si'tipʉn u'na'tɨ'pʉ, eke pe tʉuta'kwarʉkai' to' ukaramʉ'pʉ iwenai. 
\p  
\v 3 Mɨrɨ koro'tau, Saarʉ e'sara'tɨ'pʉ Sises apurɨnin nan ma'tanʉkʉ pɨ'. Iyewonpɨtʉ'pʉ ɨutɨ kaisa rɨ'ne, warawo' amʉ', uri'san amʉ' nɨrɨ Sises apurɨnin nan tʉpɨtʉ'pʉ pariki'si ta'.\x - \xo 8:3 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 22:4-5; 26:9-11\x* 
\s1 Piri' Uya Itekare Ekama'pʉ Sameriya Po 
\p  
\v 4 Sises apurɨnin nan, ka'pon amʉ' nainʉnpa'san Surusiran apai utɨ'pʉ pata kaisa rɨ wakʉ Sises ekareei ekama pɨ'.  
\v 5 Sises apurɨnin nan tonpa, Piri' itese' utɨ'pʉ Sameriya pata ya', mɨrɨpan uya mɨrɨ yau Kʉrai\f + \fr 8:5 \fq Kʉrai, \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq Me'saya—Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe.\f* ekama'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' pɨ'.  
\v 6 Mɨrɨ a'tai, tu'kan kon esi'pʉ ipan pe Piri' maimu ɨnetapai, wakʉ i'tuto' ipɨ' inkupʉnʉ ensa' tʉuya'nokon pɨ'.  
\v 7 Makoi\f + \fr 8:7 \fq Makoi, \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq ɨri, \ft Kiri' maimu yau.\f* a'kwarʉ ton epa'ka'pʉ ɨpirorʉnpɨtʉi'ma ka'pon amʉ' apai. Tu'kan kon ise'mesa' kon, sekentei'pa' nan usepi'tɨ'pʉ, apʉne pʉra Papa uya Piri' ku'sa' wenai to' epi'tɨnin pe.  
\v 8 Tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' esi'pʉ ipan pe pori' pe mɨrɨ pata yau. 
\s1 Saiman, Enwoke' 
\p  
\v 9 Mɨrɨ yau iyesi'pʉ ka'pon, Saiman itese', enwoke', eke pe te'ku'sen mɨrɨ pata yau. Enwoke' pe tesi winɨ te'ku'sen pen nɨ ku'nin pe iyesi'pʉ Sameriya yawon kon tewansiukai'.  
\v 10 Tanporo ka'pon amʉ' mɨrɨ yawon kon aiko ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ eke ton nɨ uya apurɨ'pʉ. “Pʉse rɨ ka'pon esi Papa meruntɨrʉ yau,” ta'pʉ to' uya. Eke kuru tukai' ka'pon amʉ' uya esakʉ'pʉ.  
\v 11 Apurɨ pɨ' to' esi'pʉ, apʉne pʉra enwoke' pe tesi ke to' ewansiukapɨtʉ'pʉ iya, inke rɨ.  
\v 12 E'tane nin si Piri' nekamanʉ wakʉ itekare, Papa e'to' esa' wannɨ pe, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sises Kʉrai ese' ekareei apurɨsa' to' uya a'tai, warawoti'si amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ uri'sami'si amʉ' epa'taisima'pʉ.  
\v 13 Saiman uya rɨ nɨrɨ Piri' maimu apurɨ'pʉ. Piri' uya ipa'taisima'pʉ tʉpo, ipɨkɨrɨ Saiman esi'pʉ mɨ airɨ rɨ Piri' utɨ a'tai. Tɨwɨrɨ rɨ Saiman usewansiukapɨtʉ'pʉ, i'tuto' ipɨ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ eke Papa tʉrawasooi Piri' nʉkupʉnʉ tense. 
\p  
\v 14 Surusiran pon kon enno'sa' kon uya etasa' a'tai, tu'kan kon Sameriya yawon kon uya Papa maimu apurɨsa' tawon, to' uya Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan ennoko'pʉ to' piya'.  
\v 15 To' uya to' eposa' a'tai, to' ɨpʉrema'pʉ to' pona Wakʉ A'kwarʉ epoto' pe to' uya,  
\v 16 apʉne pʉra Wakʉ A'kwarʉ uye'sa' pʉra rɨ marɨ iyesi'pʉ to' pona. Piri' uya to' pa'taisima'pʉ esi'pʉ Itepuru Sises ese' yau rɨken.  
\v 17 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan uya temiyatʉ kon tʉrʉ'pʉ to' pona, mɨrɨpan kon uya Wakʉ A'kwarʉ eporo'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 18 Saiman uya ene'pʉ Papa uya Ta'kwarʉ tʉrʉ ka'pon amʉ' pona enno'sa' kon uya temiyatʉ kon tʉrʉ to' pona a'tai, pʉrata ke to' repa i'se iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 19 “Urepatɨ' mɨrɨ ku'nin ke. Mɨrɨ a'tai, tanporo uyemiyatʉ tʉto' uya ton ipona uya, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ epoto' pe,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 20 Pi'ta uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Ɨpʉrataai pokon pe auma'ta mɨrɨ, apʉne pʉra ɨusenuminka pɨ' Papa winon e'ma auya pʉrata ke tukai'!  
\v 21 Papa uya ɨku'sa' pʉra man ɨ'rɨ ku'nin pe ina a'kɨrɨ serɨ tʉrawaso yau, apʉne pʉra ɨyewan esi wakʉ pe pʉra Papa pona.  
\v 22 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ɨri pe ɨusenuminkato' inonka' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨwɨpʉrema pa Itepuru pɨ'. Mɨrɨ a'tai, ɨpɨ' isentu'ma uya amakooi eno'mato' pe ikupʉ i'se ɨusenuminka'pʉ na'ne'.  
\v 23 Ɨi'tu uya wenai ipan pe ɨyɨkɨnta ina pɨ' tukai', tɨwɨ rɨ ɨye'makoima winɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 24 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Saiman uya ta'pʉ Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan pɨ', “Ɨpʉrematɨ' upona. Mɨrɨ a'tai, mʉkayatʉi'ne' rɨ e'kupʉ namai' upɨ',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 25 Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaan uya ka'pon amʉ' auro'ka'pʉ tʉpo, Sises i'tusa' tʉuya'nokon nʉ'pʉ pɨ' itekare ekama'pʉ to' uya to' pɨ', Papa winon Sises ekareei, to' e'sara'tɨ'pʉ enna'pon pɨ' Surusiran winɨkʉi'. Tʉutɨ kon koro'tau, wakʉ Sises ekareei ekama'pʉ to' uya ka'pon amʉ' pɨ' Sameriya yawon eke iwa ton pata yau'ne. 
\s1 I'tiyo'piya Kwin Pʉrataai Esa' 
\p  
\v 26 Inserʉ, Papa nennoko'pʉ uya Piri' auro'ka'pʉ, “Ekoneka' ɨutɨ pa wʉi enu enuku kamisi winɨkʉi' Surusiran poino asanta Kesa ponakan ta',” ta'pʉ iya. (Mɨrɨ asanta e'nonka'pʉ mɨrɨ.)\f + \fr 8:26 \fq Mɨrɨ asanta e'nonka'pʉ mɨrɨ; \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra, \fq Mɨrɨ asanta esi rɨmono' ta' e'ma.\f* 
\v 27 Mɨrɨpan ekonekasa' utɨ koro'tau, ka'pon eporo'pʉ iya mɨrɨ asanta tau tʉutɨsen, eke kuru rɨ I'tiyo'piya pata kwin pʉrataai esa', Surusiran pona itɨsa' rʉ'pʉ ɨpʉremai'.  
\v 28 Iyenna'po a'tai, iyereutasa' esi'pʉ tʉkanwa tararan yau. Eke pe pu'kena' Aisaya nʉmenuka'pʉ kareta ekama iya esi'pʉ.  
\v 29 Papa A'kwarʉ uya Piri' auro'ka'pʉ, “Enta mɨrɨ tararan piyau a'ko pe e'se'na,” tukai'. 
\p  
\v 30 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Piri' utɨ'pʉ tararan piya', mɨrɨpan uya eta'pʉ ekama iya pu'kena' Aisaya nʉmenuka'pʉ yau. Piri' uya ekama'po'pʉ, “Mekamayai'ne' pe' mʉto'ka'nʉ'an?” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 31 “Kane, ito'ka'nʉkʉ uya pʉra man. Ka'pon uya rɨ nin enpoika a'tai, ito'ka'nʉkʉ uya rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨpan uya Piri' kɨ'ma'pʉ tʉpiyau iyereutato' pe tʉkanwa ya'.  
\v 32 Se tawon ekama pɨ' iyesi'pʉ: 
\q1 “To' uya arɨ'pʉ karimeru arɨ kasa iwɨse'na. 
\q2 Karimeru mʉre kasa ti'po' akʉ'tane e'pana te'sen, 
\q2 mɨrɨpan kasa isaurokʉ pʉra iyesi'pʉ. 
\q1  
\v 33 Se pe rɨ iye'ku'to' yau, ɨnʉ' rɨ iwenaino' pʉra iyesi'pʉ. 
\q2 Ɨnʉ' uya rɨ ipayan nʉ'san ekamato' oton pen nɨ, 
\q2 apʉne pʉra non po iko'manto' emo'ka'pʉ pɨ',”\f + \fr 8:33 \ft Aisaya 53:7-8\f* 
\m tawon. 
\p  
\v 34 Kwin pʉrataai esa' uya Piri' ekama'po'pʉ, “Ekamakɨ ɨnʉ' pɨ' pu'kena' uya imenukasa'; tʉmɨrɨ pɨ' pe', tʉron nɨ pɨ' rɨ katɨ?” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 35 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Piri' epiya'tɨ'pʉ mɨrɨ rɨ iye'menukasa' itekare apai wakʉ Sises ekareei ke ipana'tɨ pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 36 To' utɨ koro'tau asanta tawɨrɨ, tuna eporo'pʉ to' uya. “Apʉne tuna enkɨ! Upa'taisimakɨ. Ɨ'rɨ nɨrɨ ken uwa'kʉtʉi'no mɨrɨ apai?” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 37 Piri' uya ta'pʉ, “Apurɨ auya a'tai tanporo ɨyewan a'kɨrɨ, iye'kupʉ rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p Mɨrɨpan maimu eikʉ'pʉ iya, “Apurɨ uya serɨ Sises Kʉrai esi Papa Mu pe tukai',” ta'pʉ iya.\f + \fr 8:37 \ft 37 airon pʉra iyesi mɨrɨ tʉron nɨ imenukasa' ton yau.\f* 
\p  
\v 38 Mɨrɨpan uya tararan ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, asa'rɨ rɨ marɨ Piri' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ kwin pʉrataai esa' utɨ'pʉ tuna ka', mɨrɨpan pa'taisima'pʉ iya.  
\v 39 To' ekanwaka a'tai tuna kapai, Itepuru A'kwarʉ uya Piri' arɨ'pʉ. Kwin pʉrataai esa' uya ene pʉra iyena'pʉ. Mɨrɨ rɨ e'tane, itɨ'pʉ pori' pe esii'ma asanta tawɨrɨ. \fig “Ka'pon uya rɨ nin enpoika a'tai, ito'ka'nʉkʉ uya rɨ.”|src="CN01932B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 8:26-39" copy="David C. Cook" ref="8:31" \fig* 
\v 40 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Piri' esi ene'pʉ to' uya itekare ekama pɨ' Aso'tas po, siya rɨ pata kaisa rɨ'ne Sisariya pona rɨ. 
\c 9  
\s1 Saarʉ Eporo'pʉ Sises Uya 
\r (Inkupʉ'pʉ 22:2-16; 26:12-18) 
\p  
\v 1 Mɨrɨ koro'tau, Saarʉ usakorotasa' uya, “Sises poitorʉ ton tʉ'ka uya,” ta'pʉ. Saarʉ utɨ'pʉ Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru piya'  
\v 2 tekamanin kareta, Tamaskas pon Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ton ta' epose'na. Serɨ kareta uya Saarʉ ku'sa' esi'pʉ, Ite'ma awɨron kon, warawoti'si mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ uri'sami'si a'sisa' ato' pe iya Surusiran pona. 
\p  
\v 3 Ta'kɨron kon pokon pe itɨ uya pata eporo koro'tau, Tamaskas itese', a'kwa, Epʉn winon uya iwei'tɨ'pʉ.  
\v 4 Ita'mo'ka'pʉ non pona. Mɨrɨ a'tai, main eta'pʉ iya, “Saarʉ, Saarʉ, ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' ukota'ma auya?” tawon. 
\p  
\v 5 Saarʉ uya ekama'po'pʉ, “Ɨnʉ' ɨmɨrɨ, Uyepuru?” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p “Urɨ Sises, ɨnkota'manʉ,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 6 “E'mʉ'sa'ka', itɨkɨ pata pona. Mɨrɨ yau iyesi mɨrɨ ayauro'ka ton ɨnku'ton pɨ',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 7 Ka'pon amʉ' iya'kɨrɨ tʉutɨsan e'takʉ'ka'pʉ, ɨ'rɨ tai'ma pʉra rɨ; mɨrɨpan kon uya main eta'pʉ, e'tane ɨnʉ' rɨ ene to' uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 8 Saarʉ e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ non poi, e'tane ɨ'rɨ ene iya pʉra iyesi'pʉ. Mɨrɨ wenai, to' uya arɨ'pʉ itemiyatʉ pɨ' ta'sii' Tamaskas pona.  
\v 9 Osorʉwau wʉi itenu pʉra iyesi'pʉ. Iyenta'na pʉra, ɨ'rɨ rɨ ensi iya pʉra iyesi'pʉ. 
\s1 Ananayas, Itepuru Apurɨnin 
\p  
\v 10 Mɨrɨ yau iyesi'pʉ Sises apurɨnin, Ananayas itese'. Ananayas enu uta'kwakasa' koro'tau, Itepuru maimu eta'pʉ iya, “Ananayas!” tawon. 
\p “Setayai' rɨ, Uyepuru,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 11 “Ekoneka', enta Isutas piya', To'saron itese' asanta ta',” ta'pʉ Itepuru uya ipɨ'. “Ɨnʉ' rɨ mekama'poi' mɨrɨ yau, ‘Ka'pon, Saarʉ itese', Tarʉsas winon pe' serɨ yau nai?’ tukai'. Serɨ a'tai, ɨpʉreman pɨ' man.  
\v 12 Itenu uta'kwakasa' uya ene'pʉ ka'pon, Ananayas itese' uyepʉ, temiyatʉ tʉse'na tʉpona, ennin pe tenato' pe,” ta'pʉ Itepuru uya itenu uta'kwakasa' koro'tau. 
\p  
\v 13 “Uyepuru, tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' uya uyauro'kasa' man, wakʉ ton Papa nʉkupʉ'san ekota'mato' emapu'tɨsa' iya ipan pe Surusiran po.  
\v 14 Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton uya auro'ka'pʉ iye'to' pe Tamaskas pona ɨyese' pɨ' te'san a'sipɨ'se'na, to' ase'na Surusiran pona,” ta'pʉ Ananayas uya. 
\p  
\v 15 E'tane, “Saarʉ piya' enta. Anʉnsa' uya man uyapiyo' pe, uyekareei pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen, to' epuru ton, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' auro'kato' pe iya.  
\v 16 Urɨ wenai eke pe iyekota'mato' enpoika uya mɨrɨ itenu ya',” ta'pʉ Itepuru uya Ananayas pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 17 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Ananayas utɨ'pʉ itau iye'to' ɨutɨ ta', mɨrɨpan uya temiyatʉ tʉrʉ'pʉ Saarʉ pona. “Utonpa Saarʉ, Sises, asanta tau isenpoikasa' rʉ'pʉ ɨyena' uya uyenno'sa' man, ennin pe kanan ɨyena pa, auta'kwarʉ'tɨ pa nɨrɨ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 18 Mɨrɨ ta iya pe rɨ, moro' pi'pɨ waraino uta'pokʉ'pʉ itenu ton poi. Ennin pe kanan iyena'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, iye'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ, mɨrɨ pe rɨ Ananayas uya ipa'taisima'pʉ.\x - \xo 9:18 \xt Topayas 11:13-15\x* 
\v 19 Mɨrɨpan enta'nasa' ena'pʉ pana' pe. 
\s1 Tamaskas Po Saarʉ Uya Sises Ekareei Ekama'pʉ 
\p Saarʉ uko'mamʉ'pʉ Sises poitorʉ rʉ'san piyau Tamaskas po.  
\v 20 Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, itekare ekama pɨ' iye'sara'tɨ'pʉ, “Sises esi Papa Mu pe,” tukai'. 
\p  
\v 21 Tanporo etanin nan usewansiuka'pʉ, “Pʉse rɨ pen pe' pʉse, Surusiran pon kon kʉrɨ rɨ ese' pokon kon tʉ'kataine' pen? Iye'sa' kanan pen pe' se, kamoro a'sipɨ'se'na, mɨrɨpan kon ase'na use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton eke ton kuru ena'?” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 22 E'tane miyarɨ rɨ tʉnekamanʉ yau meruntɨ pe Saarʉ ena'pʉ. Papa Maimu winɨ enpoika pɨ' iyesi'pʉ, “Sises esi Kʉrai\f + \fr 9:22 \fq Kʉrai \ft (Kiri' maimu yau); mɨrɨ pe pʉra, \fq Me'saya \ft (Ipuru maimu yau), asa'rɨ rɨ marɨ iyesi, \fq Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe.\f* pe,” tukai', mɨrɨpan pɨ' to' utanpokʉma'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 23 Inke Tamaskas po Saarʉ esi koro'tau, Esuwerʉ amʉ' e'kama'pʉ iwɨnɨ pɨ'.  
\v 24 Tʉwɨnɨ pɨ' e'kamanɨsa' eta'pʉ Saarʉ uya. Wʉi nai, ewarupɨ nau nɨrɨ mʉra'ta nau Saarʉ enupɨkɨrɨ to' esi'pʉ, iwɨto' pe tʉuya'nokon e'tane, to' uya iwɨnɨ'pʉ pen.  
\v 25 Inenupanʉ ton uya ipika'tɨ'pʉ, ewarupɨ nau tʉpa'kai'. Mɨrɨ a'tai, eke pa'siki'ti yau si'na' pɨ' to' uya inu'tɨ'pʉ pata wekupiri euta yai.\x - \xo 9:25 \xt 2 Koren 11:32-33\x* 
\s1 Panapas Uya Saarʉ Ekama'pʉ Surusiran Po 
\p  
\v 26 Surusiran pona Saarʉ epa'kasa' a'tai, Sises poitorʉ rʉ'san tonpa pe kuru enapai iyesi'pʉ, e'tane tu'kan kon enari'nʉmʉ'pʉ ipɨ', “I'napai rɨ pe' ken Sises apurɨnin pe iyenasa'?” tukai'.  
\v 27 E'tane Panapas uya inee'pʉ itekare ekamase'na enno'sa' kon piya'. Panapas uya enpoika'pʉ to' pɨ', “Saarʉ utɨ koro'tau Tamaskas e'ma tau, Itepuru ene'pʉ iya, mɨrɨpan uya auro'ka'pʉ,” ta'pʉ iya. Panapas uya nɨrɨ to' auro'ka'pʉ, “Saarʉ uya Sises ekareei ekama'pʉ enari'mʉra Tamaskas pon kon ka'pon amʉ' pɨ',” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 28 Panapas maimu apurɨsa' to' uya wenai, Sises apurɨnin nan Surusiran pon kon tonpa pe Saarʉ ena'pʉ, mɨrɨpan usarɨ'pʉ enari'mʉra rɨ Surusiran poro Sises ekareei ekama pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 29 Saarʉ esi'pʉ usauro'nɨ pɨ' e'maimu'pɨ' nɨ pɨ' Sises ekareei pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ', Kiri' pe tʉusauro'san pokon pe enpoika i'se to' pɨ', e'tane miyarɨ rɨ iwɨnɨ pɨ' to' e'kama'pʉ.  
\v 30 Tʉron kon Sises apurɨnin nan uya i'tusa' a'tai, ka'pon amʉ' e'kamasa' iwɨnɨ pɨ', to' uya arɨ'pʉ Sisariya pona, mɨrɨpan ennoko'pʉ to' uya Tarʉsas pona. 
\p  
\v 31 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Sises apurɨnin nan Isutiya, Kiyarari, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sameriya pon kon uko'mamʉ'pʉ ewankamanin pʉra, ɨnʉ' uya rɨ to' kota'ma pʉra iyesi wenai. Wakʉ A'kwarʉ uya to' meruntɨtanʉkʉ'pʉ, to' pori'ma'pʉ iya rɨ. Miyarɨ rɨ Sises apurɨ pɨ' tu'ke to' ena'pʉ. Mɨrɨpan kon uko'mamʉ'pʉ Itepuru nama pɨ' rɨ tʉuko'mamʉ kon kaisa rɨ. 
\s1 Ise'mesa' Epi'tɨ'pʉ Pi'ta Uya 
\p  
\v 32 Pi'ta esi koro'tau utɨn pɨ' pata ton kaisa rɨ'ne, Reta pon kon wakʉ ton Papa nʉkupʉ'san ka'kʉranpai' itɨ'pʉ.  
\v 33 Mɨrɨ yau, ka'pon eporo'pʉ iya, Eniyas itese'. Te'kwe' poi iye'mʉ'sa'ka pʉra iyesi'pʉ, 8 kaisa rɨ wʉipiya ise'mesa' uko'mansa' esi'pʉ.  
\v 34 Pi'ta uya ta'pʉ ipɨ', “Eniyas, serɨ pe Sises uya ɨyepi'tɨ. E'mʉ'sa'ka', ɨye'kwe' e'mepɨ'kɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, Eniyas e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ.  
\v 35 Tanporo tʉuko'mansan Reta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isaran yawon kon uya ene'pʉ, to' era'tɨ'pʉ Itepuru Sises winɨkʉi'. 
\s1 Tarʉ'kas, Eri'sa' I'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ Pi'ta Uya 
\p  
\v 36 Isa'pa pata po, Sises apurɨnin uri'san esi'pʉ, Tapi'ta itese'. Itese' esi'pʉ Kiri' maimu yau Tarʉ'kas, “usari” ta e'kwa pe. Tɨwɨrɨ rɨ wakʉ ku'nin pe iye'pɨtʉ'pʉ, entu'manin nan nɨ pika'tɨ pɨ'.  
\v 37 Reta po Pi'ta esi a'tai, e'ne' pe tenai', uri'san Tarʉ'kas erikʉ'pʉ. Iyeri'sa' ekepu korʉka'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon uya ka'tawon ɨutɨ tau inonka'pʉ.  
\v 38 Reta esi'pʉ a'ko pe Isa'pa piyau. Sises poitorʉ rʉ'san uya Reta po Pi'ta esi tukai' etasa' a'tai, asa'ron kon ka'pon amʉ' ennoko'pʉ to' uya ipiya'. “Inke pʉra ɨsi'kɨ,” ta'pʉ to' uya ipɨ'. 
\p  
\v 39 Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, itɨ'pʉ Isa'pa pona to' a'kɨrɨ. Pata eposa' iya a'tai, to' uya arɨ'pʉ ka'ta', Tarʉ'kas ekepu piya'. Tanporo uri'sami'si amʉ' itaan'pʉ ima'tasa' kon nʉ'san amʉrasa' esi'pʉ ipiyau, ukaran nɨ pɨ', pon amʉ' Tarʉ'kas nʉkonepɨtʉ'pʉ enpoikapɨtʉ pɨ' to' esi'pʉ nurɨne iyesi a'taino rʉ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 40 Tanporo Pi'ta uya to' enpa'ka'pʉ, mɨrɨpan e'sekunka'pʉ ɨpʉremai', nurɨne kanan Tarʉ'kas enato' pe. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, eke' winɨkʉi' iyera'tɨ'pʉ, “Tapi'ta, e'mʉ'sa'ka'!” ta'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, itenu ton uta'koka'pʉ. Pi'ta ene iya a'tai, iye'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ ta'mu pona.  
\v 41 Itemiya pɨ' ta'sii' i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ iya, mɨrɨpan uya Sises poitorʉ rʉ'san mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ uri'sami'si amʉ' itaan'pʉ ima'tasa' kon nʉ'san kɨ'ma'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya nurɨne inee'pʉ to' piya'.  
\v 42 Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, mɨ poro rɨ te'san ka'pon amʉ' uya Isa'pa po eke Papa tʉrawasooi e'ku'sa' i'tu'pʉ. Tu'kan kon uya Itepuru apurɨ'pʉ. \fig “Tapi'ta, e'mʉ'sa'ka'!”|src="CN01940B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 9:36-42" copy="David C. Cook" ref="9:40" \fig* 
\v 43 Pi'ta uko'mamʉ'pʉ Isa'pa po ka'pon, Saiman itese', o' pi'pɨ konepɨ'nin piyau. 
\c 10  
\s1 Koneriyas, Papa Apurɨnin 
\p  
\v 1 Mɨrɨ yau iyesi'pʉ ka'pon, Koneriyas itese', Sisariya pata po tʉuko'mansen, Roman amʉ' soisaai epuru ton tonpa pe te'sen, I'tariyan soisa amʉ' tukai' tesa'san kon.  
\v 2 Tɨwɨrɨ rɨ tʉtonpa ton amʉtʉ pe Papa eseru poro ɨko'mamʉ i'se te'sen, tɨwɨrɨ rɨ entu'manin nan repanin pe iyesi'pʉ eke pe rɨ, tɨwɨrɨ rɨ tʉwɨpʉremasen Papa pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 3 Ko'maan pe iwa, 3 a'kʉra', Papa uya itenu a'kwakasa' uya, kɨpo'po Papa inserʉʉi uyepʉ tʉpiya' ene'pʉ. “Koneriyas!” ta'pʉ iya ipɨ'. 
\p  
\v 4 Koneriyas uya enari'ke' pe esii'ma ene'pʉ, “Ɨ'rɨ na'kɨ i'se me'ai', uyepuru?” ta'pʉ iya ipɨ'. 
\p Inserʉ uya ta'pʉ ipɨ', “Papa epori'masa' man entu'manin nan repasa' auya pɨ', ɨwɨpʉremasa' pɨ' tʉpɨ'.  
\v 5 Saiman, Pi'ta tukai' tesa'sen kɨ'manin nan ka'pon amʉ' ɨnenno'kɨ Isa'pa pata pona.  
\v 6 Saiman nɨ marɨ itese' ka'pon, o' pi'pɨ konepɨtʉ pɨ' te'sen iwʉ' tau iyesi mɨrɨ, parau e'pi po na'ne',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 7 Auro'kanin nʉ'pʉ inserʉ utɨ'pʉ a'tai, Koneriyas uya asa'rɨ tʉpoitorʉ ton kɨ'ma'pʉ. Tikin nɨ soisa kɨ'ma'pʉ iya nɨrɨ, Papa apurɨnin, tʉtonpa pe te'sen.  
\v 8 Tanporo iye'ku'sa' rʉ'pʉ pɨ' to' auro'ka'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Isa'pa pona Pi'ta kɨ'mai' to' ennoko'pʉ iya. \fig “Ɨ'rɨ na'kɨ i'se me'ai', uyepuru?”|src="CN01943B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 10:1-48" copy="David C. Cook" ref="10:4" \fig* 
\s1 Pi'ta Enu A'kwaka'pʉ Papa Uya 
\p  
\v 9 Pʉre'po'si a'tai rɨ, mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, pata eporo to' uya koro'tau, Pi'ta enuku'pʉ ai'tou pan ɨutɨ nakapu pona ɨpʉremai'.\x - \xo 10:9 \xt Isuti' 8:5\x*\fig Pi'ta enuku'pʉ ai'tou pan ɨutɨ nakapu pona ɨpʉremai'.|src="CN02056B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 10:9" copy="David C. Cook" ref="10:9" \fig* 
\v 10 Mɨrɨ a'tai, iwan pe iyesi'pʉ, enta'napai iyesi'pʉ. Iti'kiyari ekoneka koro'tau, Papa uya itenu a'kwaka'pʉ.  
\v 11 Ka' uta'kokasa' ene'pʉ iya. Kareku waraino u'tɨ non pona a'kwa' kasa ewa'tɨsa' asakɨrɨ'nan si'na' ke itekun enne'pɨ'ne ene'pʉ iya.  
\v 12 Mɨrɨ yau iyesi'pʉ ti'tui' pʉra rɨ ene amʉ', ɨkʉi amʉ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨri ton nɨ toron amʉ' nɨrɨ.  
\v 13 Mɨrɨ a'tai, main eta'pʉ iya, “Ɨyo' tʉwɨse enta'nakɨ,” tawon. 
\p  
\v 14 E'tane Pi'ta uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Uyepuru, mɨrɨ kupʉ uya pʉra man; ɨri tasa' na'ne' nan ipɨ' Main uya annin pen urɨ,” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya. 
\p  
\v 15 Papa uya ta'pʉ ipɨ', akon ite'kwa pe, “Wakʉ enta'nan nɨto' pe Papa nʉkoneka'pʉ pɨ' ɨri kʉkai,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 16 Pi'ta uya serɨ main eta'pʉ osorʉwau ite'kwa, mɨrɨ pe rɨ, o' amʉ' en enuku'pʉ ka' pona. \fig Mɨrɨ yau iyesi'pʉ ti'tui' pʉra rɨ ene amʉ', ɨkʉi amʉ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨri ton nɨ toron amʉ' nɨrɨ.|src="CN01945B.tif" size="span" loc="ACT 10:9-16" copy="David C. Cook" ref="10:12" \fig* 
\s1 Koneriyas Poitorʉ Ton Uya Pi'ta Warinpa'pʉ 
\p  
\v 17 Pi'ta usenuminka koro'tau, “Ɨ'rɨ kuru si ekamanin se ko?” tukai', Koneriyas nennoko'san ka'pon amʉ' esi'pʉ enuri'nɨ pɨ' mʉra'ta nau.  
\v 18 To' uya ekama'po'pʉ, “Moro pe' serɨ yau ka'pon, Saiman, Pi'ta tato' nai?” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 19 Ɨ'rɨ ta e'kwa pe serɨ esi se, ta Pi'ta uya koro'tau, “Osorʉwawon kon\f + \fr 10:19 \fq Osorʉwawon; \ft tʉron nɨ ton imenukasa' ton uya \fq asa'ron \ft ta; tʉron nɨ ton imenukasa' ton uya inonpaai ekama pʉra iyesi.\f* ka'pon amʉ' esi ɨyenpai,” ta'pʉ Ita'kwarʉ uya ipɨ'.  
\v 20 “E'mʉ'sa'ka', ɨu'tɨ'; tʉusenuminkai' pʉra itɨkɨ to' a'kɨrɨ. To' enno'sa' uya mɨrɨ ɨpiya',” ta'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 21 “Urɨ kʉrɨ rɨ anwarinpanʉ kon. Ɨ'rɨ na'kɨ pɨkɨrɨ uyense'na mɨsi'tʉu?” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya to' pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 22 “Koneriyas, Roman amʉ' soisaai epuru uya ina enno'sa' man,” ta'pʉ to' uya ipɨ'. “Ipokena' pe te'sen mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tɨwɨrɨ rɨ Papa eseru poro ɨko'mamʉ i'se te'sen; Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya nɨrɨ wakʉ kʉrɨ rɨ tato' ipɨ'. Papa inserʉʉi uya auro'ka'pʉ ɨuye'to' pe itiwʉ' ta' auro'kato' auya etato' pe iya,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 23 “Ewai',” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya to' pɨ', mɨrɨpan uya to' ewonnʉkʉ'pʉ tʉpiya' to' apontɨi'. 
\s1 Koneriyas Uya Pi'ta Ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ 
\p Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, Pi'ta e'sara'tɨ'pʉ utɨn pɨ' to' a'kɨrɨ. Isa'pa apai Sises apurɨnin nan e'sara'tɨ'pʉ itonpa pe.  
\v 24 Iyema'sa' yau, Sisariya epokaa'pʉ to' uya. Tʉtonpa ton akonta awon kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉtonpa ton kuru tamʉranʉ'se Koneriyas esi'pʉ to' enupɨkɨrɨ.  
\v 25 Pi'ta ewomʉ koro'tau, Koneriyas utɨ'pʉ mʉra'ta na' ipiya' ata'mo'kai' inama tʉuya ekamanin pe.  
\v 26 Pi'ta uya ipika'tɨ'pʉ i'mʉ'sa'ka pɨ' itemiyatʉ pɨ' ta'sii', “E'mʉ'sa'ka', urɨ pɨ' kɨpʉremai, ka'pon nɨ marɨ urɨ, awaraino,” ta'pʉ iya ipɨ'. 
\p  
\v 27 Asaurokʉi'ma iya'kɨrɨ Pi'ta ewomʉ'pʉ, tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' amʉrasa' koro'ta'.  
\v 28 “I'tu auya'nokon mɨrɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' enta'na pʉra iyesi tʉron kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen a'kɨrɨ, to' rɨ ka'kʉranpa to' uya pʉra rɨ iyesi to' iwʉ' ta'. E'tane pʉra, Papa uya enpoikasa' man uyenu ya' tʉron kon wakʉ pe inkoneka'san pɨ' ɨri tukai' esi namai'.  
\v 29 Mɨrɨ wenai, ukan ka'pon amʉ' enno'sa' auya a'tai, inke pʉra rɨ uye'nɨ pɨ' epori'ma'pʉ. Apʉne ekama'; ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' ukɨ'masa' auya?” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya ipɨ'. 
\s1 Koneriyas Uya Tʉnene'pʉ Ekama'pʉ Pi'ta Pɨ' 
\p  
\v 30 Koneriyas uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Asakɨrɨ'ne ipata'pʉ pe wʉi utɨka'sa' serɨ, uiwʉ' tau ɨpʉreman pɨ' esi koro'tau, ko'maan pe iwa, 3 a'kʉra', ite'kwanau pʉra rɨ, ka'pon a'kwa ipon e'soto'kasa' esi'pʉ upiyau,  
\v 31 mɨrɨpan uya ta'pʉ, ‘Koneriyas, Papa uya ɨwɨpʉremato' etasa' man, entu'manin nan repa auya nɨrɨ i'tusa' iya man.  
\v 32 Mɨrɨ wenai, Isa'pa pona Saiman Pi'ta kɨ'mase'na ka'pon amʉ' ɨnenno'kɨ. Saiman nɨ marɨ itese' ka'pon o' pi'pɨ konepɨtʉ pɨ' te'sen piyau iyesi mɨrɨ, parau e'pi po na'ne',’ ta'pʉ iya upɨ'.  
\v 33 Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, ka'pon amʉ' ennoko'pʉ uya ɨkɨ'mai'. Wakʉ pe rɨ umaimu awɨrɨ ɨuye'sa' man. Serɨ pe si ina amʉrasa' man tanporo Papa uya tentane'nokon, tanporo rɨ Itepuru uya ɨrepasa' ina auro'kato' auya ike ke ekama auya etase'na. Asauro'kɨ si,” ta'pʉ Koneriyas uya. 
\s1 Papa Uya Tanporon Kon I'nʉnka 
\p  
\v 34 Pi'ta e'sara'tɨ'pʉ to' auro'ka pɨ', “Serɨ pe ito'ka'nʉkʉ uya, i'napai rɨ Papa esi tanporo ka'pon amʉ' i'nʉnkanin pe ɨsi'kaisa rɨ,\x - \xo 10:34 \xt Isu'taronomi 10:17\x* 
\v 35 tanporon kon nɨ tʉnamanin nan, ipoken te'sen ku'nin nan anʉmʉ Papa uya, ɨnʉ' yan pe rɨ to' e'tane.  
\v 36 I'tu auya'nokon, Papa uya tʉmaimu ennoko'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' piya'. Wakʉ itekare ekama'pʉ iya, wakʉ pe tʉpokon pe uko'man nɨ emapu'tɨnin Sises poro. (Sises esi Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru pe rɨken pen, e'tane tanporon kon nɨ epuru pe iyesi.)  
\v 37 Tanporon nɨ e'kupʉ'pʉ Isutiya pata poro'ne i'tu auya'nokon mɨrɨ. Mɨrɨ ton e'sara'tɨ'pʉ Kiyarari po, itekare ekama pɨ' epa'taisimapɨ' nɨ pɨ' Isaan esi'pʉ pata'pʉ pe.  
\v 38 I'tu auya'nokon Sises, Nasare' pon Papa uya Ta'kwarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉmeruntɨrʉ tʉrʉ'pʉ ipona. Sises utɨpɨtʉ'pʉ nɨrɨ wakʉ kupʉ pɨ' pata kaisa rɨ'ne, ka'pon amʉ' epi'tɨpɨtʉ pɨ' Makoi meruntɨrʉ apai. Sises uya serɨ ton kupʉ'pʉ Papa esi wenai tʉpika'tɨnin pe. 
\p  
\v 39 “Ina esi mɨrɨ tanporo Esuwerʉ amʉ' pata'se' awɨrɨ, Surusiran poro rɨ, inkupʉ'pʉ tʉnene'pʉ kon ekamanin pe. To' uya iwɨnɨ'pʉ kurusu' pona tʉpokapɨ'se.  
\v 40 Mɨrɨ rɨ e'tane, nurɨne iye'to' pe Papa uya i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ osorʉwau wʉi tʉpo. Papa uya ka'pon amʉ' uya ento' pe ikupʉ'pʉ.  
\v 41 Tanporon kon uya kuru ene'pʉ pen; ina rɨken ennin nan pe anʉnsa' kon uya Sises ene'pʉ, tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' auro'kanin nan pe ina e'to' pe. Ina iyenta'nasa' kon iya'kɨrɨ, ensinin nʉ'san nɨ iya'kɨrɨ, nurɨne iyenasa' a'tai terikʉ tʉpo,  
\v 42 kʉrɨ rɨ uya ina auro'kasa' itekare ekamanin pe ina e'to' pe ka'pon amʉ' pɨ'. Kʉrɨ rɨ kʉrɨ rɨ Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ tanporon kon eseru aimenkanin pe tanporo nurɨnan kon, iyeri'sa' kon nɨ nɨrɨ.  
\v 43 Tanporo kareta amʉ' pu'kena' ton nʉmenuka'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' auro'kanin pe ipɨ' uya serɨ ekamasa': Ɨnʉ' rɨ kʉrɨ Sises apurɨnin pe te'sen uya, tʉmakooi pɨ' usentu'man nɨto' eporo mɨrɨ itese' poro,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\s1 Papa A'kwarʉ U'tɨ'pʉ To' Pona 
\p  
\v 44 Pi'ta usaurokʉ koro'tau, ite'kwanau pʉra rɨ, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ u'tɨ'pʉ tanporo ka'pon amʉ' etanin nan pona.  
\v 45 Isa'pa winon kon, Esuwerʉ amʉ', Sises apurɨnin nan, Pi'ta a'kɨrɨ iye'sa' kon usewansiuka'pʉ, apʉne pʉra Papa uya Ta'kwarʉ tʉsa' pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen nɨ pona.  
\v 46-47 Tʉron nɨ main\f + \fr 10:46-47 \fq main, \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq ani\f* yau'ne, Papa apurɨpɨtʉ to' uya, eta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p Mɨrɨ a'tai, Pi'ta uya ta'pʉ, “I'napai rɨ man wakʉ pe, pʉsamoro epa'taisimato' pe iyesi tuna ke. To' uya Wakʉ A'kwarʉ eposa' man urɨ'nokon uya eposa' na'ne' kasa rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 48 To' apiyo'ma'pʉ iya to' epa'taisimato' pe Sises Kʉrai ese' yau, mɨrɨpan kon uya Pi'ta ekama'po'pʉ tʉpiyau'nokon iko'manto' pe miyarɨ rʉ'kwɨ parɨ. 
\c 11  
\s1 Pi'ta Epataka'pʉ 
\p  
\v 1 Enno'sa' kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon to' tonpa ton Isutiya po tʉuko'mansan uya, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen nɨ uya Papa ekareei anʉnsa' tawon eta'pʉ.  
\v 2 Pi'ta utɨsa' a'tai Surusiran pona, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen yun pi'pɨ puturʉka tawon nan uya isapema'pʉ mɨrɨ yau.  
\v 3 “Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen nɨ piya' ɨutɨpɨtʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ auta're'tɨpɨtʉ to' piyau,” ta'pʉ to' uya Pi'ta pɨ'.  
\v 4 Mɨrɨ pɨ' nin si tanporo iye'ku'sa' rʉ'pʉ pataka'pʉ Pi'ta uya na'ne' to' pɨ'; 
\p  
\v 5 “Isa'pa pata po ɨpʉreman pɨ' esi'pʉ. Mɨrɨpan koro'tau, ka' apai eke kareku waraino a'kwa' kasa ewa'tɨsa' asakɨrɨ'nan si'na' ke itekun enne'pɨ'ne u'tɨ ene'pʉ uya upiya', Papa uya uyenu a'kwakasa' koro'tau.  
\v 6 Mɨrɨ yau, tu'kan kon nɨ ti'tui' pʉra rɨ ene amʉ', ɨkʉi amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨri ton nɨ toron amʉ' rɨ ene'pʉ uya.  
\v 7 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Papa uya uyauro'ka eta'pʉ uya, ‘Pi'ta, ɨyo' oton tʉwɨse enta'na',’ tawon. 
\p  
\v 8 “‘Kane, Uyepuru, ikupʉ uya pʉra iyesi, apʉne pʉra kamoro warai'nan o' amʉ' ansa' uya pʉra kuru rɨ iyesi,’ tukai' imaimu eikʉ'pʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 9 “Akon ite'kwa pe kanan uyauro'ka'pʉ iya, ‘Ɨ'rɨ pɨ' rɨ ɨri kʉkai, tanporon nɨ Papa nʉkoneka'pʉ esi wakʉ pe.’  
\v 10 Serɨ e'kupʉ'pʉ osorʉwau ite'kwa. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, ene amʉ' apon kareku waraino enuku'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 11 “Mɨrɨ a'tai, osorʉwawon kon ka'pon amʉ' uyee'pʉ itau e'to' ɨutɨ airɨ, Koneriyas nennoko'san upiya' Sisariya apai.  
\v 12 Papa A'kwarʉ uya uyauro'ka'pʉ te'kʉ'kʉ'mai' pʉra rɨ to' a'kɨrɨ utɨto' pe, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pe pʉra rɨ to' e'tane. 6 kaisaron kon Isa'pa pon kon utonpa ton utɨ'pʉ uya'kɨrɨ Sisariya pona. Mɨrɨ yau, ka'pon iwʉ' ta' ina ewomʉ'pʉ.  
\v 13 Mɨrɨpan uya inserʉ e'mʉ'sa'kasa' ene'pʉ tʉuya ekama'pʉ ina pɨ', ‘Ka'pon amʉ' enno'kɨ Isa'pa pona Saiman Pi'ta kɨ'mai'.  
\v 14 Ekama iya mɨrɨ, Papa uya tanporo ɨiwʉ' tawon kon pika'tɨto' oton,’ tukai', ta'pʉ inserʉ uya ipɨ'. 
\p  
\v 15 “Usaurokʉ e'sara'tɨ pe rɨ, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ u'tɨ'pʉ to' pona, wapiya upona'nokon iu'tɨ'pʉ kasa.  
\v 16 Mɨrɨ a'tai, i'tu'pʉ uya Itepuru Sises uya ta'pʉ rʉ'pʉ, ‘Isaan uya ka'pon amʉ' pa'taisimapɨtʉ tuna ke, e'tane ɨmɨrɨ'nokon epa'taisimato' oton Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke,’ tawon.\x - \xo 11:16 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 1:5\x* 
\v 17 Papa uya mɨrɨ rɨ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke to' repasa' urɨ'nokon repa'pʉ tʉuya ike ke rɨ Itepuru Sises Kʉrai apurɨ'nokon a'tai, ɨnʉ' pe ken si te'ku'se Papa ereutanʉkʉ i'se esi?” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya ka'pon amʉ' Surusiran pon kon pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 18 Serɨ eta to' uya a'tai, Pi'ta sapemato' tʉuya'nokon ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ to' uya, Papa rɨken apurɨpɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya. “Papa uya ken ka'wa Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen kanan ku'sa' tʉmakooi kon apai tera'tɨi' tʉuko'mansan pe,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\s1 Apurɨnin Nan Antiyo' Pon Kon 
\p  
\v 19 Ka'pon amʉ' uya Si'tipʉn wɨnɨ'pʉ si'kɨrɨ, Sises apurɨnin nan apʉrʉmʉ'pʉ Surusiran apai tʉron nɨ pata ya'ne, apʉne pʉra mɨrɨ yawon kon ka'pon amʉ' uya tʉkota'ma kon pɨ'. Tʉron kon to' tonpa ton utɨ'pʉ Pini'siya pata ya', Sai'pʉras opa'wʉ pona, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Antiyo' pata ya'. To' uya Sises ekareei ekama esi'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pɨ' rɨken mɨrɨ ton pata yau'ne.\x - \xo 11:19 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 8:1-4\x* 
\v 20 Tʉron kon Sises apurɨnin nan esi'pʉ Sai'pʉras opa'wʉ pon kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairini pata yawon kon, mɨrɨpan kon utɨ'pʉ Antiyo' pata ya'. Mɨrɨ yau, itekare ekama'pʉ to' uya Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen nɨ pɨ', wakʉ Itepuru Sises ekareei.  
\v 21 Mɨrɨpan kon pika'tɨ'pʉ Papa uya. Itekare ekama pɨ' to' esi koro'tau, tu'kan kon nɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen nɨ ena'pʉ Sises apurɨnin nan pe, mɨrɨpan kon era'tɨ'pʉ Papa winɨkʉi'. 
\p  
\v 22 Surusiran pon kon apurɨnin nan uya serɨ etasa' esi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon uya Panapas ennoko'pʉ Antiyo' pona.  
\v 23 Pata eposa' tʉuya a'tai, Papa uya eke pe rɨ wakʉ nonkasa' to' pona ene'pʉ iya. Pori' pe iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya to' pori'mapɨtʉ'pʉ miyarɨ rɨ Sises apurɨnin nan pe to' e'to' pe tanporo tewan kon pokon pe.  
\v 24 Panapas esi'pʉ wakʉ kuru ka'pon, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke ita'kwarʉ'tɨsa', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ apurɨto' ke, mɨrɨpan uya tu'kan kon nɨ pika'tɨ'pʉ Itepuru Sises apurɨnin nan pe. 
\p  
\v 25 Mɨrɨpan tʉpo, Panapas utɨ'pʉ Tarʉsas pona Saarʉ epose'na.  
\v 26 Mɨrɨpan uya eposa' a'tai, inee'pʉ iya Antiyo' pona. Mɨrɨ yau, Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saarʉ pokon uko'mamʉ'pʉ tikin nɨ wʉipiya apurɨnin nan pokon pe te'sepopɨ'se, mɨrɨpan kon uya tu'kan kon nɨ ka'pon amʉ' enupapɨtʉ'pʉ. Antiyo' po wapiya kuru Sises poitorʉ ton esakʉ'pʉ to' uya mɨrɨ Kʉri'san amʉ' tukai'. 
\p  
\v 27 Mɨrɨ a'tai'ne, Sises apurɨnin nan, pu'kena' amʉ' utɨ'pʉ Antiyo' pona, Surusiran apai.  
\v 28 Tikin nɨ to' tonpa, Akapas itese', e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ asauro'se'na. Papa A'kwarʉ uya tauro'kato' awɨrɨ ekama'pʉ iya to' pɨ', “Eke iwankan uta'mo'kan pɨ' man tanporo pata emʉ' kaisa rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. (Serɨ e'kupʉ'pʉ Kʉrautiyas esi a'tai Ron o'no te'san pata ton epuru pe.)\x - \xo 11:28 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 21:10\x* 
\v 29 Sises pɨ' enupasa' kon e'kama'pʉ Isutiya pon kon tʉtonpa kon repa pɨ' pʉrata ke.  
\v 30 Mɨrɨpan kon uya ikupʉ'pʉ, pʉrata ennoko'pʉ to' uya so'si epuru ton ena', Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saarʉ pokon enau. 
\c 12  
\s1 Pi'ta Epa'ka'pʉ Pariki'si Tapai 
\p  
\v 1 Mɨrɨ koro'tau, Sises apurɨnin nan kota'ma i'se kin Era' esi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya soisa amʉ' ennoko'pʉ so'si epuru ton Surusiran pon kon a'sise'na, mɨrɨpan kon tʉto' pe to' uya pariki'si ta'.  
\v 2 Era' uya soisa apiyo'ma'pʉ Isens, Isaan rui wɨto' pe iya supara ke.  
\v 3 Era' uya i'tu'pʉ Isens wɨsa' tʉuya a'tai, pori' pe kuru Esuwerʉ amʉ' ena'pʉ tukai', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ soisa amʉ' kanan apiyo'ma'pʉ iya Pi'ta a'sito' pe to' uya iwɨto' pe kanan. Serɨ e'kupʉ'pʉ A'sarutanʉ'sa' Pen Pʉreti Pɨ' Enta'nan Weyu a'tai.  
\v 4 Soisa amʉ' uya Pi'ta a'si tʉpo, to' uya arɨ'pʉ pariki'si ta', mɨrɨpan Era' uya asakɨrɨ'nan kon iyamu'kuru' ton asakɨrɨ'nan yawon kon soisa amʉ' apiyo'ma'pʉ erasuntɨ pɨ'. Era' esi'pʉ Pi'ta tenpa'kai' pariki'si tapai ɨnekama'popɨ'pai Esuwerʉ amʉ' pana airɨ, To' Epoi Itɨ'pʉ Weyu Rʉ'pʉ tʉpo.\x - \xo 12:4 \xt E'sotas 12:1-27\x* 
\v 5 Mɨrɨ pɨ' rɨ pariki'si tau Pi'ta enkurunpa'pʉ to' uya, e'tane apurɨnin nan esi'pʉ Papa ekama'po pɨ', Pi'ta pika'tɨto' pe iya. 
\p  
\v 6 Era' e'kamasa' Pi'ta enpa'ka pɨ' ekama'popɨ'to' pe tʉuya mɨn winon ewarupɨɨi tau, Pi'ta esi'pʉ e'nʉn nɨ pɨ' asa'ron kon soisa amʉ' a'sanau. To' uya itemekon auronpɨ'sa' esi'pʉ. Tʉron kon soisa amʉ' esi'pʉ mʉra'ta erasuntɨ pɨ'.  
\v 7 Ite'kwanau pʉra rɨ, inserʉ usenpoika'pʉ Pi'ta piya', mɨrɨpan uya a'kwa pe pata kupʉ'pʉ pariki'si tau. Inserʉ uya Pi'ta enpaka'pʉ ta'pɨ'pɨ'se, “Inke pʉra e'mʉ'sa'ka',” ta'pʉ iya, mɨrɨpan auronpɨ'sa' itemiyatʉ utaranka'pʉ.  
\v 8 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, “Ekoneka', asapatooi ipata'tɨ',” ta'pʉ inserʉ uya ipɨ', mɨrɨpan kupʉ'pʉ Pi'ta uya. “Ɨpon pʉro'pon ipata'tɨ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ uya'kɨrɨ ɨsi'kɨ,” ta'pʉ inserʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 9 Pi'ta utɨ'pʉ iya'kɨrɨ pariki'si tapai. I'napai rɨ pe' ne'ku'ai'ne' esi tai'ma rɨ Pi'ta epa'ka'pʉ pariki'si tapai, tenu uta'kwakasa' uya rɨ na'kɨ ene tukai' ɨsenuminkai'ma.  
\v 10 Pi'ta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ inserʉ uya wapiyaro' kon soisa amʉ' entakakaa'pʉ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ite'ma'pʉ pe te'san kanan entakakaa'pʉ to' uya. Soisa amʉ' uya to' ene pʉra. To' uye'kaa'pʉ wa'ka pun pe te'sen mʉra'ta na', pata ya' tʉutɨsen, mɨrɨpan mʉra'ta uta'koka'pʉ tiwano' pe rɨ, mɨrɨpan kon epa'ka'pʉ. Ɨnnɨ rʉ'kwɨ rɨ asanta tau to' utɨkaa'pʉ tʉpo, inserʉ uya inɨmɨ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 11 “I'napairɨ rɨ ka'si, pariki'si tapai epa'kasa' serɨ wa!” ta'pʉ Pi'ta uya. “Si'tuka'ai' si, Itepuru uya tinserʉʉi enno'sa' upika'tɨi' Era' esi tʉnkupʉnʉ ɨnku'pai upɨ' apai mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ iye'kupʉ kuru tawon nan nɨrɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' piyapai,” ta'pʉ iya. \fig Ite'kwanau pʉra rɨ, inserʉ usenpoika'pʉ Pi'ta piya'.|src="CN01953B.tif" size="span" loc="ACT 12:1-11" copy="David C. Cook" ref="12:7" \fig* 
\p  
\v 12 Pi'ta uya i'tusa' a'tai, itɨ'pʉ Meri, Isaan san iwʉ' ta'. Tu'kan kon nɨ ka'pon amʉ' amʉrasa' ɨpʉremase'na tepose.  
\v 13 Pi'ta uya mʉra'ta wɨpɨtʉ'pʉ. Ka'pon uya rɨ tewonnʉ'to' pe, apiyo' pe rʉ'kwɨ te'sen, Rota itese' uyee'pʉ imaimu'se'na mʉra'ta na'.  
\v 14 Pi'ta maimu etasa' tʉuya a'tai, epori'mai'ma iyeka'tumʉ'pʉ, mʉra'ta ta'kokai' pʉra, ɨutɨ tawon kon pana'tɨi', “Pi'ta man mʉra'ta nau!” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 15 “Ɨ'rɨ uya ayano'ma, Rota?” ta'pʉ to' uya ipɨ', e'tane rɨ akonomapɨ'kaa'pʉ iya, 
\p “Pi'ta esi mɨ airɨ ukayai'ne ko!” takaa'pʉ iya kanan. 
\p “A'tai pʉra itinserʉʉi rɨ na'kɨ,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 16 Mʉra'ta wɨpɨtʉ pɨ' rɨ Pi'ta esi'pʉ to' uya a'kokato' pe. To' uya a'kokasa' a'tai, to' usewansiuka'pʉ ene tʉuya'nokon pɨ'.  
\v 17 Pi'ta uya temiyatʉ ke e'pana e'tɨ' ta'pʉ to' pɨ', mɨrɨpan uya Papa inserʉʉi uya tenpa'kasa' pariki'si tapai rʉ'pʉ ekama'pʉ. “Serɨ mekamatʉi' Isens pɨ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon ɨtonpa kon amʉ' pɨ',” ta'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, tʉron nɨ pata ya' itɨ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 18 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, soisa amʉ' utaipo'pʉ ipan pe rɨ, apʉne pʉra ɨ'rɨ kasa Pi'ta epa'ka'pʉ tukai' to' uya i'tu pʉra rɨ iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 19 Era' uya soisa amʉ' apiyo'ma'pʉ Pi'ta warinpato' pe to' uya, e'tane to' uya eporo pʉra iyesi'pʉ. Mɨrɨ pɨ' to' ekama'popɨtʉ'pʉ iya, ɨ'rɨ kasa Pi'ta epa'ka'pʉ tukai', e'tane to' nekama ton pʉra rɨ iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya tʉron kon soisa amʉ' apiyo'ma'pʉ Pi'ta erasuntɨnin nan pe iku'sa' kon nʉ'san wɨto' pe to' uya. 
\p Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Era' utɨ'pʉ Sisariya pona Isutiya ponsi'kɨ, mɨrɨpan uko'mamʉ'pʉ inke rʉ'kwɨ rɨ. 
\s1 Era' Uma'tato' 
\p  
\v 20 Era' usakorota'pʉ ipan pe rɨ Taya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saitan pon kon ka'pon amʉ' pɨ'. Tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' Taya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saitan pon kon tonpa ton utɨ'pʉ Era' ense'na. Era' poitorʉ, eke pe kuru te'sen Pʉrastas e'to' pe tʉmaimu kon awɨrɨ kin Era' auro'kato' pe to' uya ekama'po'pʉ, tʉpata'se' kon yawon kon ka'pon amʉ' e'to' pe wakʉ pe kin a'kɨrɨ tukai', apʉne pʉra kin pata'se' apai ti'kiyari kon eponin nan pe te'to' kon pe. 
\p  
\v 21 Tʉweyu pe tʉneporo'pʉ a'tai, Era' uya tʉpon pata'tɨ'pʉ kin pe tesi ekamanin, mɨrɨpan ereuta'pʉ tapon po, ka'pon amʉ' iyamʉrasa' kon auro'ka pɨ'.  
\v 22 “Pʉse rɨ kʉrɨ rɨ Papa nʉsauro'ai'ne', ka'pon pen nɨ!” tukai', ka'pon amʉ' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ Era' pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 23 Inke pʉra Papa inserʉʉi uya eno'ma'pʉ non pona, apʉne pʉra ka'pon amʉ' uya tapurɨ i'se iyesi wenai mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Papa ru'ku inamatɨ' ta iya kasa pʉra. Mɨrɨpan anɨ'pʉ weruwe amʉ' uya, mɨrɨpan erikʉ'pʉ.\x - \xo 12:23 \xt 2 Ma'kapis 9:5-28\x* 
\p  
\v 24 E'tane Papa maimu rɨ esi'pʉ miyarɨ rɨ utɨn pɨ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ epan nɨ pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 25 Tʉtʉrawasooi kon u'ma'sa' a'tai, Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saarʉ pokon enna'po'pʉ Surusiran poi.\f + \fr 12:25 \ft Tʉron nɨ imenukasa' ton, \fq Surusiran pona \ft tawon pe iyesi.\f*\f + \fr 12:25 \ft Tʉron nɨ imenukasa' ton, \fq Surusiran poi Antiyo' pona \ft tawon pe iyesi.\f* Isaan, Ma' tato' nee'pʉ to' uya ta'kɨrɨ'nokon. 
\c 13  
\s1 Panapas, Saarʉ Ennoko'pʉ To' Uya 
\p  
\v 1 Antiyo' po so'si tau te'san koro'tau, pu'kena' ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ enupanin nan esi'pʉ. Kamoro si esi'pʉ Panapas; Simiyan, Mekoro tukai' to' nesakʉnʉ; Rusiyas, Sairini itese' pata winon; Manayen, kopʉna Era' isakon pe isemo'kasa' rʉ'pʉ; mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saarʉ.  
\v 2 Papa apurɨ pɨ' to' esi koro'tau, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉuta're'tɨi' pʉra to' useruma koro'tau, Papa A'kwarʉ uya to' auro'ka'pʉ, “Inke pʉra serɨ pe Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saarʉ pokon anʉntɨ', uyapiyo' ton pe, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉkɨ'ma'pʉ uya 'nokon ya' ku'se'na to' utɨto' pe,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 3 Mɨrɨpan tenta'nai' pʉra tʉuseruma kon tʉpo, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉwɨpʉrema kon tʉpo, to' pona'ne temiyatʉ kon nonkapɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya to' pʉrema pe, mɨrɨpan kon ennoko'pʉ to' uya. 
\s1 Paarʉ Esi'pʉ Sai'pʉras Pata Po 
\p  
\v 4 Papa A'kwarʉ uya Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saarʉ pokon ennoko'pʉ tu'kan pata yau'ne tʉnekamanʉ kon ekama pɨ'. To' utɨ'pʉ Antiyo' ponsi'kɨ Seru'siya pona, mɨrɨpan kon ekanwa'tɨ'pʉ, Saramis pona tʉutɨto' kon pe, Sai'pʉras opa'wʉri pon.  
\v 5 Saramis po si tesi kon koro'tau, Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ta' to' utɨ'pʉ, Papa Maimu ekama'pʉ to' uya. Isaan Ma' esi'pʉ mɨrɨ to' a'kɨrɨ to' pika'tɨ pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 6 Tanporo mɨrɨ opa'wʉ ti'ma'kai' to' usarɨ'pʉ, Pa'pos itese' pata eporo tʉuya'nokon pona rɨ. Mɨrɨ pata yau, Esuwerʉ enwoke' pe esii'ma akono pe te'sen esi'pʉ Parʉ-Sises itese'.  
\v 7 Mɨrɨ opa'wʉ epuru pe te'sen, Sɨsiyas Paaros itese' a'kɨrɨ inke itɨpɨtʉ'pʉ. Kʉrɨ rɨ kopʉna esi'pʉ i'tunin kuru. Tikin nan ka'pon ennoko'pʉ iya Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saarʉ kɨ'mase'na to' uye'to' pe tʉpiya', apʉne pʉra Papa Maimu ɨnetapai tesi pɨ'. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Saarʉ pokon utɨ'pʉ ipɨ' ekamase'na.  
\v 8 E'tane pʉse rɨ ka'pon, Erimas tato' ipɨ' Kiri' amʉ' maimu yau, enwoke' ta e'kwa pe esi'pʉ to' i'se pʉra, kopʉna auro'ka'pʉ iya Sises apurɨ iya namai'.  
\v 9 Mɨrɨ a'tai Saarʉ, Paarʉ tukai' to' nesakʉnʉ uta'kwarʉ'tɨ'pʉ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke uya to'sa rɨ Erimas ene'pʉ,  
\v 10 mɨrɨpan uya, “Makoi kasa kuru me'ai'! Wakʉ pe te'sen ewaruma'tɨ auya! Kasi pe rɨ ka'pon amʉ' auro'ka auya, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron nɨ ton nɨ ɨri ton nɨ kupʉ auya to' pɨ'. I'napairon nɨ Papa eseru ensima i'se ɨwe'to' ereutanʉ'kɨ!  
\v 11 Serɨ pe kuru Papa uya ɨkota'ma mɨrɨ, tenku'ne ɨyena mɨrɨ, mɨrɨpan inke kuru pʉra rɨ wʉi enu tense pʉra ɨuko'mamʉ mɨrɨ,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya ipɨ'. 
\p Inke pʉra rɨ, tenku'ne iyena'pʉ kapuru' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ewarupɨ uyee'pʉ ipona, mɨrɨpan usarɨ'pʉ te'ma a'pɨtʉ i'se, ka'pon nɨ i'se iyesi'pʉ temiyatʉ pɨ' tanin oton.  
\v 12 Paarʉ uya enwoke' auro'ka'pʉ iye'ku'sa' ipɨ' tense, kopʉna uya, “i'napairon,” ta'pʉ Sises ekareei pɨ'. Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas nekamanʉ Sises ekareei pɨ' isewansiuka'pʉ. 
\s1 Paarʉ, Panapas Pokon Esi'pʉ Antiyo' Po 
\p  
\v 13 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ iya'kɨrɨ te'san itonpa ton utɨ'pʉ kanau yai Pa'pos ponsi'kɨ Pɨrʉka, Panperiya awon pona. Mɨrɨ yau, Isaan Ma' uya to' nɨmɨ'pʉ. Surusiran pona iyenna'po'pʉ.  
\v 14 Pɨrʉka ponsi'kɨ to' utɨ'pʉ Antiyo', Pi'sitiya yawon pona. Sapa' a'tai, to' utɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ta', mɨrɨpan kon ereuta'pʉ.  
\v 15 Mosi' nʉmenuka'pʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ pu'kena' amʉ' nʉmenuka'pʉ usekama'pʉ tʉpo, Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' epuru ton uya ka'pon ennoko'pʉ Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas piya' tʉmaimu kon pe, mɨrɨpan uya, “Ina tonpa ton, ɨnʉ' rɨ esi a'tai asauro'pai tɨwɨ ka'pon amʉ' auro'kai' to' pori'ma pe,” ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'.  
\v 16 Mɨrɨ yau, Paarʉ e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ, temiyatʉ ari'ma'pʉ iya, e'pana to' e'to' pe, mɨrɨpan uya, 
\p “Utonpa ton, Esuwerʉ amʉ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen, Papa namanin nan, umaimu etatɨ'!  
\v 17 Papa, urɨ'nokon Esuwerʉ amʉ' napurɨnʉ uya utamokori kon anʉmʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon epankasa' tʉuya, ka'kʉran pe to' esi koro'tau Isi' po. Inke rɨ tʉuko'mamʉ tʉpo, Papa uya tʉmeruntɨrʉ ke to' enpa'ka'pʉ mɨrɨ pata apai.\x - \xo 13:17 \xt E'sotas 1:7; 12:51\x* 
\v 18 Tʉmaimu awɨrɨ pʉra rɨ to' e'tane, to' nʉkupʉnʉ moronka pɨ' iyesi'pʉ 40 kaisa rɨ wʉipiya rɨmono' tau to' uko'mamʉ koro'tau.\x - \xo 13:18 \xt Nonpa 14:34; Isu'taronomi 1:31\x* 
\v 19 Papa uya to' pika'tɨ'pʉ 7 kaisaron kon tʉpataron kon Kenan pon kon ka'pon amʉ' enpa'kato' pe to' uya, mɨrɨpan uya to' nono tʉsa' uiwano' kon pe.\x - \xo 13:19 \xt Isu'taronomi 7:1; Isa'suwa 14:1\x* 
\v 20 Serɨ e'kupʉ'pʉ 450 kaisa rɨ wʉipiya yau iwa'ne rɨ. 
\p “Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Papa uya to' usewa'noma epuru pe te'ton kon anʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ, Sanwerʉ, pu'kena' pe te'sen ena to' epuru pe pona rɨ.\x - \xo 13:20 \xt Eseru Aimenkanin Nan 2:16; 1 Sanwerʉ 3:20\x* 
\v 21 Mɨrɨ a'tai, tepuru kon pe kin i'se ka'pon amʉ' esi'pʉ. Mɨrɨpan Saarʉ, Kisi mu anʉmʉ'pʉ Papa uya kin pe, mɨrɨpan uko'mamʉ'pʉ 40 kaisa rɨ wʉipiya to' epuru pe.\x - \xo 13:21 \xt 1 Sanwerʉ 8:5; 10:21\x* 
\v 22 Kin pe iye'to' yapai Saarʉ mo'ka tʉuya tʉpo, Papa uya Tepi' anʉmʉ'pʉ kin pe. Wakʉ pe kuru Papa usaurokʉ'pʉ ipɨ', ‘Eposa' uya man warawo' Tepi', Ise'si mu upori'manin pe te'sen ku'nin, i'se e'to' ku'to' iya oton mɨrɨ,’\f + \fr 13:22 \ft Eren 89:20\f* ta'pʉ Papa uya.\x - \xo 13:22 \xt 1 Sanwerʉ 13:14; 16:12\x* 
\p  
\v 23 “Papa uya Tepi' pa rʉ'pʉ, Sises ennoko'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pika'tɨse'na. Mɨrɨ kupʉ uya ta'pʉ tʉuya utamokori ton pɨ' awɨrɨ.  
\v 24 Sises e'sara'tɨ e'tʉrawasoman pɨ' rawɨrɨ, Isaan uya itekare ekama'pʉ tanporon kon Esuwerʉ awon kon pɨ', ɨri tʉnkupʉnʉ kon apai to' era'tɨto' pe, mɨrɨpan kon epa'taisimato' pe.\x - \xo 13:24 \xt Ma' 1:4; Ʉru' 3:3\x* 
\v 25 Tʉtʉrawasooi i'ma'ka tʉuya winɨkʉi', Isaan uya to' ekama'popɨtʉ'pʉ, ‘Ɨnʉ' pe uku'atʉu? Ka'pon ennoko uya mɨrɨ, tasa' rʉ'pʉ Papa uya ipɨ' pe, uyekama auya'nokon serɨ, e'tane etatɨ', serɨ pe rɨ iyepʉ mɨrɨ e'tane isapatooi mʉ' ara'ka poken pʉra rɨ esi,’ ta'pʉ iya.\x - \xo 13:25 \xt Isaan 1:20; Ma'siu 3:11; Ma' 1:7; Ʉru' 3:16; Isaan 1:27\x* 
\p  
\v 26 “Utonpa ton Esuwerʉ amʉ', Epʉra'an payan nʉ'san, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen nɨ nɨrɨ Papa namanin nan, etatɨ'! Urɨ'nokon iwano' pe kuru Papa uya epika'tɨn nɨto' eseru ennoko'pʉ.  
\v 27 Surusiran pon kon ka'pon amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' epuru ton uya i'tu pʉra iyesi'pʉ pʉse rɨ Sises esi pika'tɨnin pe tukai', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ pu'kena' amʉ' maimu Sapa' kaisa rɨ tʉusekamasen to'ka'nʉkʉ to' uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ, e'tane pu'kena' amʉ' uya ekama'pʉ awɨrɨ to' uya iwɨnɨ'pʉ.  
\v 28 Tu'kan kon nɨ ka'pon amʉ' usaurokʉ'pʉ, ‘Ɨri kupʉ Sises uya,’ tukai', e'tane iwɨto' ipɨkɨrɨ oton eporo to' uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ. Mɨrɨ rɨ e'tane, itepuru Paire' ekama'po'pʉ to' uya ima'tanʉ'to' pe iya.\x - \xo 13:28 \xt Ma'siu 27:22-23; Ma' 15:13-14; Ʉru' 23:21-23; Isaan 19:15\x* 
\v 29 Pena rɨ pu'kena' ton nekama'pʉ kupʉ'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' uya mɨrɨ Sises pɨ'. To' uya iwɨnɨ'pʉ. Kurusu' pona to' uya ipokapɨtʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan mo'ka'pʉ tʉron kon uya kurusu' poi, mɨrɨpan emaika'pʉ to' uya tɨ' akasa' uruwai' pe ya'.\x - \xo 13:29 \xt Ma'siu 27:57-61; Ma' 15:42-47; Ʉru' 23:50-56; Isaan 19:38-42\x* 
\v 30 E'tane Papa uya i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ eri'nɨto' apai.  
\v 31 Inke rɨ isenpoikapɨtʉ'pʉ ta'kɨrɨ Kiyarari ponsi'kɨ Surusiran pona itɨsa' kon enu ya', ka'pon amʉ' si ennin nʉ'san esi mɨrɨ tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' pana ya' ekama pɨ'.\x - \xo 13:31 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 1:3\x* 
\p  
\v 32 “Ina uya kanan si serɨ wakʉ kuru itekare ekama serɨ ɨpɨ'nokon. ‘Mɨrɨ kupʉ uya,’ ta'pʉ Papa uya utamokori kon pɨ' uta'ku'tɨsa' rʉ'pʉ  
\v 33 urɨ'nokon, to' payan non pɨ'. Mɨrɨ si ku'sa' iya Sises ti'mʉ'sa'kase Eren apon yau isakon pe te'sen Eren uya ekamasa' kasa, 
\q1 “‘Serɨ pe umu, tikin nan pe kuru ɨwesi mɨrɨ, 
\q2 ɨkʉipʉnʉ pe enasa' serɨ.’\f + \fr 13:33 \ft Eren 2:7\f* 
\m  
\v 34 Papa uya tʉmu i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ iyeri'sa' apai, mɨrɨpan eri'to' oton pen nɨ mɨrɨ enta'. Mɨrɨ pɨ', Papa uya utamokori kon amʉ' auro'ka'pʉ, 
\q1 “‘Ɨpika'tɨ uya 'nokon kuru mɨrɨ, umunkɨ amʉ', 
\q2 Tepi' auro'ka'pʉ uya awɨrɨ rɨ.’\f + \fr 13:34 \ft Aisaya 55:3\f* 
\m  
\v 35 Tepi' uya Kʉrai\f + \fr 13:35 \fq Kʉrai \ft (Kiri' maimu yau), mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq Me'saya \ft (Ipuru maimu yau), asa'rɨ rɨ marɨ iyesi, \fq Papa Nanʉmʉnʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe.\f* pɨ' Papa auro'kasa' tʉron nɨ Eren yau, 
\q1 “‘Ikɨtato' pe uyekepu nonka auya pen, apʉne pʉra wakʉ urɨ, ɨpoitorʉ ukɨta i'se pʉra ɨwesi.’\f + \fr 13:35 \ft Eren 16:10\f* 
\p  
\v 36 “Tʉuko'mamʉ koro'tau, Tepi' uya, ikupʉ iya i'se Papa e'to' ku'pɨtʉ'pʉ. E'tane iyerikʉ'pʉ, ka'pon uya iu'na'tɨ'pʉ, itamokori ton esi'pʉ kasa rɨ, mɨrɨpan pun ukɨta'pʉ.  
\v 37 E'tane kʉrɨ Papa nʉ'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ iyerikʉ'pʉ yapai ukɨta'pʉ pen. 
\p  
\v 38 “Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', utonpa ton, i'tu auya'nokon i'se esi Sises poro makoi pɨ' usentu'man, usekama ɨpɨ'nokon.  
\v 39 Kʉrɨ rɨ poro tanporon kon apurɨnin nan ekoneka, tanporon nɨ ekonekan pokena' pen nɨ ipiyapai, Mosi' nʉmenuka'pʉ winɨ.  
\v 40 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ti'tui' e'tɨ', pu'kena' amʉ' nekama'pʉ e'kupʉ namai' ɨpɨ'nokon: 
\q1  
\v 41 “‘Etatɨ' ɨmiyamoro, Papa sapemanin nan! 
\q2 Ɨusewansiuka kon mɨrɨ Papa nʉkupʉnʉ tense mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨyeri'to' oton kon. 
\q1 Iku'to' uya oton aya'tai'nokon 
\q2 anapurɨnʉ ton kon pen nɨ 
\q2 ka'pon uya ekama tane ɨpɨ'nokon,’\f + \fr 13:41 \ft Apa'ka' 1:5\f* 
\m tawon,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 42 Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas uya Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' nɨmɨ koro'tau, ka'pon amʉ' uya to' kɨ'ma'pʉ Sapa' a'tai to' uye'to' pe miyarɨ parɨ serɨ ton ekamase'na.  
\v 43 Ka'pon amʉ' e'nonkasa' a'tai, anpisin pe Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen e'tane Papa namanin nan uya Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas e'ma'pʉka'pʉ. Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas uya to' auro'ka'pʉ, Papa uya wakʉ nonkasa' tʉpona'nokon awɨrɨ to' uko'manto' pe. 
\p  
\v 44 Tʉron nɨ Sapa' a'tai, tu'ke rɨ anpisin pe Antiyo' pon kon amʉra'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ta' Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas usaurokʉ etase'na Itepuru Sises pɨ'.  
\v 45 Esuwerʉ amʉ' ɨkɨnta'pʉ anpisin pe ka'pon amʉ' ene tʉuya'nokon a'tai, mɨrɨpan kon usaurokʉ'pʉ ɨri pe Paarʉ pa'nʉkʉ pe.  
\v 46 Mɨrɨpan kon maimu eikʉ'pʉ Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas uya te'namai' pʉra, “Sises ekareei, Papa winon ekamato' ina uya pe iyesi wapiya Esuwerʉ amʉ' pɨ', e'tane Papa Maimu ewaruma'tɨ auya'nokon, mɨrɨ uya ekama wakʉ tɨwɨrɨ uko'man nɨto' eponin nan pe pʉra rɨ tukai' ɨye'kupʉ kon.  
\v 47 Apʉne pʉra Papa uya ina apiyontɨsa' ina uya iku'to' pe, 
\q1 “‘To' weyu pe ɨyennoko uya serɨ non emʉ' kaisaron kon ka'pon amʉ' pana'tɨse'na, 
\q2 to' pika'tɨnin pe urɨ esi pɨ',’\f + \fr 13:47 \ft Aisaya 42:6; 49:6\f* 
\m tukai',” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 48 Mɨrɨ eta Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen uya a'tai, to' epori'ma'pʉ. Papa Maimu inamato' uya. Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen, Papa nanʉmʉ'san tʉpiyau to' e'to' pe uya Sises ekareei apurɨ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 49 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Itepuru maimu utɨ'pʉ tanporo mɨrɨ nono awɨrɨ.  
\v 50 Mɨrɨ e'tane tʉron kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton uya, eke ton pe te'san ka'pon amʉ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Papa namanin nan uri'sami'si amʉ' uya Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas ewaruma'tɨto' pe ikupʉ'pʉ. Kamoro Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' auro'ka'pʉ Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas kota'mato' pe to' uya. Mɨrɨpan kon uya Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas enpa'ka'pʉ tʉnono kon apai.  
\v 51 Mɨrɨpan Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas uya ti'ta kon poi non tɨutɨ'pʉ pata nɨmɨi'ma, Papa uya to' nonkasa' ekamanin pe, mɨrɨpan kon utɨ'pʉ Ai'koniyan pona, Antiyo' ponsi'kɨ.\x - \xo 13:51 \xt Ma'siu 10:14; Ma' 6:11; Ʉru' 9:5; 10:11\x* 
\v 52 Mɨrɨ koro'tau, Sises apurɨnin nan uta'kwarʉ'tɨ'pʉ pori' ke mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ ke. 
\c 14  
\s1 Paarʉ Mɨrɨ Awonsi'kɨ Panapas Pokon Esi'pʉ Ai'koniyan Po 
\p  
\v 1 Te'to' kon kasa rɨ Ai'koniyan po, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas pokon utɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ta', mɨrɨpan kon uya wakʉ pe pori'ma' kuru rɨ itekare ekama'pʉ. Mɨrɨpan tu'ke rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen nɨ nɨrɨ ena'pʉ Sises apurɨnin nan pe.  
\v 2 E'tane Esuwerʉ amʉ' itekare apurɨnin nan pen uya Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen tʉrʉnka'pʉ ɨri pe to' pɨ' to' e'ku'to' pe.  
\v 3 Mɨrɨ yau, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas pokon uya wʉi apɨtʉ'pʉ inke rɨ. Enari'mʉra Sises ekareei ekama pɨ' to' esi'pʉ, i'napai rɨ wakʉ nonkasa' iya ekareei esi enpoikanin pe, to' repa'pʉ iya winɨ to' meruntɨrʉ ke, i'tuto' ipɨkɨrɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ a'kwarʉpɨ'nin ku'to' pe to' uya.  
\v 4 Kamoro Ai'koniyan po tʉuko'mansan epantakapɨ'sa' esi'pʉ; tʉron kon uya enno'sa' kon apurɨ'pʉ, tʉron kon uya tʉron kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' apurɨ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 5 Mɨrɨ yau, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usaurokʉ'pʉ Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas kota'mato', tepuru kon pokon pe to' e'kama'pʉ, tɨ' ke to' wɨto' pe tʉuya'nokon.  
\v 6 E'tane Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas uya etasa' esi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon utɨ'pʉ tʉron nɨ pata pona, Restʉra, Terʉpi, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ iwoino' nan pata pona, Rai'koniya pata yau.  
\v 7 Mɨrɨ yau tesi kon a'tai, itekare ekama pɨ' to' esi'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' pɨ'. 
\s1 Paarʉ, Panapas Pokon Esi'pʉ Restʉra, Terʉpi Po 
\p  
\v 8 Restʉra po ka'pon esi'pʉ ise'mepɨ'sa' i'ta. Iyentusa' a'tai, mɨrɨ kasa rɨ iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan usarɨ pʉra rɨ iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 9 Paarʉ usaurokʉ Itepuru Sises pɨ' etapɨtʉ pɨ' iyesi'pʉ. Paarʉ uya enpɨtʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan ene'pʉ iya Itepuru Sises uya kuru upika'tɨ tukai' apurɨ'pʉ iya.  
\v 10 Mɨrɨpan Paarʉ uya, “E'mʉ'sa'ka', utonpa!” ta'pʉ ipɨ' tʉukɨ'pɨ'nʉnse. Mɨrɨ etasa' tʉuya a'tai, iye'sanʉmʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan usarɨ'pʉ wakʉ pe. 
\p  
\v 11 Paarʉ nʉkupʉ'pʉ tense, papa amʉ' tato' pe rɨ Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas kupʉ'pʉ to' uya. Tʉmaimu kon, Rai'koniya pon kon maimu yau to' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ, “Apʉne, entɨ'! Pʉsamoro ka'pon amʉ' esi mɨrɨ papa amʉ' pe, e'tane ka'pon amʉ' pe to' era'tɨsa', mɨrɨpan kon u'tɨsa' ka' winɨpai upika'tɨse'na'nokon!” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 12 Mɨrɨ yau, Panapas esakʉ'pʉ to' uya Isus tukai', “Eke pe iyesi,” ta'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan Paarʉ esakʉ'pʉ to' uya Ɨrʉmes tukai', apʉne pʉra tʉusauro'sen pe iyesi pɨ'.  
\v 13 Eke pata mʉra'ta yau rɨ to' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' esi'pʉ Isus itese' tepuru kon apurɨse'na ka'pon amʉ' utɨto' ita'. Mɨrɨpan to' use'mato' tʉrawasomanin uya Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas nʉkupʉ'pʉ eta'pʉ. Mɨrɨpan uya asa'rɨ paka amʉ' nee'pʉ, pata ipʉrʉ to' i'mʉ woi, to' use'mato' tʉrawasomanin, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ka'pon amʉ' esi'pʉ paka amʉ' ɨnwɨpai Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas apurɨ pe tenta'nato' kon pe. 
\p  
\v 14 Mɨrɨ yau, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas uya to' e'kamasa' i'tu'pʉ paka amʉ' wɨnɨ pɨ' tapurɨ kon pe to' po'tɨto' pe tʉuya'nokon, mɨrɨpan kon uya tʉpon kon pʉro'pon karapɨtʉ'pʉ, “Kane!” ta tʉuya'nokon e'kwa pe. To' eka'tumʉ'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' koro'ta' tʉukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉi'ma'nokon,  
\v 15 “Ina tonpa ton, mɨrɨ kʉ'ku'tʉu! Ka'pon amʉ' rɨ marɨ ina, awarai'nokon nɨ marɨ! Emenna' itekare wakʉ kuru ekamai' ina uye'sa' ɨpɨ'nokon. Tʉron kon ika'sa' ton piyapai era'tɨtɨ'; i'napairon Papa piya' era'tɨtɨ'! To' uya ɨpika'tɨ kon pʉra iyesi. Kʉrɨ rɨ esi Papa pe, tanporon non koneka'pʉ iya tanporo ipo te'sen. Non koneka'pʉ iya, parau, tuna ton, ka' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporo urɨ'nokon.\x - \xo 14:15 \xt E'sotas 20:11; Eren 146:6\x* 
\v 16 Pena rɨ ɨmɨrɨ'nokon Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen esi'pʉ i'se rɨ ɨwe'to' kon apurɨ pɨ' Papa uya rɨ ɨyenpɨtʉ'pʉ kon, apʉne pʉra ti'tu auya'nokon pʉra iyesi pɨ'.  
\v 17 E'tane si, tanporon kon ka'pon amʉ' enu ya' isenpoikasa', kʉrɨ rɨ uya wakʉ ton ke repan nɨsa' tukai' i'tu kon pa. Wakʉ ton nɨ ku'sa' iya ɨiwano' kon pe: tuna enno'sa' iya; tʉweyu a'tai iyepetato' pe ɨi'kiyari kon ku'sa' iya; eke pe rɨ kiyari ke ɨrepasa' iya 'nokon; mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ pori' pe ɨku'sa' iya 'nokon,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya.  
\v 18 To' usaurokʉ eta'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' uya e'tane rɨ, to' ereutanʉkʉ i'se to' e'tane paka amʉ' wɨnɨ to' uya namai', to' ereutanʉkʉ to' uya poken pʉra iyesi'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 19 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Esuwerʉ amʉ' Antiyo' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Ai'koniyan pon kon uyee'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon uya tʉwinɨkʉi'nokon to' mo'ka'pʉ. Mɨrɨpan kon uya tɨ' ke Paarʉ wɨpɨtʉ'pʉ. Iyeri'sa' pe tekamai', to' uya ipi'sikʉ'pʉ pata apai.  
\v 20 E'tane Sises apurɨnin nan utɨ'pʉ Paarʉ piya'. To' amʉra'pʉ iwoi. Iye'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ, mɨrɨpan enna'po'pʉ pata pona to' a'kɨrɨ. Iyema'sa' yau, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas utɨ'pʉ Terʉpi pona Restʉra ponsi'kɨ. 
\s1 To' Enna'po'pʉ Antiyo', Siriya Yawon Pona 
\p  
\v 21 Mɨrɨ yau, to' uko'mamʉ'pʉ Sises ekareei Papa Maimu ekama pɨ'. Tu'kan kon nɨ kupʉ'pʉ to' uya Sises apurɨnin nan pe. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, enna'pon pɨ' to' e'sara'tɨ'pʉ Restʉra pona mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Ai'koniyan pona mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Antiyo' pona.  
\v 22 Pata kaisarɨ rɨ Sises apurɨnin nan epopɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya. To' meruntɨtanʉkʉ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon auro'ka'pʉ to' uya itekare pɨ' to' pori'ma pe, Sises rɨ apurɨ pɨ' to' uko'manto' pe. “Urɨ'nokon ekota'mato' pe iyesi Papa e'to' esa' wannɨ pe ya' epa'kan nɨto' pe,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 23 Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas uya so'si epuru pe te'ton kon anʉmʉ'pʉ. Tʉwɨpʉremai' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tenta'nai' pʉra tʉuserumai' to' tʉrʉ'pʉ to' uya to' napurɨnʉ Itepuru ena'. 
\p  
\v 24 Pi'sitiya itese' pata poro tʉutɨ kon tʉpo, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas utɨ'pʉ Panperiya pona.  
\v 25 Mɨrɨpan kon uya Pɨrʉka itese' pata eporo'pʉ, to' uya Papa Maimu ekama'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' pɨ'. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, to' utɨ'pʉ parau e'pi pona, to' uya A'tariya itese' pata eporo'pʉ.  
\v 26 A'tariya ponsi'kɨ kanau yau, parau kau to' utɨ'pʉ Antiyo' pona rɨ marɨ te'sara'tɨ'pʉ kon ya'. Mɨrɨ yau, to' tʉrʉ'pʉ Papa uya wakʉ nonkasa' ya' to' tʉrawasooi to' uya enuka'nʉ'sa' na'ne' si ku'nin pe to' e'to' pe. 
\p  
\v 27 Antiyo' pona tʉuye'sa' kon a'tai, tanporo apurɨnin nan amʉranʉkʉ'pʉ to' uya. Papa nʉkupʉ'pʉ tʉporo'nokon ekama'pʉ to' uya to' pɨ', Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen uya apurɨto' pe ikupʉ'pʉ iya rʉ'pʉ.  
\v 28 Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas pokon uko'manpɨtʉ'pʉ Antiyo' po inke rɨ kapʉi tenno'pɨ'se, Sises pɨ' enupasa' kon mɨrɨ pata yawon kon piyau. 
\c 15  
\s1 Konsʉrʉ Amʉ' Surusiran Pon Kon 
\p  
\v 1 Tʉron kon Sises apurɨnin nan utɨ'pʉ Isutiya yapai Antiyo' pona tʉtonpa kon enupase'na, “Ɨyun kon pi'pɨ puturʉkasa' auya'nokon a'tai rɨken, Mosi' nekama'pʉ awɨrɨ, Papa uya ɨpika'tɨ kon,” tase'na.\x - \xo 15:1 \xt Ripaiti'kas 12:3\x* 
\v 2 Serɨ uya, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas pokon sakoropa'pʉ, mɨrɨpan pɨ' to' pokon pe to' e'sei'pɨtʉ'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas anʉmʉ'pʉ to' uya tʉron kon apurɨnin nan pokon pe, to' utɨto' pe Surusiran pona, enno'sa' kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ so'si epuru ton ense'na to' utɨ'pʉ mɨrɨ pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 3 Apurɨnin nan uya to' ennoko'pʉ. To' utɨ koro'tau Pini'siya, Sameriya yawɨrɨ, Sises apurɨnin nan auro'ka'pʉ to' uya, “Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen enasa' man Sises apurɨnin nan pe,” tukai'. Tanporon kon epori'ma'pʉ ipan pe eta tʉuya'nokon a'tai.  
\v 4 To' uye'sa' a'tai Surusiran pona, to' ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ apurɨnin nan uya, enno'sa' kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ so'si epuru ton uya. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas uya to' pɨ' ekama'pʉ tanporo Papa nʉkupʉ'pʉ tʉporo'nokon Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen koro'tau.  
\v 5 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Sises apurɨnin nan Pari'si amʉ' tonpa ton e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon uya ta'pʉ, “Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen yun pi'pɨ puturʉkato' pe kuru rɨ iyesi mɨrɨ. Mosi' nekama'pʉ main apurɨto' pe to' uya ekama auya'nokon kuru mɨrɨ to' pɨ',” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 6 Serɨ pɨ' ɨsenuminkase'na itekare ekamai' enno'sa' kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ so'si epuru ton amʉra'pʉ.  
\v 7 Inke kuru tʉusaurokʉ kon tʉpo, Pi'ta e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ, ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ', “Utonpa ton, i'tu auya'nokon pena Papa uya uyanʉmʉ'pʉ ɨ'koro'tapai'nokon, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen uya itekare etato' pe urɨ winɨ, to' uya apurɨto' pe nɨrɨ.\x - \xo 15:7 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 10:1-43\x* 
\v 8 Papa, tanporon usenuminkato' i'tunin uya enpoika'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen anʉmʉ tʉuya Wakʉ A'kwarʉ tʉrʉ tʉuya winɨ to' pona, urɨ'nokon pɨ' ikupʉ'pʉ tʉuya kasa.\x - \xo 15:8 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 10:44; 2:4\x* 
\v 9 Tʉron nɨ pe uku'sa' iya 'nokon pʉra rɨ iyesi kamoro piyapai. To' ewan korʉka'pʉ iya to' uya apurɨto' winɨ.  
\v 10 Ɨ'rɨ pe ken si iyesi pɨ' Papa i'tupɨtʉ i'se ɨwesi kon? Sa'man pe rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen apurɨnin nan kupʉ i'se ɨwesi kon mɨrɨ, urɨ'nokon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ukʉipʉnʉ kon nʉkupʉ'pʉ pen nɨ.  
\v 11 Kane! Apurɨ Itepuru Sises uya wakʉ nonkasa' poro epika'tɨn nɨsa', to' kasa rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 12 Tanporo iyamʉrasa' kon esi'pʉ e'pana Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Paarʉ eta pɨ' i'tuto' ipɨkɨrɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ a'kwarʉpɨ'nin ku'sa' Papa uya tʉporo'nokon Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen koro'tau ekama tane to' uya.  
\v 13 To' e'nonkasa' a'tai, Isens usaurokʉ'pʉ, “Utonpa ton, uyetatɨ'.  
\v 14 Saiman nekamayan ko upɨ'nokon, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen pɨ' ‘aiko’ tato' tʉuya enpoika Papa uya, to' tonpa ton anʉmʉ tʉuya winɨ tʉmunkɨ pe to' e'to' pe.  
\v 15 Serɨ si esi serɨ pena pu'kena' amʉ' nʉmenuka'pʉ awɨrɨ. Iye'menukasa' na'ne' kasa: 
\q1  
\v 16 “‘Serɨ tʉpo, enna'poto' oton 
\q2 Tepi' iwʉ' rʉ'pʉ uta'mo'kasa' konekase'na, 
\q1 mɨrɨpan a'motasa' amɨ uya emenna' pe, 
\q2 inna'po uya pena iyesi'pʉ kasa. 
\q1  
\v 17 Mɨrɨ a'tai, ka'pon amʉ' tonpa rʉ'san uya Itepuru warinpato' pe, 
\q2 tanporo kamoro Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen urɨ iwano' pe to' esi, tasa' Itepuru uya, serɨ ku'nin nʉ'pʉ uya’\f + \fr 15:17 \ft Emas 9:11-12\f* 
\q1  
\v 18 Pena rɨ isi'tusa' rʉ'pʉ serɨ.\x - \xo 15:18 \xt E'sotas 34:15-17; Ripaiti'kas 18:6-23; 17:10-16\x* 
\p  
\v 19 “Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', mɨrɨ pɨ' ekonekasa' man: sa'man pe iku'pai pʉra man Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen pona nera'tɨyai'ne' nan Papa winɨkʉi'.  
\v 20 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ' to' ena' imenukapai'nokon, to' auro'kapai'nokon ɨri kiyari ika'sa' ena' itʉsa' pɨ' to' enta'na namai'; tekumai' makoi tʉku'se pʉra to' e'to' pe; terupatu'kai' iwɨsa' o' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ mʉnʉ'pan pɨ' to' enta'na namai'.  
\v 21 Papa uya Mosi' repa'pʉ ike Main ekama pɨ' ka'pon amʉ' nʉko'manyan pena si'kɨrɨ rɨ, Sapa' kaisa rɨ usenupan nɨto' iwʉ' tau pata kaisarɨ rɨ serɨ pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\s1 To' Nʉmenuka'pʉ Esuwerʉ Amʉ' Pen Apurɨnin Nan Ena' 
\p  
\v 22 Mɨrɨ a'tai, enno'sa' kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ so'si epuru ton, tanporo so'si tawon kon pona rɨ nɨrɨ, wakʉ pe poken iyesi'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' anʉnto' pe to' uya tʉ'koro'tapai'nokon, mɨrɨpan kon uya to' ennoko'pʉ Antiyo' pona Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas a'kɨrɨ. Asa'ron kon anʉmʉ'pʉ to' uya: Isutas, Pa'sapas tato'; mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas, tʉtonpa kon epuru pe te'san.  
\v 23 Mɨrɨpan kon enau kareta ennoko'pʉ to' uya se tawon si: 
\pi1 “Ina, enno'sa' kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ so'si epuru ton, ɨrunan kon uya, ‘Miyarɨ'nokon,’ ina tonpa ton pe iyenasa' kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen Antiyo', Siriya, Siri'siya pon kon.  
\v 24 Ina uya etasa' man ina nennoko'san pen nɨ utɨ'pʉ mɨrɨ ya' amanenpase'na'nokon, ɨusenuminkato' kon tʉmanenpai'.  
\v 25 Mɨrɨ wenai, tanporo ina e'kupʉ'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' anʉmʉ pɨ', mɨrɨpan kon ennoko'pʉ ina uya ɨmiyamoro piya', Panapas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Paarʉ pokon a'kɨrɨ,  
\v 26 ka'pon amʉ' tʉuma'tato' kon pɨ' tenari'nʉnsan pen nɨ pena iyepa'kaka'sa' kon nɨ mɨrɨ yai, uyepuru kon Sises Kʉrai ese' wenai. 
\pi1  
\v 27 “Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ina uya Isutas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas ennoko mɨrɨ, kareta ina nʉmenuka'pʉ enpoikase'na tʉnta kon yai.  
\v 28 Wakʉ poken iyesi'pʉ Wakʉ A'kwarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ina pona, ɨmɨrɨ'nokon pona e'tape'ne' rɨ tʉrʉ namai' i'se e'nɨto' entai rɨ.  
\v 29 Papa tato' pe ipɨ' ika'sa' ena' use'man nɨsa' rʉ'pʉ pɨ' kenta'natʉu; mɨrɨ pona mʉn pɨ' kenta'natʉu, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ o' erupatu'kasa' rʉ'pʉ nɨrɨ; tekumai' nɨrɨ ke'makoimatʉu. Wakʉ pe ɨwesi kon mɨrɨ serɨ ton apanama'pʉ kon awɨron pe ɨwesi kon yau. Ɨisirɨ ina ne'nonkayan, wakʉ pe si tanporo mɨko'mantʉi',” 
\m tawon. 
\s1 Isutas Mɨrɨ Awonsi'kɨ Sairas Uya Kareta Tʉrʉ'pʉ 
\p  
\v 30 Asakɨrɨ'nan kon warawo' amʉ' ennoko'pʉ to' uya Antiyo' pata pona. To' amʉrasa' a'tai tanporo so'si ta', kareta tʉrʉ'pʉ to' uya to' ena',  
\v 31 mɨrɨpan ekama to' uya a'tai, to' epori'ma'pʉ tʉpika'tɨnin kon pe main esi pɨ'.  
\v 32 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Sairas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Isutas, pu'kena' pe te'san uya eke pe rɨ to' pika'tɨ'pʉ. Meruntɨ pe rɨ tʉtonpa kon amʉ' kupʉ'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 33 To' uko'mamʉ tʉpo mɨrɨ yau, to' tonpa ton uya to' ennoko'pʉ tʉusewankamai' pʉra to' utɨto' pe tenno'nin nʉ'san kon piya'.  
\v 34 Mɨrɨ e'tane, Sairas ekoneka'pʉ mɨrɨ yau rɨ tʉuko'manto' pe.\f + \fr 15:34 \ft Tʉron nɨ ton penaro' kuru imenukasa' yau v. 34 pʉra iyesi.\f* 
\p  
\v 35 E'tane Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panapas pokon e'nɨmɨ'pʉ Antiyo' po. Mɨrɨ yau, tu'kan kon pokon pe esii'ma enupan pɨ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Itepuru Sises maimu ekama pɨ' rɨ to' esi'pʉ. 
\s1 Ɨ'sentai Paarʉ, Panapas Pokon Eseru Esi'pʉ 
\p  
\v 36 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ uya ta'pʉ Panapas pɨ', “Enna'ponpai utonpa kon amʉ' ka'kʉranpase'na tanporo pata kaisarɨ Itepuru Maimu ekama ne'taine' awɨrɨ, ikupʉ to' uya ense'na,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 37 Panapas esi'pʉ Isaan, Ma' tukai' tesa'sen arɨ i'se ta'kɨrɨ'nokon,  
\v 38 e'tane Paarʉ pona ipoken pʉra iyesi'pʉ, apʉne pʉra tʉnɨnsa' iya 'nokon pɨ' Panperiya yau iye'tʉrawasoma pʉra iyesi'pʉ to' a'kɨrɨ.\x - \xo 15:38 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 13:13\x* 
\v 39 Ipan pe ɨsɨ pe to' e'sei'pɨtʉ'pʉ. Mɨrɨ wenai, to' e'nonka'pʉ ɨsipiyapai; Panapas uya Ma' anʉmʉ'pʉ tisakon pe. To' utɨ'pʉ kanau yau Sai'pʉras pona;  
\v 40 e'tane Paarʉ uya Sairas anʉmʉ'pʉ. Sises apurɨnin nan uya to' tʉrʉ'pʉ Itepuru uya wakʉ nonkasa' ya'. Mɨrɨpan kon nin si utɨ'pʉ mɨrɨ.  
\v 41 To' utɨ'pʉ Siriya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Siri'siya awɨrɨ, apurɨnin nan meruntɨtanʉkʉ pɨ'. 
\c 16  
\s1 Temu'ti Ena'pʉ To' Tonpa Pe 
\p  
\v 1 Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas pokon utɨ'pʉ Siri'siya itese' pata ponsi'kɨ Terʉpi pona, mɨrɨpan kon utɨ'pʉ Restʉra pona Sises apurɨnin Temu'ti itese' pata'se' ya'. Isan esi'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' tonpa pe, Sises apurɨnin, e'tane ikʉipʉnʉ esi'pʉ Kiri' pe.  
\v 2 Itekare apurɨnin nan, Restʉra mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Ai'koniyan pon kon uya, “Wakʉ kʉrɨ rɨ Temu'ti,” ta'pʉ.  
\v 3 Ta'kɨrɨ tʉron nɨ pata ya'ne Temu'ti mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas anapai Paarʉ esi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya Temu'ti yun pi'pɨ puturʉka'pʉ. Mɨrɨ kupʉ'pʉ iya, Temu'ti uya ekamʉra mɨrɨ pata yau te'san Esuwerʉ amʉ' e'kupʉ emapu'tɨ namai', apʉne pʉra Esuwerʉ pe pʉra ikʉipʉnʉ esi uya iku'sa' pe pʉra to' uya i'tu'pʉ.  
\v 4 Mɨrɨ yau, pata kaisa rɨ to' usarɨ'pʉ. Surusiran pon kon enno'sa' kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ so'si epuru ton nʉkoneka'pʉ main Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen napurɨ ton pe iku'sa' ekama pɨ' to' esi'pʉ pata kaisa rɨ.  
\v 5 Mɨrɨ pɨ', Sises apurɨnin nan umeruntɨta'pʉ apurɨto' tʉuya'nokon yau, mɨrɨpan kon epirikʉ'pʉ tu'ke rɨ wʉi kaisa rɨ. 
\s1 Paarʉ Enu Uta'kwakasa' Uya Ma'sitoniya Pon Ene'pʉ 
\p  
\v 6 Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itonpa ton utɨ'pʉ Pʉrekiya nono poro mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Kare'siya itese' pata epose'na, apʉne pʉra Wakʉ A'kwarʉ esi'pʉ Sises ekareei ekama to' uya i'se pʉra Eisa po.  
\v 7 Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ iya'kɨrɨ te'san uya Maisa itese' pata eposa' a'tai, Pi'tiniya itese' pata ya' itɨpai to' esi'pʉ, e'tane Sises A'kwarʉ esi'pʉ mɨrɨ ya' to' utɨ i'se pʉra.  
\v 8 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', to' utɨ'pʉ to'sarɨ rɨ Maisa poro, mɨrɨpan kon epa'ka'pʉ Tʉrowas pona.  
\v 9 Ewarupɨ nau, Papa uya ka'pon Ma'sitoniya pon ento' pe Paarʉ enu a'kwaka'pʉ. Ka'pon e'mʉ'sa'kasa' ene'pʉ iya ata'kwarʉkase'na, “Ma'sitoniya pona ina ipika'tɨtanʉ'kɨ,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 10 Paarʉ enu uta'kwaka'pʉ tʉpo, inke pʉra rɨ Ma'sitoniya pona tʉutɨto' kon pe ina e'kama'pʉ, apʉne pʉra ina uya i'tu'pʉ Papa esi mɨrɨ yau ina uya itekare ekama i'se tukai'. 
\s1 Retiya Ena'pʉ Sises Apurɨnin Pe 
\p  
\v 11 Ina ekanwa'tɨ'pʉ kanau ya' Tʉrowas po, mɨrɨpan parau nɨ'kwɨrɨ'nʉkʉ'pʉ ina uya opa'wʉ Samo'tʉres itese' pona. Iyema'sa' yau, ina utɨ'pʉ Niya'pores itese' pata pona kanau yau.  
\v 12 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, ina utɨ'pʉ makʉi' Piri'pai itese' pata pona, Roman amʉ' neporo'pʉ. Eke pe kuru serɨ pata esi'pʉ Ma'sitoniya po. Inke rʉ'kwɨ rɨ wʉi ina uko'manpɨtʉ'pʉ Piri'pai yau. 
\p  
\v 13 Ina utɨ'pʉ pata apai tuna tʉu'tɨsen e'pi pona Sapa' a'tai, Esuwerʉ amʉ' ɨpʉremato' pata'se' eporo i'se ina esi'pʉ. Ina ereutapɨtʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan usauro'nɨ pɨ' ina e'sara'tɨ'pʉ mɨrɨ yau, iyamʉrasa' kon uri'sami'si amʉ' pokon pe.  
\v 14 Mɨrɨ yau, tikin nan to' tonpa ina maimu eta pɨ' te'sen esi'pʉ, Retiya itese', Taya'tira itese' pata winon, tʉtariren pon atʉ kʉrʉpo'poma pɨ' te'sen. Retiya esi'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' tonpa pen nɨ, e'tane rɨ Papa pɨ' tʉwɨpʉremasen pe iyesi'pʉ. Paarʉ nekamanʉ Sises ekareei apurɨto' pe iya Itepuru uya itewan a'koka'pʉ.  
\v 15 Retiya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itiwʉ' tau te'san pa'taisima ina uya tʉpo, tiwʉ' ta' ina kɨ'ma'pʉ iya. “Itepuru Sises apurɨnin pe esi tukai' i'tu auya'nokon pɨ' si, uiwʉ' ta' ɨsi'tɨ',” ta'pʉ iya. Ina utɨto' pe tiwʉ' ta' ina kuu'pʉ iya. 
\s1 Paarʉ, Sairas A'si'pʉ To' Uya Pariki'si Ta' 
\p  
\v 16 Tʉron nɨ a'tai, Esuwerʉ amʉ' ɨpʉremato' ya' ina utɨ a'tai, to' poitorʉ pe te'sen uri'san eporo'pʉ ina uya, makoi a'kwarʉ yen pe iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan esi'pʉ pena rɨ te'ku'ton i'tunin pe. Itesa' pe te'san uya eke pe pʉrata eporo esi'pʉ, apʉne pʉra ka'pon amʉ' uya e'ma'pʉ to' ena' te'ku'sen ekamato' pe iya.  
\v 17 Pʉse rɨ uri'san uya Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itonpa ton e'ma'pʉkapɨtʉ'pʉ inke ɨkɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉi'ma, “Pʉsamoro ka'pon amʉ' esi Eke Papa poitorʉ ton pe, mɨrɨpan kon uya epika'tɨn nɨto' eseru ekama!” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 18 Inke rɨ mɨrɨ ta pɨ' iyesi'pʉ Paarʉ tanpokʉmai', mɨrɨpan era'tɨ'pʉ makoi a'kwarʉ yen winɨkʉi', mɨrɨpan uya, “Sises Kʉrai ese' yau ayauro'ka uya, pʉse uri'san apai epa'ka'!” ta'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, makoi a'kwarʉ epa'ka'pʉ iyapai. 
\p  
\v 19 Itesanon uya serɨ enta' tʉpʉrataai kon epoto' iya oton pen tukai' i'tusa' a'tai, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas a'si'pʉ to' uya. To' pi'sikʉ'pʉ to' uya kʉrʉpo'po pɨ' e'nɨto' pata'se' ya' eke ton pata esanon piya'.  
\v 20 Roman amʉ' epuru ton piya' to' arɨ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon uya, “Esuwerʉ amʉ' pʉsamoro, e'tane upata'se' kon yawon kon ka'pon amʉ' anpokʉma to' uya.  
\v 21 Utonpa kon amʉ' enupa to' uya urɨ'nokon Roman amʉ' nʉkupʉnʉ pen nɨ ku'to' pe to' uya,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 22 Mɨrɨ yau, anpisin ton ka'pon amʉ' e'sara'tɨ'pʉ to' tonpa pe Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas ewa'noma pɨ', mɨrɨpan itepuru ton uya soisa amʉ' apiyontɨ'pʉ to' pon kara'pɨ'to' pe to' uya, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' ari'po'pɨ'to' pe to' uya.  
\v 23 Ɨsɨ pe to' ari'po'pɨtʉ tʉpo, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas a'si'pʉ to' uya pariki'si ta'. Itepuru ton uya to' a'sinin auro'ka'pʉ, wakʉ pe to' erasuntɨto' pe iya.  
\v 24 Main etasa' tʉuya a'tai, i'na' kuru to' ennin uya to' ewonnʉkʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya yʉi akʉ'pɨ'sa' yai'ne to' pʉrakon amʉ' enpa'kapɨtʉ'pʉ, ti'si kon amʉ' amapɨtʉ to' uya namai'. 
\p  
\v 25 Anomʉra' a'tai, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas esi'pʉ eke pe ɨpʉreman pɨ'. To' userenka'pʉ Papa apurɨpɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya, tʉron kon a'sisa' kon esi'pʉ to' etapɨtʉ pɨ'.  
\v 26 Mɨrɨ koro'tau, pana' pe tʉrʉ'pʉnʉ esi'pʉ, pariki'si usi'ki'ma'pʉ mɨrɨ, iyapon nɨ usi'ki'ma'pʉ. Inke pʉra rɨ, pariki'si mʉra'ta amʉ' uta'kokapɨtʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ a'sisa' kon auronpɨ'to' ike i'sen amʉ' emo'kapɨtʉ'pʉ.  
\v 27 Mɨrɨ a'tai, a'sisa' kon esa' upaka'pʉ, mɨrɨpan mʉra'ta amʉ' uta'kokapɨ'sa' tense, tʉsuparaai mo'ka'pʉ tʉutapurukato' pe ike, apʉne pʉra a'sisa' kon utɨpɨtʉ'pʉ tukai' tʉusenuminka ke.  
\v 28 “Ɨiwano' pe rɨ, katapurukai, tanporo rɨ serɨ yau ina man!” tukai' nin si Paarʉ ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ mɨrɨ. 
\p  
\v 29 Tʉweyu nin si i'se a'sinin ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ mɨrɨ, mɨrɨpan ewomʉ'pʉ Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas pokon rakʉi' iye'sekunka'pʉ e'tɨtɨtɨ'kai'ma.  
\v 30 To' enpa'ka'pʉ iya pariki'si tapai, mɨrɨpan kon pɨ', “Ɨ'rɨ kuru tʉku'se epika'tɨto' pe iyesi?” ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 31 Mɨrɨpan kon uya, “Itepuru Sises apurɨkɨ ɨyepika'tɨ pa, ɨmɨrɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨiwʉ' tau te'san,” ta'pʉ to' uya ipɨ'.  
\v 32 Mɨrɨ yau, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas uya Itepuru Sises ekareei ekama'pʉ a'sinin mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itiwʉ' tawon kon pɨ'.  
\v 33 Mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ, a'sinin uya to' arɨ'pʉ to' ari'po'pɨtʉ'pʉ pata'pʉ korʉkase'na. Inke pʉra rɨ mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas uya kʉrɨ rɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itiwʉ' tawon kon pa'taisima'pʉ.  
\v 34 Mɨrɨ yau Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas arɨ'pʉ a'sinin uya tiwʉ' ta' to' a're'tɨi'. Papa apurɨ tʉuya pɨ' nin si ipan pe pori' pe iyesi'pʉ mɨrɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itonpa ton nɨ nɨrɨ. 
\p  
\v 35 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, itepuru ton uya pʉresiman amʉ' ennoko'pʉ a'sinin piya'. “Tɨwɨ kamoro ka'pon amʉ' nʉtɨi,” tawon main esa' pe. 
\p  
\v 36 Mɨrɨpan uya Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas pɨ', “Itepuru amʉ' uya uyapiyontɨsa' man ɨyenno'to' kon pe uya, mɨrɨpan yau entantɨ' rɨ si, tʉusewankamai' pʉra,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 37 E'tane Paarʉ uya pʉresiman amʉ' maimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Ɨri ku'sa' ina uya pʉra rɨ iye'tane, soisa amʉ' uya anpisin koro'tau ina ari'po'pɨ'to' pe to' uya, to' auro'ka'pʉ! Roman amʉ' ina e'tane pariki'si ta' ina a'si'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon esi ama'ai ina ennoko i'se. Kane! Tɨwɨ Roman amʉ' epuru ton nʉyepʉi ina enpa'kai',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 38 Mɨrɨ yau, pʉresiman amʉ' epuru ton enna'po'pʉ Paarʉ maimu rʉ'pʉ ekamai' Roman amʉ' epuru ton pɨ'. Roman amʉ' ina, tasa' Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas uya etasa' tʉuya'nokon a'tai, to' usenari'pa'pʉ.  
\v 39 Mɨrɨpan kon utɨ'pʉ to' pɨ' ɨri pe rɨ ina e'sa' man tase'na. Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas enpa'ka'pʉ to' uya pariki'si tapai, mɨrɨpan kon pɨ', “Entantɨ',” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 40 Pariki'si tapai tepa'ka kon tʉpo, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas pokon utɨ'pʉ Retiya iwʉ' ta', mɨrɨpan kon e'seporo'pʉ tʉtonpa kon amʉ' pokon pe. To' auro'ka tʉpo to' pori'ma pe, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas utɨ'pʉ Piri'pai apai. 
\c 17  
\s1 Paarʉ Esi'pʉ Tesaroni'ka Po 
\p  
\v 1 Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas utɨ'pʉ Anpi'pores mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ A'poroniya pata ton awɨrɨ. Tesaroni'ka pata eposa' to' uya a'tai, Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' eporo'pʉ to' uya mɨrɨ pata yau.  
\v 2 Te'pɨ'to' kasa rɨ, Paarʉ utɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ta' osorʉwau Sapa' kaisa rɨ ka'pon amʉ' auro'ka pɨ' iyesi'pʉ iye'menukasa' itekare ke.  
\v 3 Enpoika pɨ' iyesi'pʉ Kʉrai\f + \fr 17:3 \fq Kʉrai; \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra, \fq Me'saya; Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe.\f* ekota'mato' pe iyesi'pʉ, ima'tato' pe iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨ tʉpo iye'mʉ'sa'kato' pe terikʉ'pʉ apai iyesi'pʉ nɨrɨ. “Pʉse rɨ Sises kanyauro'kayatʉi'ne' esi mɨrɨ Kʉrai pe,” ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'.  
\v 4 Tʉron kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' ena'pʉ Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas pokon tonpa pe, tu'kan kon nɨ Kiri' amʉ' Papa namanin nan pokon pe rɨ nɨrɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉnamai' te'san uri'sami'si amʉ' rɨ nɨrɨ. 
\p  
\v 5 E'tane tʉron kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' ɨkɨnta'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, ɨri iteseru ton ka'pon amʉ' kan to' utɨ'pʉ kʉrʉpo'po pɨ' e'nɨ pata'se' apai. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, ka'pon amʉ' amʉranʉkʉ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon uya usewankaman nɨto' sara'tɨ'pʉ. Mɨrɨpan kon utɨ'pʉ Ise'sʉn iwʉ' ta' Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas warinpai', to' ne'to' pe tʉuya'nokon tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' koro'ta'.  
\v 6 E'tane Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas eporo'pʉ to' uya pen. Mɨrɨ wenai, Ise'sʉn pi'sikʉ'pʉ to' uya. Tʉron kon nɨrɨ Sises apurɨnin nan ne'sa' nɨrɨ to' uya esi'pʉ eke ton itepuru ton piya'. Tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉmʉ'pʉ, “Pʉsamoro manenpanin ku'nin nan pata yau uye'sa' man serɨ yau.  
\v 7 Ise'sʉn uya to' ereutanʉ'sa' tʉpiyau. Tu'kan nɨ kupʉ'pʉ to' uya kin Sisa uya tasa' poro pʉra. Ta to' uya moro man tʉron nɨ kin, Sises tukai' tesa'sen ta to' uya,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 8 Serɨ etasa' pata epuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ anpisin ka'pon amʉ' uya a'tai, to' e'sakoropa'pʉ.  
\v 9 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Ise'sʉn mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' uya pʉrata tʉto' pe to' kupʉ'pʉ itepuru ton uya to' nonkato' pe to' utɨto' pe aka'ne' pe. 
\s1 Paarʉ Mɨrɨ Awonsi'kɨ Sairas Esi'pʉ Pereya Po 
\p  
\v 10 Ewarupɨ uye'sa' pe rɨ, to' tonpa ton uya Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas ennoko'pʉ Pereya pata pona. Pereya pata eposa' tʉuya'nokon a'tai, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sairas pokon utɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ta'.  
\v 11 Pereya pon kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' esi wakʉ pe parɨ iteseru, ɨsenupapai parɨ Tesaroni'ka pon kon ka'pon amʉ' entai, ipan pe Sises ekareei ɨnetapai to' esi'pʉ. Tɨwɨrɨ wʉi kaisa rɨ iye'menukasa' itekare warinpa pɨ' to' esi'pʉ, i'napai rɨ pe' Paarʉ uya tenupato' kon esi tukai'.  
\v 12 Tu'ke kuru Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya itekare apurɨ'pʉ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ eke ton Kiri' pasi ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ warawoti'si amʉ' uya nɨrɨ apurɨ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 13 Paarʉ uya Pereya po Papa Maimu ekama tukai' Esuwerʉ amʉ' Tesaroni'ka pon kon uya etasa' a'tai, to' kanan utɨ'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' tʉrʉnkase'na.  
\v 14 E'tane inke pʉra Paarʉ ennoko'pʉ itonpa ton uya tʉron nɨ pata ya', e'tane Sairas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Temu'ti pokon uko'manpɨtʉ'pʉ Pereya po rɨ.  
\v 15 Paarʉ apʉrʉnpanin nʉ'san uya arɨ'pʉ A'tens itese' eke pata pona, mɨrɨpan kon enna'po'pʉ Pereya pona Paarʉ maimu esa' pe, “Inke pʉra parɨ Sairas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Temu'ti pokon uya uyepoto' pe,” tawon. 
\s1 Paarʉ Esi'pʉ A'tens Po 
\p  
\v 16 To' enupɨkɨrɨ Paarʉ esi koro'tau A'tens po, ipan pe rɨ ekamʉra iye'kupʉ'pʉ ika'sa' ton ɨpʉreman nɨto' ton ipɨ' ene tʉuya a'tai mɨrɨ pata yau.  
\v 17 Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' tau, Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen Papa namanin nan pokon pe usauro'nɨ pɨ' iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ kʉrʉpo'po pɨ' e'nɨto' yau rɨ nɨrɨ, mɨrɨ ya' tʉutɨpɨ'san pokon pe wʉi kaisa rɨ.  
\v 18 Tʉron kon enupanin nan, E'pi'kuriyan tato' ton ipɨ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon Si'towi' tato' kon esi'pʉ ipokon pe e'sei'pɨ' nɨ pɨ' inapurɨnʉ ton pɨ'. Tʉron kon pʉsamoro uya, “Ɨ'rɨ si ta pʉse iya'kwarʉ pʉn ka'pon uya?” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p Tʉron kon uya ta'pʉ, “Tʉron nɨ papa pɨ' ɨpʉreman nɨto' pe enupan nɨ iya, tʉron nɨ pata awon kon kasa,” ta'pʉ to' uya. Serɨ ta'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' uya, apʉne pʉra wakʉ Sises e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ ekareei ekama Paarʉ uya pɨ'.  
\v 19 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ nee'pʉ to' uya Areyo'pakas itese' pata'se' ya'. Mɨrɨ yau, “Ina auro'ka' serɨ emenna' ɨyekareei ke,” ta'pʉ to' uya ipɨ'.  
\v 20 “Ɨyekareei man ina netapɨtʉnʉ pe pʉra rɨ; mɨrɨ wenai, ɨ'rɨ kuru ta auya e'kwa pe iyesi tukai' ina pɨ' enpoikakɨ,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 21 (Tanporo A'tens mɨrɨ tʉpo ka'kʉran amʉ' mɨrɨ yau tʉuko'mansan esi'pʉ tʉweyu kon enno'pɨtʉ pɨ' emenna' itekare pɨ' usauro'nɨ pɨ'.) 
\p  
\v 22 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' amʉrasa' koro'tau, Areyo'pakas pata'se' yau, “A'tens pon kon ka'pon amʉ'! Ɨyene uya 'nokon tanporo rɨ ɨpʉreman iya'kwarʉ pe me'atʉi',  
\v 23 apʉne pʉra tanporo pata yau upinimʉ koro'tau, ɨwɨpʉremato' kon yau ene pɨ' ɨuse'mato' kon apon eporo'pʉ uya. Mɨrɨ pɨ' iye'menukasa' ensa' uya man, ‘Ti'tusen pen nɨ Papa ena',’ tawon. Serɨ pe si ɨni'tunʉ kon pen nɨ ɨpʉreman nɨto' ipɨ' ekareei ekama uya serɨ ɨpɨ'nokon.\x - \xo 17:23 \xt Ipu'ketʉ 13:1\x* 
\p  
\v 24 “Papa, non konekanin nʉ'pʉ, tanporon Epʉn mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ non esi itiwano' pe, mɨrɨpan uko'mamʉ pen ka'pon namɨ'pʉ temiyatʉ ke ɨutɨ tau.  
\v 25 Papa esi mɨrɨ ka'pon uya tʉrepa enupɨkɨron pen, apʉne pʉra tanporon nɨ i'se iye'to' esi ipiyau, apʉne pʉra Papa kʉrɨ rɨ tanporon kon nɨ repanin uko'man nɨ a'kwarʉ ke.\x - \xo 17:25 \xt 1 Kin Amʉ' 8:27; Aisaya 42:5; 2 Ma'kapis 14:35; Inkupʉ'pʉ 7:48\x* 
\v 26 Tikin nan Papa nʉkaa'pʉ ka'pon winɨ, tu'ke ka'pon amʉ' epamʉ'pʉ serɨ non po, serɨ non emʉ' poro'ne to' uko'manto' pe. Pata weyu ton koneka'pʉ iya iye'to' awɨrɨ'ne. Pata ton nɨrɨ iye'to' airɨ'ne ka'pon uko'manto' yau pe'ne.\x - \xo 17:26 \xt 2 Ma'kapis 7:23\x* 
\v 27 Serɨ kupʉ'pʉ iya, to' uya tʉwarinpato' pe, to' uya rɨ iwarinpa tʉuya'nokon koro'tau epoto' pe, ɨnnɨ pʉra rɨ Papa e'tane upiyapai'nokon.\x - \xo 17:27 \xt Ipu'ketʉ 13:6-9\x* 
\v 28 ‘Kʉrɨ rɨ uriya' uko'man nɨ, upinin nɨ, nurɨne e'nɨ.’ Imenukanin, ɨtonpa kon pe te'sen uya, ‘Urɨ'nokon kamoro ipayan nʉ'san,’ tasa' na'ne' kasa rɨ. 
\p  
\v 29 “Papa nʉkoneka'san pe e'nɨ wenai, usenuminkan poken pʉra iyesi ika'sa' pe iyesi tukai'; korʉ, tɨ', mɨrɨ pe pʉra sirʉpa, ka'pon nʉkoneka'pʉ ɨpʉreman nɨto' pe e'tane nurɨne pʉra iyesi.  
\v 30 Pena a'tai, ka'pon amʉ' uya ti'tu pʉra iyesi pɨ', Papa uya to' enpɨtʉ'pʉ, ɨ'rɨ pe to' tʉku'se pʉra rɨ. E'tane si serɨ pe, mɨ yawɨron kon nɨ ka'pon amʉ' pɨ', ‘Amakooi kon apai era'tɨka'tɨ'!’ ta iya.  
\v 31 Apʉne pʉra tikin nɨ wʉi tʉweyu ku'sa' iya ka'pon amʉ' eseru aimenkato' tʉuya weyu pe, serɨ ku'ton ka'pon epoka'sa' Papa uya tiwano' pe ka'pon amʉ' uya apurɨto' pe. Papa uya tʉnanʉmʉ'pʉ enpoikasa' to' enu ya', i'mʉ'sa'ka tʉuya winɨ iyerikʉ'pʉ apai,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 32 Ka'pon amʉ' uya iyeri'sa' kon e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ ta iya eta a'tai, isapema pe to' uta'kɨrɨ'pʉ, e'tane tʉron kon uya, “Serɨ ekareei parɨ ɨnetapai ina man,” ta'pʉ.  
\v 33 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ epa'ka'pʉ usauro'nɨto' pata apai.  
\v 34 Tu'kan kon pen nɨ ka'pon amʉ' ena'pʉ Paarʉ pɨkɨron kon pe, mɨrɨpan kon uya nɨrɨ Sises apurɨ'pʉ. To' koro'tau Sises apurɨnin pe iyenasa' ese' esi Tayano'siyas, Areyo'pakas itese' konsʉrʉ amʉ' tonpa pe te'sen, Tamares itese' nɨrɨ uri'san, mɨrɨ tʉpo tʉron kon uya rɨ nɨrɨ Sises apurɨ'pʉ. \fig Ɨni'tunʉ kon pen nɨ ɨpʉreman nɨto' ipɨ' ekareei ekama uya.|src="CN01996B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 17:16-34" copy="David C. Cook" ref="17:23" \fig* 
\c 18  
\s1 Paarʉ Esi'pʉ Koren Po 
\p  
\v 1 Serɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ uya A'tens nɨmɨ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan tʉpo Koren pata pona itɨ'pʉ.  
\v 2 Mɨrɨ yau, A'kira itese', Esuwerʉ eporo'pʉ iya, Pontas pon, pena pʉra iye'sa' kon I'tari pata winɨpai tʉno'pʉ Pʉre'sira a'kɨrɨ, apʉne pʉra Roman pata epuru Kʉrautiyas itese' uya tanporo Esuwerʉ amʉ' epa'kato' pe tasa' pɨ'. Paarʉ utɨ'pʉ A'kira mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Pʉre'sira ense'na.  
\v 3 Tʉkasa ta'porin ton ka'pɨ'nin pe to' esi wenai, to' piyau e'tʉrawasoman pɨ' iko'mamʉ'pʉ.  
\v 4 Tɨwɨrɨ Sapa' kaisa rɨ'ne Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Kiri' amʉ' pokon pe itekare pɨ' usauro'nɨ pɨ' iyesi'pʉ, Sises esi pika'tɨnin pe enno'sa' tukai' to' enu ya' enpoika i'se tesi wenai. 
\p  
\v 5 Sairas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Temu'ti uye'sa' a'tai Paarʉ piya' Ma'sitoniya pata apai, Paarʉ uya tʉweyu ennoko'pʉ itekare rɨken ekama pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' pɨ', Sises, kʉrɨ rɨ Kʉrai,\f + \fr 18:5 \fq Kʉrai; \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra, \fq Me'saya; Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe; v. 28 yau nɨrɨ.\f* tukai' enpoika'pʉ iya.  
\v 6 E'tane Esuwerʉ amʉ' e'sara'tɨ a'tai ɨri pe, ipa'nʉkʉ pe Paarʉ pɨ' usauro'nɨ pɨ', Paarʉ uya tʉpon tɨutɨ'pʉ, Papa uya to' nonkasa' ekamanin pe. “Ɨiwano' kon pe rɨ aumakoita kon ɨmʉnʉ kon utɨ emapu'tɨ auya'nokon ke, urɨ iwano' pe pʉra iye'to' oton Papa uya ɨponi'sima kon a'tai. Serɨ apai utɨto' oton Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen piya',” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 7 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ utɨ'pʉ Ti'tiyas Isa'su'tas, Esuwerʉ pen iwʉ' ta' itekare ekamai'. Ti'tiyas Isa'su'tas esi'pʉ Papa pɨ' tʉwɨpʉremasen pe, Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' piyawon itiwʉ'.  
\v 8 Kiri'pas, Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' epuru, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ itiwʉ' tau te'san uya Sises apurɨ'pʉ. Tu'ke itekare etanin nʉ'san Koren pon kon uya apurɨ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon epa'taisima'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 9 Tʉron nɨ a'tai ewarupɨ nau, Itepuru Sises uya Paarʉ auro'ka'pʉ itenu uta'kwakasa' yau, “Enari'ke' kesii. Asauro'kɨ rɨ. E'pana kesii,  
\v 10 apʉne pʉra aya'kɨrɨ e'ai' ɨnʉ' uya rɨ ɨwɨnɨ pen mɨrɨ, apʉne pʉra tu'ke ka'pon amʉ' man serɨ pata yau uyapurɨnin nan,” tukai'.  
\v 11 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Paarʉ uko'mamʉ'pʉ tikin nɨ wʉipiya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ 6 kaisa rɨ kapʉi ipona Papa maimu ke to' enupa pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 12 Kariyo esi a'tai Roman amʉ' kopʉnaai pe, A'kaya pata epuru pe a'samʉtʉ ya' tʉwenai, Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya Paarʉ a'si'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon uya inee'pʉ ko'tʉ pɨ' e'nɨ iwʉ' ta'.  
\v 13 “Pʉse rɨ ka'pon uya ka'pon amʉ' auro'ka Papa pɨ' to' ɨpʉremato' pe Main uya mɨrɨ kasa tasa' pʉra rɨ iye'tane,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 14 Paarʉ e'sara'tɨ rawɨrɨ usauro'nɨ pɨ', Kariyo uya ta'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pɨ', “Ɨri kuru rɨ, ipokena' pen kuru rɨ ku'sa' Paarʉ uya wenai, ausaurokʉ kon a'tai amaimu kon setai'no.  
\v 15 E'tane se pe rɨ usekama'popɨ' nɨ main ton pɨ' mɨrɨ tʉpo ɨiwano' kon ɨyeseru kon, ɨiwano' kon pe rɨ ɨnkoneka'pʉ kon pɨ' rɨ ɨwesi kon wenai, ɨiwano' kon pe ikonekatɨ'. Serɨ waraino ɨyeseru kon aimenka uya pʉra man,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 16 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Kariyo uya to' enpa'ka'pʉ.  
\v 17 Mɨrɨpan kon era'tɨ'pʉ, Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' epuru a'sise'na, Sostenes itese', mɨrɨpan arɨ'pʉ to' uya ko'tʉ pɨ' e'nɨto' iwʉ' tapai, mɨrɨpan ari'po'pɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya ko'tʉ pɨ' e'nɨto' iwʉ' pʉrorooi po. Mɨrɨ pɨ' Kariyo usewankama'pʉ pen nɨ. 
\s1 Paarʉ Utɨpɨtʉ'pʉ Tu'kan Pata Ya'ne 
\p  
\v 18 Paarʉ uko'mamʉ'pʉ inke rʉ'kwɨ rɨ Koren pata po. Mɨrɨ yau, tʉtonpa ton tʉnɨnse itɨ'pʉ kanau epotorʉ'pʉ yau Siriya pona. Tʉutɨ rawɨrɨ, ti'pai kiriri'ka'pʉ iya, Papa auro'kasa' tʉuya pɨ', mɨrɨpan a'kɨrɨ Pʉre'sira mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ A'kira e'sara'tɨ'pʉ itonpa pe.\x - \xo 18:18 \xt Nonpa 6:18\x* 
\v 19 To' uya E'pe'sas eporo'pʉ. Mɨrɨ yau, Paarʉ uya Pʉre'sira mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ A'kira nɨmɨ'pʉ. Mɨrɨ yau, itɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ta', itekare pɨ' asauro'se'na Esuwerʉ amʉ' pokon pe.  
\v 20 Inke parɨ iko'manto' pe to' uya ekama'po tane, e'pai pʉra iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 21 E'tane tʉutɨkapʉ a'tai, “Papa eseru pe iyesi yau, uyepʉ kanan mɨrɨ ɨpiya'nokon,” ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, iyekanwa'tɨ'pʉ kanau ya', mɨrɨpan utɨ'pʉ E'pe'sas poi. 
\p  
\v 22 Paarʉ uya Sisariya eposa' a'tai, iyekanwaka'pʉ, “Miyarɨ!” ka'se'na Sises apurɨnin nan pɨ' Surusiran pona, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ iu'tɨ'pʉ Antiyo' pona.  
\v 23 Antiyo' po inke rʉ'kwɨ rɨ kanan tesi tʉpo, itɨ'pʉ kanan mɨrɨ apai. Mɨrɨpan utɨ'pʉ Kare'siya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Pʉresiya nono awɨrɨ'ne, mɨrɨpan uya Sises apurɨnin nan meruntɨtanʉkʉ'pʉ. 
\s1 Pʉre'sira Mɨrɨ Awonsi'kɨ A'kira Uya A'poros Auro'ka'pʉ 
\p  
\v 24 Mɨrɨ koro'tau, A'poros, Esuwerʉ pe te'sen, Arisantiriya pon uyee'pʉ E'pe'sas pona. Wakʉ pe kuru tʉusauro'sen ye', iye'menukasa' itekare i'tunin pe iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 25 Papa eseru awɨrɨ kuru enupasa' pe iyesi'pʉ. Pana' pe kuru nɨrɨ tʉusauro'sen pe iyesi'pʉ, iye'to' poro kuru Itepuru Sises eseru pɨ' enupanin pe kuru nɨrɨ iyesi'pʉ. Isaan Pa'tes ekareei epa'taisiman tawon nɨken i'tunin pe iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 26 A'poros e'sara'tɨ'pʉ enari'mʉra Sises ekareei ekama pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' tau. Pʉre'sira mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ A'kira uya etasa' a'tai, to' uya ikɨ'ma'pʉ tiwʉ' kon ta'. Mɨrɨ pata yau, wakʉ pe parɨ Papa eseru enpoika'pʉ to' uya ipana ya'. 
\p  
\v 27 A'poros esi a'tai ɨtɨpai A'kaya pata pona, E'pe'sas awon kon to' tonpa ton uya ipori'ma'pʉ miyarɨ parɨ itɨto' pe. To' uya kareta menuka'pʉ, mɨrɨ yau te'san Sises apurɨnin nan ena' to' uya ereutanʉ'to' pe. Ipan pe kuru pata eporo iya a'tai, kamoro wakʉ nonkasa' winɨ apurɨnin pe iyenasa' kon pika'tɨnin pe iyesi'pʉ,  
\v 28 apʉne pʉra pana' pe tʉusaurokʉ winɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' a'kɨrɨ ipoken pʉra to' e'sa' tukai'. Iye'menukasa' itekare winɨpai enpoika'pʉ iya Sises esi Kʉrai pe tukai'. \fig Tʉkasa ta'porin ka'pɨ'nin pe to' esi pɨ', to' piyau iye'tʉrawasoma'pʉ.|src="CN02000B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 18:1-28" copy="David C. Cook" ref="18:3" \fig* 
\c 19  
\s1 E'pe'sas Po Paarʉ Esi'pʉ 
\p  
\v 1 A'poros esi koro'tau Koren po, Paarʉ uya makʉi' tʉutɨsen asanta anʉmʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan epa'ka'pʉ E'pe'sas pona. Mɨrɨ yau, Sises apurɨnin nan eporo'pʉ iya,  
\v 2 mɨrɨpan uya to' ekama'po'pʉ, “Wakʉ A'kwarʉ pe' mepotantʉu Sises apurɨsa' auya'nokon a'tai?” tukai'. 
\p “Kane, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ esi moro tukai' ina uya i'tusa' pʉra rɨ man,” tukai' to' uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 3 Paarʉ uya to' ekama'po'pʉ, “Ɨ'rɨ waraino epa'taisiman nɨto' ke ɨyepa'taisima'pʉ kon?” tukai'. 
\p “Isaan Pa'tes uya epa'taisiman nɨto' ke ka'pon amʉ' enupa'pʉ poro ina epa'taisimasa',” tukai' to' uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 4 Paarʉ uya to' maimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Isaan uya pa'taisiman nɨto' esi'pʉ mɨrɨ makoi yapai ka'pon amʉ' era'tɨto' pe, to' auro'ka'pʉ iya te'ma'pʉ pe tʉuye'sen Sises tapurɨi' to' e'to' pe,” ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'.\x - \xo 19:4 \xt Ma'siu 3:11; Ma' 1:4, 7-8; Ʉru' 3:4, 16; Isaan 1:26-27\x* 
\p  
\v 5 Serɨ etasa' to' uya a'tai, to' epa'taisima'pʉ Sises ese' yau.  
\v 6 Paarʉ uya temiyatʉ ton nonka'pʉ a'tai to' pona, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ uyee'pʉ to' pona'ne. Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' usaurokʉ'pʉ tʉron nɨ ton main\f + \fr 19:6 \fq main, \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq ani \ft Kiri' maimu yau.\f* yai'ne, mɨrɨpan kon uya Papa Maimu ekama'pʉ.  
\v 7 12 kaisa rɨ iye'to' airɨ rɨ to' esi'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 8 Paarʉ utɨ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' iwʉ' ta' E'pe'sas po, mɨrɨpan usaurokʉ'pʉ enari'mʉra osorʉwau kapʉi kaisa rɨ. To' pɨ' ipatakapɨtʉ'pʉ iya, to' uya ito'ka'nʉkʉ i'se tesi wenai, Papa e'to' esa' wannɨ pe pɨ'.  
\v 9 E'tane tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' ena'pʉ main ɨnetapai pʉra. To' uya tewan kon sa'mantanʉkʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon usaurokʉ'pʉ ɨri pe Ite'ma awɨron kon pɨ' tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' koro'tau. Mɨrɨ pɨ' si Paarʉ uya to' nɨmɨ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya Sises pɨ' enupasa' kon arɨ'pʉ ta'kɨrɨ, mɨrɨpan kon esi'pʉ tʉusenupa kon pe usauro'pɨ' nɨ pɨ' tɨwɨrɨ wʉi kaisa rɨ Tiranas sikuruui tau.  
\v 10 Serɨ kupʉ'pʉ Paarʉ uya mɨrɨ asa'rɨ wʉipiya kaisa rɨ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, tu'kan kon nʉ'kwɨ rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Kiri' amʉ', eke Eisa awɨrɨ tʉuko'mansan uya Itepuru ekareei eta'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 11 E'pe'sas po Paarʉ esi a'tai, eke tʉrawaso e'kupʉ emapu'tɨ'pʉ Papa uya iporo.  
\v 12 Enki'sa amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ pon ton nɨ Paarʉ napurɨpɨtʉ'pʉ rɨ apɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya e'ne' ton piya' to' epi'tɨpɨ'nin pe. Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' eparan apai to' usepi'tɨpɨtʉ'pʉ, makoi a'kwarʉ uya to' nonkapɨtʉ'pʉ. 
\s1 7 Kaisaron Kon Sʉ'kepa Munkɨ Amʉ' 
\p  
\v 13 Mɨrɨ yau nɨrɨ, Esuwerʉ amʉ' esi'pʉ pata kaisa rɨ makoi a'kwarʉ pa'kapɨtʉ pɨ', Itepuru ese' tesa'pɨ'se makoi a'kwarʉ pa'ka i'se usi'tupɨ' nɨ pɨ' to' esi'pʉ. Ta to' uya, “Itepuru Sises ese' yau, Paarʉ itekareei nekamanʉ pe na'ne', kʉrɨ rɨ ese' yau epa'ka',” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 14 7 kaisaron kon Sʉ'kepa, use'man nɨto' Papa ena' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru pe te'sen munkɨ amʉ' uya serɨ ku'pɨtʉ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 15 E'tane, makoi a'kwarʉ uya to' maimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Sises si'tuyai', Paarʉ nɨrɨ si'tuyai', e'tane ɨnʉ' yan ken ɨmɨrɨ'nokon?” tukai'. 
\p  
\v 16 Mɨrɨ a'tai, ka'pon makoi a'kwarʉ yen pe te'sen e'sanʉmʉ'pʉ 7 kaisaron kon ka'pon amʉ' pona to' entai tenai', ɨsɨ pe kuru rɨ to' wɨpɨtʉ'pʉ iya to' pon ton tʉkarapɨ'se, mɨrɨpan kon ainʉmʉ'pʉ itiwʉ' tapai, mʉn ennokoi'ma.  
\v 17 Serɨ etasa' Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Kiri' amʉ' tʉuko'mansan E'pe'sas po uya a'tai, ipan pe enari'ke' to' ena'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, ipan pe kuru Itepuru Sises ese' nama'pʉ to' uya imeruntɨrʉ wenai.  
\v 18 Tu'kan kon Sises apurɨnin nan pe iyenasa' kon e'sara'tɨ'pʉ uye'nɨ pɨ', mɨrɨpan kon uya tʉmakooi kon ekama'pʉ tʉron kon apurɨnin nan pana ya'.  
\v 19 Tu'kan kon piyai'san amʉ' eseru kupʉ pɨ' iko'mansa' kon uya tu'kan nɨ ɨri ekareei apon kareta amʉranʉkʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan po'tɨpɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya annau. Pʉrata pe kareta ton epe' i'tu'pʉ to' uya a'tai, 50,000 kaisa rɨ sirʉpa pun\f + \fr 19:19 \fq sirʉpa pun—tʉra'kuma, \ft Kiri' maimu yau. Serɨ pʉrata pun esi tikin nɨ wʉi e'tʉrawasoman nʉ'pʉ epe'pʉ ta e'kwa pe iyesi'pʉ. Apʉne Ma'siu 20:2 enkɨ.\f* pe iyepa'ka'pʉ.  
\v 20 Serɨ winɨ Itepuru Sises ekareei utɨ'pʉ miyarɨ rɨ pata yau, mɨrɨpan nɨrɨ usemo'ka'pʉ meruntɨ pe kuru. 
\s1 Paarʉ E'kupʉ'pʉ Utɨn Pɨ' Surusiran Pona 
\p  
\v 21 Serɨ ton e'kupʉ'pʉ tʉpo, Paarʉ e'kama'pʉ utɨn pɨ' Surusiran pona, Ma'sitoniya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ A'kaya poro, “Surusiran pona tʉutɨ'pʉ tʉpo, utɨ kuru mɨrɨ Ron pata pona,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 22 Asa'ron kon, Temu'ti mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Erastas, tʉpika'tɨnin nan ennoko'pʉ iya tʉwapiya Ma'sitoniya pona inke rʉ'kwɨ parɨ ɨko'mamʉi'ma Eisa nono pata yau. 
\s1 Usewa'noman E'pe'sas Po 
\p  
\v 23 Mɨrɨ a'tai, ipan nɨ anpokʉmanin e'sara'tɨ'pʉ Ite'ma awɨron kon pɨ'.  
\v 24 E'pe'sas po iyesi'pʉ ka'pon, Temi'tʉriyas itese', ɨpʉreman Arʉ'times pɨ' iwʉ' ka'pɨ'nin sirʉpa ke, mɨrɨpan tonpa ton uya eke pe kuru pʉrata epopɨtʉ'pʉ.  
\v 25 Temi'tʉriyas uya tʉtonpa ton kɨ'ma'pʉ, mɨrɨ waraino rɨ marɨ itʉrawasooi ton to' pokon pe tʉusauro'to' pe. Ta'pʉ iya, “Mi'tuyatʉu pe' utonpa ton, serɨ utʉrawasooi kon ikupʉ na'ne' winɨ eke pe pʉrata eporo uya'nokon?  
\v 26 Miyarɨ rɨ ensa', etasa' auya'nokon E'pe'sas po rɨken pen, e'tane siya rɨ Eisa pata awɨrɨ, tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' uya apurɨto' pe Paarʉ uya iku'sa' ka'pon nʉkoneka'pʉ ɨpʉreman nɨto' ipɨ' pe esi papa pe pʉra rɨ ta iya.  
\v 27 Ɨsɨ esi mɨrɨ yau, miyarɨ rɨ Paarʉ uya tato' apurɨ pɨ' ka'pon amʉ' esi a'tai, urɨ'nokon nʉkupʉnʉ enato' oton tʉnamasen pe pʉra rɨ. Eke kuru uri'san papa tukai' tʉku'sen Arʉ'times iwʉ' enato' oton ka'pon amʉ' enu yau pʉra rɨ. Kamo rɨ nɨrɨ ika'sa' pɨ' tʉwɨpʉremasan Eisa pata awɨrɨ'ne, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ non emʉ' kaisa rɨ nɨrɨ inamato' pʉra rɨ iyenato' oton,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 28 Serɨ ta Temi'tʉriyas uya eta tʉuya'nokon a'tai, to' ena'pʉ sakoro' pe. Ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨ' nɨ pɨ' to' e'sara'tɨ'pʉ, “Eke kʉrɨ rɨ papa tato' ipɨ' pe ika'sa', Arʉ'times, ɨpʉreman nɨto' kon ipɨ' E'pe'sas po!” tukai'.  
\v 29 Mɨrɨ pe rɨ, eke utanpokʉman esi'pʉ mɨrɨ pata yau. Ka'pon amʉ' uya Kayas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Aresta'kos a'si'pʉ, Paarʉ upinimʉ tonpa pe te'san. Mɨrɨ a'tai, anpisin ka'pon amʉ' enasa' tikin nɨ uya Kayas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Aresta'kos pi'sikʉ'pʉ amʉran nɨto' iwʉ' ta'.  
\v 30 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Paarʉ esi'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' anauro'kapai e'tane, Sises apurɨnin nan esi'pʉ itɨ i'se pʉra.  
\v 31 Kamoro nɨrɨ eke pata epuru ton, Paarʉ mai'pʉremu ton uya main ennoko'pʉ itɨ namai'. 
\p  
\v 32 Iyamʉrasa' kon esi'pʉ ɨsɨ pe ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨ' nɨ pɨ'; tʉron kon esi'pʉ tʉron nɨ pe ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨ' nɨ pɨ'; tʉron kon nɨrɨ, tʉron nɨ pe rɨ. Mɨrɨ yawon kon tu'kan kon ka'pon amʉ' uya ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' to' amʉrasa' mɨrɨ yau tukai' i'tu pʉra rɨ iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 33 Tʉron kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya Arisanta itese' ka'pon a'tu'ma'pʉ amʉran nɨto' iwʉ' tau, ka'pon amʉ' rau iye'mʉ'sa'kato' pe. Tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' anpisin koro'tau te'san ukɨ'pɨ'nʉmʉ'pʉ Arisanta auro'ka pe. Arisanta uya temiyatʉ anʉmʉ'pʉ, e'pana e'tɨ' ta tʉuya e'kwa pe, tiwano' pe rɨ tʉusaurokʉ wenai.  
\v 34 E'tane Esuwerʉ pe to' uya ito'ka'nʉ'sa' a'tai, isaurokʉ i'se pʉra to' esi'pʉ. Tikin nɨ te'sepose to' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉmʉ'pʉ asa' ite'kwa kʉra' emiya era'tɨto' e'to' poro, “Eke kʉrɨ rɨ Arʉ'times E'pe'sas pon kon iwano'!” tai'ma. 
\p  
\v 35 Pata karetaai menukapɨ'nin uya anpisin e'paka'nʉkʉ'pʉ. “E'pe'sas pon kon ka'pon amʉ'! I'tu auya'nokon pʉra pe' nai tanporo mɨ awɨron pata uya i'tu E'pe'sas esi eke Arʉ'times pɨ' ɨpʉreman nɨto' iwʉ' erasu pe te'san pe tukai'? Mɨrɨ nɨrɨ ipe ika'sa' Epʉn winɨ ita'mo'kasa' erasuntɨnin pe e'nɨ'nokon tukai'.  
\v 36 Mɨrɨ wenai, serɨ ton esi ke onamʉ poken pʉra, e'pana ɨwe'to' kon pe iyesi, tʉusenuminkai' pʉra ɨ'rɨ rɨ tʉku'se pʉra.  
\v 37 Serɨ uya rɨ pʉsamoro asa'ron kon ka'pon amʉ' ne'to' auya'nokon wenai pe pʉra iyesi'pʉ man. Ɨpʉreman nɨto' yawon ama'masa' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ika'sa' itese' pɨ' e'nɨto' pe pa'nʉ'sa' to' uya pʉra iyesi nɨrɨ.  
\v 38 E'tane Temi'tʉriyas mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨpʉreman nɨto' ku'pɨ'nin nan uya pata eseru main i'kwɨ'sa' pe iyesi yau, serɨ rupɨ konekato' esi moro rɨ. Mɨrɨ yau, konekanin nan eke ton esi. Mɨrɨ yau, to' utɨto' pe iyesi teseru kon konekai'.  
\v 39 E'tane miyarɨ rɨ ɨri i'se ɨwesi kon yau, ikonekato' pe iyesi pata eseru uya tasa' awɨrɨ.  
\v 40 Ɨsɨ yau e'nɨ'nokon man, apʉne pʉra Roman amʉ' uya uyekama'popɨtʉ kon mɨrɨ serɨ pe ne'kupʉine' pɨ'. Ɨ'rɨ wenai ɨsɨ pe ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨ' nɨ esi'pʉ tukai', ekama ton pʉra iye'tane mɨrɨ wenai tukai',” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 41 Serɨ ta'pʉ iya tʉpo, iyamʉrasa' kon nin si ka'pon amʉ' ennoko'pʉ iya mɨrɨ, mɨrɨ apai. 
\c 20  
\s1 Paarʉ Utɨ'pʉ Ma'sitoniya Mɨrɨ Awonsi'kɨ Kiris Poro 
\p  
\v 1 Ɨsɨ pe ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨ' nɨ ereutasa' tʉpo, Paarʉ uya tʉtonpa ton kɨ'ma'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon pori'mapɨtʉ tʉpo, Paarʉ uya, “Ɨisirɨ utɨyai',” ta'pʉ to' pɨ', mɨrɨpan utɨ'pʉ Ma'sitoniya pona, to' tʉnɨnse E'pe'sas po.  
\v 2 Mɨrɨ awɨrɨ rɨ, itɨ'pʉ. Eke pe rɨ ka'pon amʉ' pori'ma'pʉ iya, tu'kan pɨ' rɨ, mɨrɨpan uyee'pʉ Kiris\f + \fr 20:2 \fq Kiris, \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq A'kaya\f* pona.  
\v 3 Mɨrɨ yau, iko'mamʉ'pʉ osorʉwau kapʉi. Iye'kama koro'tau kanau epotorʉ'pʉ yau utɨn pɨ' Siriya pona, Esuwerʉ amʉ' ekonekasa' eta'pʉ iya ipɨ' te'to' kon pe. Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', iyekoneka'pʉ tenna'poto' pe Ma'sitoniya poro.  
\v 4 Iya'kɨron kon esi'pʉ So'pa'tarʉ, Piros mu, Pereya winon; Aresta'kos, Sekuntos, Tesaroni'ka winon kon; Kayas, Terʉpi winon; Tai'ki'kas, Tʉro'pimas, Eisa winon kon; Temu'ti nɨrɨ.  
\v 5 Pʉsamoro warawo' amʉ' utɨ'pʉ ina rawɨrɨ to' esi'pʉ ina enupɨkɨrɨ Tʉrowas po.  
\v 6 E'tane ina utɨ'pʉ kanau yau Piri'pai yapai A'sarutanʉ'sa' Pen Pʉreti Pɨ' Enta'nan Weyu tʉpo. 5 kaisa rɨ wʉi tʉpo, ina e'seporo'pʉ tʉron kon a'kɨrɨ Tʉrowas po. Mɨrɨ yau, ina uko'mamʉ'pʉ 7 kaisa rɨ wʉi. 
\s1 Moine Eri'sa' I'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ Paarʉ Uya 
\p  
\v 7 Suntaaka e'sara'tɨ pe, ina amʉra'pʉ pʉreti pɨ' enta'nai'. Paarʉ uya ka'pon amʉ' auro'ka'pʉ. Awanapai rɨ tʉutɨto' esi pɨ' isaurokʉ'pʉ anomʉra' pona rɨ.  
\v 8 Mɨrɨ yau, tu'ke raan'pu amʉ' esi'pʉ ka'tawon tau ina amʉrato' yau.  
\v 9 Moine ka'pon ereutasa' esi'pʉ winto po, Iu'tai'kos itese'. Kʉrɨ rɨ e'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ, miyarɨ rɨ Paarʉ usaurokʉ koro'tau, mɨrɨpan e'nʉnkaa'pʉ ipan pe, nʉta'mo'kai osorʉwawon ikawono ɨutɨ apai. Mɨrɨpan uma'tasa' anʉmʉ'pʉ to' uya eke' pe.  
\v 10 Paarʉ u'tɨ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan ena'pʉ ipʉro'pona, temiyatʉ tʉrʉ'pʉ iya iwoi, “Ipan pe kuru kɨsewankamatʉu! Nurɨne rɨ man!” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 11 Mɨrɨ tʉpo kanan, ka'ta' iyenuku'pʉ pʉreti pɨ' enta'nai'. Pata tema'kwai' tʉusaurokʉ tʉpo, itɨ'pʉ.  
\v 12 Ka'pon amʉ' uya moine arɨ'pʉ nurɨne. Ipan pe kuru pori' pe to' epori'masa' esi'pʉ. 
\s1 E'pe'sas Epuru Ton Panama'pʉ Paarʉ Uya 
\p  
\v 13 Ina utɨ'pʉ kanau yau A'sos pona. Mɨrɨ yau, Paarʉ anʉnse'na ina utɨ'pʉ. “Mɨrɨ yau uyepotʉi',” ta'pʉ iya a'mun po tʉutɨ pɨ'.  
\v 14 Ina eposa' iya a'tai A'sos po, ina uya arɨ'pʉ Me'tirin pona.  
\v 15 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, ina utɨ'pʉ mɨrɨ apai Kiyos pona. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, ina e'kwɨrɨtʉ'pʉ Samos pona; mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, Mairi'tos eporo'pʉ ina uya.  
\v 16 Paarʉ e'ku'sa' esi'pʉ E'pe'sas entakato' pe tʉuya kanau yau, inke ɨko'manpai pʉra iyesi'pʉ Eisa po. Surusiran ɨnepopai isenutɨ'pʉ Penti'kas weyu a'tai. 
\p  
\v 17 Mairi'tos ponsi'kɨ, E'pe'sas so'sii epuru ton kɨ'ma'pʉ Paarʉ uya.  
\v 18 To' uya teposa' a'tai, ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'; “Uko'mamʉ'pʉ eseru i'tu auya'nokon mɨrɨ ɨpiyau'nokon Eisa po esi a'tai.  
\v 19 Itepuru apiyo' pe esi'pʉ se pe rɨ tenai', tʉukaranpɨ'se nɨrɨ, sa'man pe rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya ukota'ma tane.  
\v 20 I'tu auya'nokon mɨrɨ, tanporo unekamanʉ ekama'pʉ uya ɨpika'tɨnin kon pe te'sen, ɨyenupa'pʉ uya 'nokon annau'ne rɨ, ɨiwʉ' kon tau'ne nɨrɨ.  
\v 21 Enpoika'pʉ uya Esuwerʉ amʉ', Kiri' amʉ' pɨ' nɨrɨ tʉmakooi kon pɨ' to' usewankama era'tɨto' pe Papa winɨkʉi', Sises yau apurɨto' esa' pe to' enato' pe. 
\p  
\v 22 “Serɨ si Papa A'kwarʉ uya tapiyo'mai', utɨ si serɨ Surusiran pona, ɨ'rɨ e'kupʉ upɨ' mɨrɨ yau tukai' i'tui'ma pʉra.  
\v 23 Se rɨken i'tu uya tanporo pata yau'ne Wakʉ A'kwarʉ uya upana'tɨ. Mɨrɨ yau, pariki'si ta' uya'sito', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ sa'man nɨ e'ku'to' esi upɨ'.  
\v 24 E'tane usewankama pʉra rɨ iyesi uwɨnin nan pɨ', utʉrawasooi ɨnku'pai esi Itepuru Sises nʉtʉrʉ'pʉ iku'to' pe uya utʉrawasooi, tanporon kon pɨ' Papa uya wakʉ nonkasa' ekareei ekamato' uya.\x - \xo 20:24 \xt 2 Temu'ti 4:7\x* 
\p  
\v 25 “Si'tuyai' ɨmɨrɨ'nokon serɨ itekare, Papa e'to' esa' wannɨ pe ekama'pʉ uya ipana ya' ton uya uyento' oton pen serɨ enta'.  
\v 26 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ekama uya ɨpɨ'nokon serɨ pe; makoi pʉra esi tanporon kon ka'pon amʉ' mʉnʉ piyapai.  
\v 27 Tanporon nɨ Papa e'to' i'tu auya'nokon i'se ekamasa' uya man. Ɨ'rɨ rɨ Papa Maimu nonkasa' uya pʉra iyesi.  
\v 28 Wakʉ pe epa'simatɨ', tanporo ɨtonpa kon amʉ' rɨ pokon pe, Wakʉ A'kwarʉ uya ɨku'sa' kon na'ne' to' ennin pe. Papa apurɨnin nan\f + \fr 20:28 \fq Papa apurɨnin nan—Papa so'sii. \ft Tʉron nɨ imenukasa' ton, \fq Itepuru Sises so'sii, \ft tawon esi.\f* ennin pe e'tɨ', Sises ne'ma'pʉ tʉmʉnʉ ke.  
\v 29 Si'tuyai', kasi ton enupanin nan uye'to' oton ɨsɨ ton ene amʉ' kasa ɨ'koro'ta'nokon. Kʉrai apurɨto' apai to' ereutanʉ'to' oton to' uya.  
\v 30 Ɨ'koro'tapai'nokon nɨ to' e'mʉ'sa'kato' oton, itekare ensimato' oton to' uya, Sises apurɨnin nan era'tɨto' oton to' pɨkɨrɨ.  
\v 31 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ti'tui' e'tɨ'. Mi'tuyatʉu pe' osorʉwau wʉipiya tereutapɨ'se pʉra ayauro'ka kon pɨ' uko'mamʉ'pʉ ewarupɨ nau, wʉi nai nɨrɨ tʉukaranpɨ'se. 
\p  
\v 32 “Serɨ pe ɨnonka uya 'nokon Papa ena', wakʉ nonkasa' iya maimu ya', ɨmɨrɨ'nokon ku'nin apurɨnin pe ya'. Mɨrɨ a'tai, ɨwe'to' oton kon Papa na'ne' yau tu'kan nɨ wakʉ ton epoto' auya'nokon, Papa nekama'pʉ tʉmunkɨ amʉ' pɨ'.  
\v 33 Ɨnʉ' rɨ sirʉpaai, korʉʉi rɨ, pon nɨ enkuui pe esi pʉn.  
\v 34 I'tu auya'nokon nɨ mɨrɨ uiwano' pe rɨ e'tʉrawasomapɨ'sa' pʉrata eporo pɨ' i'se e'to' eporo pɨ', utonpa ton e'to' i'se nɨrɨ.  
\v 35 Tanporo unkupʉnʉ winɨ, sa'man tʉrawaso kupʉ'pʉ uya winɨ, ɨyenupasa' uya 'nokon ipʉrataai pʉnon kon pika'tɨnin pe e'nɨto' pe. Sises uya se kasa ta'pʉ iku'tɨ' ɨyenu kon yau, ‘Wakʉ pe kuru iyesi te'repasan pe e'nɨ a'tai, tʉrepasan pe e'nɨ entai,’” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya to' pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 36 Serɨ ta tʉpo, iye'sekunka'pʉ tanporon kon pokon pe iyɨpʉrema'pʉ.  
\v 37 Tanporo to' ukaramʉ'pʉ ipɨ' tʉuta'sii', to' uya a'su'ka'pʉ nɨrɨ.  
\v 38 “Serɨ enta' uyene auya'nokon pen,” ta iya pɨ', to' upokoita'pʉ. Eke kanau ya' ipɨkɨrɨ to' utɨ'pʉ. 
\c 21  
\s1 Paarʉ Utɨ'pʉ Surusiran Pona 
\p  
\v 1 To' piyapai ina emo'ka'pʉ tʉpo, ina uta'tu'ma'pʉ parau po. To'sa rɨ ina utɨ'pʉ Kos pona. Iyema'sa' yau, ina utɨ'pʉ Rotes pona; mɨrɨ apai, ina utɨ'pʉ Pa'tara pona.  
\v 2 Kanau epotorʉ'pʉ tɨ'kwɨrɨ'sen eporo'pʉ ina uya Pini'siya po. Mɨrɨ ya', tekanwa'tɨi' ina utɨ'pʉ.  
\v 3 Sai'pʉras ene tʉuya'nokon tʉpo, ina uya entaka'pʉ wʉi enu enuku kamisi winɨkʉi'. Ina utɨ'pʉ Siriya pona. Ina ekanwaka'pʉ Taya pona, apuru kanwaka to' uya koro'tau.  
\v 4 Sises apurɨnin nan eporo'pʉ ina uya. 7 kaisa rɨ wʉi ina uko'mamʉ'pʉ to' piyau. Iya'kwarʉ uya to' pana'tɨ'pʉ Paarʉ auro'kato' pe to' uya itɨ namai' Surusiran pona.  
\v 5 Ina weyu u'ma'sa' a'tai to' piyau ina e'to', ina uya to' nɨmɨ'pʉ, tanporo Sises apurɨnin nan, to' no'pʉ ton, to' munkɨ amʉ' nɨrɨ utɨ'pʉ ina a'kɨrɨ eke pata apai. Mɨrɨ yau, tuna e'pi po ina e'sekunka'pʉ ɨpʉreman pɨ'.  
\v 6 “Ɨisirɨ'nokon,” ta tʉpo tʉtonpa kon amʉ' pɨ', ina ekanwa'tɨ'pʉ kanau epotorʉ'pʉ ya'. Tʉron kon enna'po'pʉ tʉpata kon ya'. 
\p  
\v 7 Miyarɨ rɨ utɨn pɨ' ina esi'pʉ Taya apai. Ina ekanwaka'pʉ Toremes pona. Mɨrɨ yau te'san ina tonpa ton pɨ', “Miyarɨ,” ta'pʉ ina uya. To' piyau ina uko'mamʉ'pʉ tikin nɨ wʉi.  
\v 8 Iyema'sa' yau, ina utɨ'pʉ Sisariya tepose. Mɨrɨ yau, ina utɨ'pʉ Piri' itekare ekamanin iwʉ' ta' ipiyau e'se'na, Surusiran po 7 pe to' nanʉmʉ'san tonpa pe te'sen.\x - \xo 21:8 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 6:5; 8:5\x* 
\v 9 Asakɨrɨ'nan kon a'pɨ'pʉnon itensi ton esi'pʉ pu'kena' pe itekare ekamanin nan. 
\p  
\v 10 Mɨrɨ yau inke kuru pʉra rɨ ina esi'pʉ tʉpo, pu'kena' Akapas itese' uyee'pʉ Isutiya winɨ.\x - \xo 21:10 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 11:28\x* 
\v 11 Iyee'pʉ ina piya', Paarʉ pokʉrʉʉi anʉmʉ'pʉ iya, temiyatʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ti'ta auromʉ'pʉ iya, se tai'ma: “Wakʉ A'kwarʉ man se kasa ta pɨ', ‘Serɨ pokʉrʉ esa' auronpɨ'to' oton Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya Surusiran po, mɨrɨpan tʉto' oton to' uya Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen ena',’” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 12 Serɨ etasa' ina uya a'tai, ina mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ka'pon amʉ' mɨrɨ awon kon uya Paarʉ temekʉ'pʉ itɨ namai' Surusiran pona.  
\v 13 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Paarʉ uya to' pɨ' ta'pʉ, “Ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' aukaramʉ kon uyewan nɨ tʉpokoitanʉ'se? Ekonekasa' serɨ uya'sito' pe rɨken pen e'tane uma'tato' pe Surusiran po Itepuru Sises ese' wenai!” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 14 Ina uya tauro'ka eta iya pʉra iyesi wenai, ina uya inonka'pʉ. “Tɨwɨ Itepuru e'to' i'se ne'kupʉi i'se iye'to' awɨrɨ,” ta'pʉ ina uya. 
\p  
\v 15 Mɨrɨ yau tesi kon tʉpo, tekonekai' ina utɨ'pʉ Surusiran pona.  
\v 16 Sises apurɨnin nan Sisariya winon kon utɨ'pʉ ina a'kɨrɨ, mɨrɨpan kon uya ina arɨ'pʉ Nasʉn itese' ka'pon iwʉ' ta'. Mɨrɨ yau, ina uko'mamʉ'pʉ ipiyau. Sai'pʉras winon pe iyesi'pʉ, pena si'kɨrɨ rɨ Sises apurɨnin pe iyesi'pʉ. 
\s1 Paarʉ Epa'ka'pʉ Surusiran Pona 
\p  
\v 17 Surusiran eposa' ina uya a'tai, ina tonpa ton uya ina ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ tepori'ma kon pe.  
\v 18 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, Paarʉ a'kɨrɨ ina utɨ'pʉ Isens ense'na. Tanporo so'si epuru ton esi'pʉ mɨrɨ yau.  
\v 19 “Miyarɨ,” ta tʉpo to' pɨ', Paarʉ uya tanporon Papa nʉkupʉ'pʉ pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen koro'tau te'tʉrawasoma a'taino pɨ' to' auro'ka'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 20 Serɨ etasa' to' uya a'tai, Papa apurɨpɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya. Ta'pʉ to' uya Paarʉ pɨ', “Ina tonpa, tu'kan kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' man Itepuru Sises apurɨ pɨ'. Tanporon kon man ipan pe Main, Mosi' winon apurɨ pɨ'.  
\v 21 Tʉron kon ka'pon amʉ' uya to' auro'kasa' esi'pʉ ɨmɨrɨ pɨ' tanporo Esuwerʉ amʉ' enupasa' auya Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen koro'tau tʉuko'mansan to' ereutato' pe Main, Mosi' winon piyapai to' auro'ka'pʉ auya, tʉmunkɨ kon yun pi'pɨ puturʉka to' uya namai', urɨ'nokon eseru awɨrɨ.  
\v 22 Ɨ'rɨ ken si kupʉ uya'nokon? To' uya kuru eta mɨrɨ ɨuye'sa' tukai'.  
\v 23 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ayauro'kato' awɨrɨ e'kɨ. Mɨrɨ yau man asakɨrɨ'nan kon ka'pon amʉ' Papa auro'kanin nʉ'san tʉnku'ton kon pɨ'.  
\v 24 Pʉsamoro ka'pon amʉ' akɨ to' ekorʉkato' pe to' pokon pe mekorʉkai'. To' i'pai kiriri'pɨ'nin nan, to' ekorʉkasa' ekamanin pe, me'mai'. Mɨrɨ a'tai, tanporon kon uya i'tuto' pe i'napai rɨ pʉra rɨ ɨpɨ' usauro'nɨsa' na'ne' esi tukai', e'tane main pʉreme'nin pe pʉra rɨ ɨwesi tukai'.\x - \xo 21:24 \xt Nonpa 6:13-21; Inkupʉ'pʉ 18:18\x* 
\v 25 Ina uya nin Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen enasa' Sises apurɨnin pe ena' imenukasa' man. Ina e'ku'sa' man ika'sa' ena' itʉsa' pɨ' to' enta'na namai', to' enta'na namai' mʉnʉ'pan nɨ o' pɨ' mɨrɨ pe pʉra erupatu'kasa' pɨ' rɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tekumasan pe to' esi namai',”\x - \xo 21:25 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 15:29\x* ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 26 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, Paarʉ uya ka'pon amʉ' arɨ'pʉ to' pokon pe iyekorʉka'pʉ. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, itɨ'pʉ Papa ena' Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' ta' to' auro'kase'na, ekorʉkan nʉ'pʉ weyu u'ma'to' pɨ', tanporon kon use'mato' ike ekonekato' oton pɨ' to' kaisa rɨ. 
\s1 To' Uya Paarʉ A'si'pʉ 
\p  
\v 27 7 kaisaron wʉi u'matʉ iwa koro'tau, Eisa winon kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya Paarʉ ene'pʉ Papa ena' Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' tau. Anpisin tʉtʉrʉnkai' Paarʉ a'sito' pe to' uya ikuu'pʉ.  
\v 28 To' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ, “Esuwerʉ amʉ', ina ipika'tɨtɨ'! Pʉse rɨ si ka'pon mɨ yawɨron kon tanporo ka'pon amʉ' enupanin, urɨ'nokon Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Main, Mosi' winon ewa'nomanin. Mɨrɨ pona, Kiri' amʉ' ne'sa' iya Papa ena' use'man nɨto', ɨpʉreman nɨto' iwʉ' ta', wakʉ pata ma'tanʉ'se'na,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 29 (Tʉro'pimas ene'pʉ to' uya E'pe'sas pata winon Paarʉ a'kɨrɨ, to' usenuminka'pʉ Paarʉ uya ine'sa' use'man nɨto', ɨpʉreman nɨto' iwʉ' ta' tukai'.) 
\p  
\v 30 Tanporo pata pon kon utaipo'pʉ. Tanporo pata kaisaron kon eka'tunsa' uyee'pʉ. Paarʉ pi'sikʉ'pʉ to' uya use'man nɨto', ɨpʉreman nɨto' iwʉ' tapai. Mɨrɨ pe rɨ, mʉra'ta a'koro'pʉ to' uya. \fig Mɨrɨ pe rɨ, mʉra'ta a'koro'pʉ to' uya.|src="CN02057B.tif" size="span" loc="ACT 21:30" copy="David C. Cook" ref="21:30" \fig* 
\v 31 Iwɨnɨ i'se to' esi koro'tau, main uya Roman amʉ' soisaai epuru eporo'pʉ eke pe Surusiran pata pon kon utaipon pɨ' man tukai'.  
\v 32 Inke pʉra soisa amʉ' anʉmʉ'pʉ iya. To' eka'tumʉ'pʉ tu'kan kon koro'ta'. Roman amʉ' soisaai epuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ soisa amʉ' ensa' to' uya a'tai, iwɨpɨtʉ tʉuya'nokon ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 33 Eke soisa amʉ' epuru uya a'si'pʉ. “Asa'rɨ i'sen ke aurontɨ',” ta'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' ekama'po'pʉ iya, “Ɨnʉ' pe iyesi? Ɨ'rɨ ku'sa' iya?” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 34 Tu'kan kon ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ tʉron nɨ pe'ne, wakʉ pe i'napairon eporo iya pʉra eke soisa amʉ' epuru esi'pʉ, eke pe to' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ wenai. “Soisa amʉ' iwʉ' ta' Paarʉ atɨ',” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 35 Paarʉ uya miye' eposa' a'tai, tu'kan kon e'sakoropasa' esi'pʉ ipan pe. Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', soisa amʉ' uya arɨ'pʉ tʉra'runpai'.  
\v 36 Anpisin ipɨkɨrɨ te'san ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ, “Iwɨtɨ' rɨ!” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\s1 Paarʉ Uya Anpisin Auro'ka'pʉ 
\p  
\v 37 Paarʉ arɨ to' uya koro'tau soisa amʉ' iwʉ' ta', eke soisa amʉ' epuru ekama'po'pʉ iya, “Apʉne, kanyauro'kai'ya,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p “Kiri' pe pe' tʉusauro'sen ɨmɨrɨ?” ta'pʉ soisa amʉ' epuru uya ipɨ'.  
\v 38 “Isi' pon pen pe' ɨmɨrɨ manenpanin sara'tɨnin nʉ'pʉ, 4,000 kaisaron kon wɨnin nan anin nʉ'pʉ rɨmono' ta' pena?” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 39 Paarʉ uya eikʉ'pʉ, “Esuwerʉ urɨ, Tarʉsas, Siri'siya yawon yau iyentusa' rʉ'pʉ, patawon kanan urɨ tɨ ekasiman pen yawon. Apʉne, ka'pon amʉ' sauro'kai'ya,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 40 Eke soisa amʉ' epuru uya, “Ewai',” ta'pʉ tʉpo, Paarʉ e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ miye' pona, “E'pana e'tɨ'!” ta'pʉ iya temiyatʉ ke. Tanporo to' e'paka'sa' a'tai, ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' maimu yai.\f + \fr 21:40 \fq Esuwerʉ amʉ' maimu yai, \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra \fq Arami' pe; \ft Ma'siu 22:2 yau nɨrɨ.\f* 
\c 22  
\s1 Paarʉ Usaurokʉ'pʉ Sises Pɨkɨron Pe Tena'pʉ Pɨ' 
\r (Inkupʉ'pʉ 9:1-19; 26:12-18) 
\p  
\v 1 “Utonpa ton, ukʉipʉnʉ ton, apʉne uyetatɨ' usekama tane!” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 2 Arami' pe isaurokʉ eta to' uya a'tai, e'pana parɨ to' ena'pʉ. Paarʉ uya ta'pʉ mɨrɨ a'tai, 
\p  
\v 3 “Esuwerʉ urɨ, iyentusa' rʉ'pʉ Tarʉsas, Siri'siya yawon yau, e'tane serɨ yau usemo'ka'pʉ. Kamariyerʉ piyau usenupa'pʉ ukʉipʉnʉ kon nʉkoneka'pʉ Main pɨ'. Ipan pe Papa apurɨ pɨ' serɨ pe ɨwesi kon na'ne' kasa.\x - \xo 22:3 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 5:34-39\x* 
\v 4 Serɨ wenai, Ite'ma awɨron kon kota'mapɨtʉ'pʉ uya to' wɨto' pe to' ne'pɨtʉ'pʉ uya. Warawo' amʉ', uri'sami'si amʉ' nɨrɨ a'sipɨtʉ'pʉ uya pariki'si ta'.  
\v 5 Mɨrɨ kasa rɨ nɨrɨ, Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Konsʉrʉ amʉ' uya ta mɨrɨ, kareta rɨ sepopɨ'tai to' winɨ Tamaskas awon kon to' tonpa ton ena' tʉutɨsen. Mɨrɨ ya' rɨ, utɨpɨtʉ'pʉ ka'pon amʉ' ne'se'na a'sisa' pe to' arɨ pɨ' Surusiran pona to' kota'mato' pe.\x - \xo 22:5 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 8:3; 26:9-11\x* 
\p  
\v 6 “Wʉi nai pata esi koro'tau, a'ko pe Tamaskas eporo uya koro'tau, ite'kwanau pʉra rɨ, Epʉn winɨ a'kwa e'wei'tɨ uya uyenkasi'panʉkʉ'pʉ.  
\v 7 Uta'mo'ka'pʉ non pona, main eta'pʉ uya, ‘Saarʉ, Saarʉ, ɨ'rɨto' pe ukota'ma auya?’ tawon. 
\p  
\v 8 “‘Ɨnʉ' ɨmɨrɨ, Uyepuru?’ tukai' ekama'po'pʉ uya. 
\p “‘Sises urɨ, Nasare' winon, mʉkota'mayai'ne',’ ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 9 Uya'kɨron kon uya a'kwa ene'pʉ e'tane, uyauro'kanin eta to' uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 10 “‘Ɨ'rɨ kupʉ uya serɨ, uyepuru?’ tukai' ekama'po'pʉ uya. 
\p “‘E'mʉ'sa'ka', enta Tamaskas pona. Mɨrɨ yau, tanporo ɨnkupʉnʉ ke ayauro'kato' pe,’ ta'pʉ Itepuru uya.  
\v 11 Uya'kɨron kon uya uyarɨ'pʉ uyemiyatʉ pɨ' Tamaskas pona, apʉne pʉra a'kwa uya uyenkasi'panʉ'sa' pɨ' itenu pʉra urɨ tʉku'se. 
\p  
\v 12 “Ananayas itese' ka'pon uyee'pʉ uyense'na, mɨrɨ yawon kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' nʉnamanʉ pe kuru iyesi'pʉ, ipan pe Main, Mosi' winon ikonekasa' awɨron pe iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 13 Iye'mʉ'sa'kasa' esi'pʉ upiyau, ‘Utonpa, Saarʉ, ennin pe kanan enakɨ!’ ta'pʉ iya upɨ'. Mɨrɨ pe rɨ, ennin pe ena'pʉ.  
\v 14 Mɨrɨ a'tai, ta'pʉ iya, ‘Papa, ukʉipʉnʉ kon esi'pʉ itese' pɨ' uya ayanʉnsa' man, teseru i'tunin pe ɨwesi pa, Ipokena' Pe Te'sen inanʉmʉ'pʉ ene pa, inta winon imaimu etanin pe ɨwesi pa.  
\v 15 Tanporon kon ka'pon amʉ' pɨ' ɨnene'pʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨneta'pʉ ekamanin pe ɨwesi pa.  
\v 16 Ɨ'rɨ enupɨkɨrɨ ɨwesi? E'mʉ'sa'ka', epa'taisima', amakooi ekorʉkato' pe ɨpʉremakɨ Sises pɨ',’ ta'pʉ Ananayas uya upɨ'. 
\p  
\v 17 “Surusiran pona enna'posa' a'tai, ɨpʉrema koro'tau use'man nɨto', ɨpʉreman nɨto' iwʉ' tau, uyenu uta'kwakasa' uya ene'pʉ.  
\v 18 Itepuru uya uyauro'ka, ‘Inke pʉra enta Surusiran apai, apʉne pʉra to' uya upɨ' ausauro'to' apurɨ pʉra iyesi mɨrɨ,’ ta'pʉ iya upɨ'. 
\p  
\v 19 “‘Uyepuru, pʉsamoro uya ui'tu mɨrɨ usenupan nɨto' iwʉ' kaisa rɨ utɨpɨ'sa', to' a'sipɨtʉ pɨ' pariki'si ta', to' wɨpɨtʉ pɨ' kamoro ayapurɨnin nan.  
\v 20 To' uya nɨrɨ i'tu Si'tipʉn, itekare ekamanin pe te'sen mʉnʉ utɨ a'tai, e'mʉ'sa'kasa' esi'pʉ mɨrɨ yau iwɨtɨ' rɨ ta pe iwɨnin nan pon esa' pe esi'pʉ,’ ta'pʉ uya Itepuru pɨ'.\x - \xo 22:20 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 7:58\x* 
\p  
\v 21 “Mɨrɨ a'tai, Itepuru uya ta'pʉ upɨ', ‘Enta, ɨyennoko uya ɨnnɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen koro'ta',’ ta'pʉ iya,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya to' pɨ'. 
\s1 Roman Pe Paarʉ Esi 
\p  
\v 22 Anpisin uya Paarʉ maimu eta'pʉ mɨrɨ ta iya pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ, “Iwɨka'tɨ' kuru rɨ! Iko'manto' pʉra rɨ iyesi mɨrɨ!” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 23 To' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ rɨ kanan, tʉpon kon mo'kapɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya, non ma'kɨrɨ'pʉ to' uya ka'ta'.  
\v 24 Eke soisa amʉ' epuru uya, “Paarʉ atɨ' soisa amʉ' iwʉ' ta',” ta'pʉ tʉpoitorʉ ton pɨ'. To' auro'ka'pʉ iya to' uya ari'po'pɨ'to' pe, isekamato' pe ɨ'rɨ wenai to' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ ewa'noma pe, tukai'.  
\v 25 Itemekon a'sipɨ'sa' to' uya esi'pʉ ari'po'pɨ'tane, Paarʉ uya ta'pʉ itepuru e'mʉ'sa'kasa' pɨ' mɨrɨ yau, “Iye'to' pe rɨ pe' iyesi Roman pe te'sen ari'po'pɨtʉ a'tai ɨnʉ' uya rɨ ɨri iteseru eposa' pʉra iye'tane?” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 26 Soisa amʉ' epuru uya serɨ etasa' a'tai, itɨ'pʉ eke soisa amʉ' epuru piya' ekamase'na, “Ɨ'rɨ kupʉ auya? Roman pe sa'ne man ko!” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 27 Eke soisa amʉ' epuru utɨ'pʉ Paarʉ ekama'pose'na, “Uyauro'kakɨ, Roman amʉ' karetaai esa' pe' ɨmɨrɨ?” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p “Ewai',” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 28 Mɨrɨ a'tai, eke soisa amʉ' epuru uya ta'pʉ, “Eke pe pʉrata ke tʉuse'mai' iyenasa' rʉ'pʉ urɨ kamoro Roman amʉ' tonpa pe,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p “E'tane, entu'pʉ si'kɨrɨ nin usanon uya ukaretai'tɨ'pʉ to' tonpa pe e'to' pe,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 29 Kamoro ekama'popɨtʉ pɨ' te'san utama'pʉ ipiyapai mɨrɨ a'tai rɨ. Soisa amʉ' epuru enari'nʉmʉ'pʉ, Paarʉ, Roman pe te'sen auronpɨ'sa' tʉuya pɨ' i'sen ke.\fig To' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ rɨ kanan, tʉpon kon mo'kapɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya, non ma'kɨrɨ'pʉ to' uya ka'ta'.|src="WA03989B.tif" size="span" loc="ACT 21:27—22:29" copy="David C. Cook" ref="22:23" \fig* 
\s1 Paarʉ E'wa'kʉtʉ'pʉ Esuwerʉ Amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi Ton Rau 
\p  
\v 30 Soisa amʉ' epuru esi'pʉ ɨni'tupai ɨ'rɨ pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya, ɨri ku'sa' Paarʉ uya ta, tukai'. Mɨrɨ pɨ', itepuru uya soisa amʉ' apiyo'ma'pʉ Paarʉ auronpɨ'sa' ara'ka pɨ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton eke ton kuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporo Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton kanan amʉrato' pe amʉran iwʉ' ta' ekama'pʉ iya, mɨrɨpan kon amʉra'pʉ. Mɨrɨpan itepuru uya Paarʉ nee'pʉ to' amʉrasa' koro'ta', mɨrɨpan uya iye'mʉ'sa'kato' pe ikupʉ'pʉ to' rau. 
\c 23  
\p  
\v 1 Paarʉ uya to'sa rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton enpɨtʉ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya ta'pʉ, “Utonpa ton Esuwerʉ amʉ', uko'mamʉ koro'tau, Papa nama pɨ' e'sa' man, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ si'tuyai' ɨ'rɨ rɨ ɨri ku'sa' uya pʉra rɨ iyesi, serɨ pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 2 Use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru, Ananayas uya etasa' a'tai, ipiyau iye'mʉ'sa'kasa' kon apiyo'ma'pʉ iya, to' uya Paarʉ inta'moto' pe.  
\v 3 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ uya ta'pʉ Ananayas pɨ', “Papa uya ɨkota'ma mɨrɨ, wakʉ pe tʉusensen, mɨrɨ ku'sa' auya pɨ'. Main, Mosi' winon awɨrɨ mɨrɨ airɨ ɨyereutasa' uya uyekama'popɨtʉ, e'tane iyawɨrɨ pʉra ɨwesi, ka'pon amʉ' mapiyo'mayai'ne' to' uya unta'mopɨ'to' pe,” ta'pʉ iya.\x - \xo 23:3 \xt Ma'siu 23:27-28\x* 
\p  
\v 4 Paarʉ piyau iye'mʉ'sa'kasa' kon uya, “Mɨrɨ kasa ɨri pe rɨ Papa ena' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru pɨ' ta auya pʉra iyesi mɨrɨ,” ta'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 5 Paarʉ uya to' maimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru tukai' i'tusa' uya pʉra man, utonpa ton. Mosi' nʉmenuka'pʉ yau, ‘Ɨri pe kasaurokʉi ka'pon amʉ' esa' pe te'sen pɨ' tawon nɨ,’\f + \fr 23:5 \ft E'sotas 22:28\f* i'tunin urɨ e'tane,” ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'.  
\v 6 Paarʉ uya to' Konsʉrʉʉi amʉ' ene'pʉ Satu'si amʉ' pe mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Pari'si amʉ' pe, eke pe isaurokʉ'pʉ konsʉrʉ amʉ' koro'tau, “Utonpa ton, Pari'si amʉ' tonpa sa'ne urɨ ko, Pari'si mu rɨ. Serɨ ekota'mato' yau esi iyeri'sa' kon e'mʉ'sa'kato' oton tukai' i'tu uya wenai!” ta'pʉ iya.\x - \xo 23:6 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 26:5; Piri'pai 3:5\x* 
\p  
\v 7 Serɨ tasa' iya a'tai, Pari'si amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Satu'si amʉ' e'sei'pɨtʉ'pʉ tʉtonpa kon pokon pe.  
\v 8 (Satu'si amʉ' uya, iyeri'sa' kon e'mʉ'sa'ka pʉra rɨ iyesi, inserʉ amʉ' pʉra rɨ iyesi, a'kwarʉ'san pʉra rɨ iyesi ta, e'tane Pari'si amʉ' uya moro rɨ iyesi, to' rɨ esi ta.\x - \xo 23:8 \xt Ma'siu 22:23; Ma' 12:18; Ʉru' 20:27\x*)  
\v 9 Pari'si amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Satu'si amʉ' ena'pʉ ɨsɨ pe to' e'sei'pɨtʉ'pʉ. Main pɨ' enupanin nan esi'pʉ Pari'si amʉ' pe, mɨrɨpan kon uya Satu'si amʉ' ei'pɨtʉ'pʉ ipan pe, “Ɨ'rɨ rɨ ɨri ku'sa' pʉse ka'pon uya eposa' ina uya pʉra man! A'tai pʉra inserʉ mɨrɨ pe pʉra a'kwarʉ rɨ uya auro'kasa', mɨrɨ kasa rɨ Papa ekareei ekamato' pe iya!” ta'pʉ Pari'si amʉ' uya. 
\p  
\v 10 To' e'sei'pɨ'to' ena'pʉ ɨsɨ pe, mɨrɨpan pɨ' eke soisa amʉ' epuru enari'nʉmʉ'pʉ Paarʉ rɨ na'kɨ karapɨtʉ to' uya ko tukai'. Mɨrɨpan uya soisa amʉ' apiyo'ma'pʉ Paarʉ enpa'kato' pe to' uya to' piyapai soisa amʉ' iwʉ' ta'. 
\p  
\v 11 Mɨrɨ ewarupɨɨi tau, Itepuru Sises uyee'pʉ Paarʉ piya', mɨrɨpan uya ta'pʉ, “Kenari'nʉmʉi! Serɨ yau, Surusiran po uyekareei ekamasa' auya man, mɨrɨ na'ne' kasa rɨ marɨ Ron po uyekareei mekamai',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\s1 Esuwerʉ Amʉ' E'kama'pʉ Paarʉ Wɨnɨ Pɨ' 
\p  
\v 12 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, Esuwerʉ amʉ' usaurokʉ'pʉ ɨ'rɨ kasa Paarʉ wɨto' pe tukai', mɨrɨpan kon e'kama'pʉ, “Ɨ'rɨ rɨ ensi pen mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ uta're'tɨn pen iwɨnɨ pʉ'kʉ pona,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 13 40 entaino kon nɨ e'kama'pʉ serɨ kupʉ pɨ',  
\v 14 mɨrɨpan kon utɨ'pʉ use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton eke ton kuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton piya', “Ina e'kamasa' man, ɨ'rɨ rɨ pɨ' uta're'tɨn nɨto' pe pʉra Paarʉ wɨnɨ pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ tukai'.  
\v 15 Mɨrɨ pɨ', ɨmɨrɨ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Konsʉrʉ amʉ' uya main ennoko i'se ina esi, eke soisa amʉ' epuru ena' Paarʉ enpa'kato' pe iya, ipokon pe asauro'pai kanan ina esi tukai', apʉne pʉra ina uya Paarʉ ekama'popɨ'to' esi tukai', itepuru mauro'katʉi'. Ina e'kama tane iwɨnɨ pɨ' iyepʉ koro'tau,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 16 E'tane Paarʉ parusi mʉre uya etasa' a'tai, itɨ'pʉ soisa amʉ' iwʉ' ta' Paarʉ piya', ipana'tɨse'na iwɨnɨ pɨ' to' e'kamasa' ekamai'.  
\v 17 Paarʉ uya etasa' a'tai, tikin nɨ soisa amʉ' epuru tonpa kɨ'ma'pʉ iya. “Pʉse rɨ warawo' mʉre akɨ soisa amʉ' epuru piya', apʉne pʉra inekamanʉ esi moro,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 18 Mɨrɨpan uya Paarʉ poitorʉ arɨ'pʉ soisa amʉ' epuru piya'. 
\p “Paarʉ uya uyenno'sa' ɨpiya', pʉse rɨ moineri'pɨ nekamanʉ esi pɨ',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 19 Mɨrɨpan soisa amʉ' epuru uya arɨ'pʉ tʉpiya' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ, “Ɨ'rɨ na'kɨ esi ɨnekamanʉ upɨ'?” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 20 “Ewai', Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton e'kamasa' ɨyekama'po pɨ' Paarʉ enpa'ka pa, Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton ena'. Mɨrɨpan kon uya tato' oton ina esi wakʉ iwa pe ɨnekama'popɨ'pai tukai', e'tane i'napai rɨ pʉra mɨrɨ esi.  
\v 21 Mɨrɨ pɨ' to' uya ɨyekama'posa' a'tai, to' maimu kʉsetai, apʉne pʉra 40 entai rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' esi, mɨrɨpan kon e'so'nansa' enuri'to' oton Paarʉ enupɨkɨrɨ. ‘Ɨ'rɨ rɨ pɨ' uta're'tɨn pen mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ensi pen, Paarʉ wɨnɨ pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ,’ tasa' to' uya. Mɨrɨpan kon nin si enurikʉ ɨ'rɨ rɨ tukai' tʉmaimu kon eikʉ auya i'se,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ poitorʉ uya soisa amʉ' epuru pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 22 Soisa amʉ' epuru uya, “Serɨ upana'tɨsa' auya na'ne' kʉsekamai ɨnʉ' pɨ' rɨ,” ta'pʉ, mɨrɨpan ennoko'pʉ iya tʉpiyapai. 
\s1 Paarʉ Ennoko'pʉ To' Uya Kopʉna Piya' 
\p  
\v 23 Mɨrɨpan soisa amʉ' epuru uya asa'rɨ tʉpoitorʉ ton auro'ka'pʉ, “200 kaisa rɨ soisa amʉ' epotɨ' Paarʉ a'kɨrɨ to' utɨto' pe, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ 70 kaisa rɨ kaware pon kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ 200 kaisa rɨ pɨrɨu tawon kon Sisariya pona to' utɨto' pe 9 a'kʉra' ewarupɨ nau.  
\v 24 Wakʉ pe kopʉna Piri'kʉs epoto' pe Paarʉ uya, itikʉn non ipo itɨto' ton kaware amʉ' mɨnepotʉi',” ta'pʉ soisa amʉ' epuru uya tʉpoitorʉ ton pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 25 Soisa amʉ' epuru uya kareta menuka'pʉ se kasa: 
\p  
\v 26 “Ina kopʉnaai, ina nʉnamanʉ, Piri'kʉs, miyarɨ ta uya ɨpɨ'. 
\p “Urɨ, Kʉrautiyas Raisayas uya ɨmenuka. 
\pi1  
\v 27 “Pʉse rɨ ka'pon enno'sa' uya man ɨpiya', Esuwerʉ amʉ' na'si'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon esi ɨnwɨpai, e'tane usoisaai amʉ' uya imo'kasa' Roman amʉ' tonpa pe rɨ iyesi tukai' ito'ka'nʉ'sa' uya pɨ'.  
\v 28 Ɨnto'ka'nʉ'pai esi ɨ'rɨ pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya ɨri ku'sa' iya ta tukai'. Mɨrɨ pɨ', Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton ena' arɨ'pʉ uya to' uya ekama'popɨ'to' pe.  
\v 29 E'tane ɨ'rɨ rɨ eposa' uya pʉra iyesi iwɨto' iwenai, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ a'sito' pariki'si ta', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ main tʉusenupato' kon pɨ' rɨ nin to' uya eseru'tɨ.  
\v 30 Esuwerʉ amʉ' e'kamasa' Paarʉ wɨnɨ pɨ' ke upana'tɨsa' ka'pon uya a'tai, ennoko pɨ' e'kama'pʉ ɨpiya'. Esuwerʉ amʉ' kanan auro'kasa' uya man to' utɨto' pe Sisariya pona inkuu'pʉ ekamato' pe to' uya ɨpɨ'. Serɨ serɨ kareta, urɨ itepuru,” 
\m ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 31 Soisa amʉ' utɨ'pʉ itepuru uya tauro'kato' kon awɨrɨ rɨ, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ kareta arɨ'pʉ to' uya ta'kɨrɨ'nokon. Paarʉ arɨ'pʉ to' uya ta'kɨrɨ'nokon ewarupɨ nau pata Antipateres pʉ'kʉ pona rɨ.  
\v 32 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, ti'ta kon po tʉutɨsan soisa amʉ' enna'po'pʉ Surusiran pona tʉron kon kaware pon kon soisa amʉ' utɨ tane Paarʉ a'kɨrɨ Sisariya pata ya'.  
\v 33 Kaware pon kon soisa amʉ' uya Sisariya pata eposa' a'tai, kareta mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Paarʉ tʉrʉ'pʉ kopʉna ena', mɨrɨpan kon enna'po'pʉ Surusiran pona.  
\v 34 Kopʉna uya kareta ene tʉpo, Paarʉ ekama'po'pʉ iya, “Ɨ'rɨ eke Roman amʉ' pata winon ɨmɨrɨ?” tukai'. 
\p “Siri'siya winon urɨ,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 35 “Ɨyekareei rɨ eta uya mɨrɨ ɨri ku'sa' auya tawon nan uye'sa' a'tai,” ta'pʉ kopʉna uya. Kopʉna uya soisa amʉ' auro'ka'pʉ Paarʉ ato' pe to' uya Era' iwʉ' ta', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ soisa amʉ' e'to' pe iterasu pe. 
\c 24  
\s1 I'tuto' Piri'kʉs Piyau 
\p  
\v 1 5 kaisaron wʉi tʉpo, use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin epuru, Ananayas utɨ'pʉ Sisariya pona Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ raya Tɨ'turas itese' pokon pe. Mɨrɨpan kon uya Paarʉ eseru'tɨto' tʉuya'nokon nepʉ'pʉ kopʉna piya'. 
\p  
\v 2 Paarʉ kɨ'masa' a'tai si, Tɨ'turas uya si Paarʉ eseru'tɨto' tʉuya'nokon ekama'pʉ mɨrɨ Piri'kʉs pɨ'. Ta'pʉ iya, “Kopʉna Piri'kʉs, wakʉ pe rɨ, tʉusewankamai' pʉra, inke rɨ ina ko'manʉ'sa' auya man. Pata eseru rɨ koneka'pʉ auya wakʉ pe uko'man nɨto' yau pe, wakʉ i'tu auya wenai ina epuru pe ɨwesi koro'tau.  
\v 3 Siya rɨ, mɨ awɨrɨ rɨ, eke rɨ wakʉ rɨ Piri'kʉs, tewan kon yapai kuru ina uya ekama serɨ, pori' pe ina man ɨnkupʉ'pʉ ina iwano' pe pɨ'.  
\v 4 Okoro' pen nɨ ina nekamanʉ eta pa wakʉ pe ɨyewan tʉku'se, ina uya ɨyekama'po. 
\p  
\v 5 “Pʉse rɨ ka'pon to'ka'nʉ'sa' ina uya man, wakʉ pe pʉra rɨ uko'man nɨ emapu'tɨnin pe, tʉtonpa ton Esuwerʉ amʉ' epanta'mato' pe to' tʉrʉnkapɨ'nin pe siya rɨ pata kaisarɨ rɨ. Pʉse rɨ ka'pon esi Nasare' pon eseru rʉ'pʉ pɨ' te'san epuru,  
\v 6 mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ina, Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' rɨ ma'tanʉkʉ iya tukai' rɨ isaurokʉ. Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ina uya ereutanʉ'sa' ikupʉ iya namai'.\f + \fr 24:6 \ft Tʉron nɨ imenukasa' ton uya v. 6b-8a ke iponantɨsa' se kasa: \fq Serɨ tʉpo, usenupan nɨto' main uya ekamasa' na'ne' yawɨrɨ, \fv \ft 7 \+fv*\fq e'tane eke soisa amʉ' epuru Raisayas uyee'pʉ. Ɨ'se'ne' pe Paarʉ mo'ka'pʉ iya ina enapai. \fv \ft 8 \+fv*\fq Tɨwɨ si ipɨ' tʉusauro'san nʉyepʉi ɨpiya'.\f* 
\v 8 Ɨmɨrɨ pe rɨ i'tu auya mɨrɨ iwinɨpai i'napairon pe ipɨ' ina usauro'sa' tukai',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 9 Esuwerʉ amʉ' pokon pe te'sepose, “I'napairɨ rɨ serɨ ton esi,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\s1 Piri'kʉs Uya Paarʉ Ekama'popɨ'to' Ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ 
\p  
\v 10 Kopʉna uya si isauro'to' pe iku'sa' a'tai, Paarʉ uya eikʉ'pʉ, “Si'tuyai' pena rɨ serɨ pata yawon kon eseru aimenka pɨ' ɨuko'mamʉ'pʉ tukai'. Mɨrɨ pɨ', pori' pe kuru esii'ma usekama serɨ.  
\v 11 Sa'man pe pʉra rɨ uyekama'poto' auya ipɨ' to'ka'nʉkʉ auya mɨrɨ. Pena kuru pʉra rɨ 12 kaisarɨ rɨ wʉi Surusiran pona ɨpʉremai' utɨ'pʉ yapai.  
\v 12 Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya uyeposa' pʉra rɨ iyesi e'sei'pɨ' nɨ pɨ' ɨnʉ' ya' rɨ ina use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' tau. Mɨrɨ pe pʉra, ka'pon amʉ' rɨ tʉrʉnkasa' uya pʉra iyesi ɨri ku'to' pe to' uya ina usenupato' tau, mɨrɨ pe pʉra mairɨ rɨ pata yau.  
\v 13 To' nekama ton pʉra rɨ iyesi to' uya uya'sito' ipɨkɨrɨ.  
\v 14 E'tane pʉra rɨ ta uya: tanporon kon ina tamokori ton e'to' itese' pɨ' Papa rɨken apurɨpɨ'nin urɨ, i'napairon pen nɨkayai'ne' to' Ite'ma yawɨrɨ te'sen urɨ, tanporon nɨ sapurɨyai' main, Mosi' winon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ pu'kena' amʉ' nʉmenuka'pʉ.  
\v 15 Kamoro esi'pʉ kasa Papa sapurɨyai' Papa uya i'mʉ'sa'kan nɨto' oton uruwai' yapai, ipokena' ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨri ton.  
\v 16 Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', wakʉ pe uyewan kupʉ i'se te'sen urɨ Papa winɨkʉi' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ka'pon amʉ' winɨkʉi' nɨrɨ. 
\p  
\v 17 “Emennʉ'pʉ rɨ Surusiran pona uye'sa', utonpa ton entu'manin nan pʉrataai oton tʉse'na, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ɨse'mase'na ina use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' ta'.  
\v 18-19 Ɨ'rɨ pʉra rɨ iyekorʉkasa' pe esii'ma unkupʉnʉ kupʉ uya koro'tau Esuwerʉ amʉ' Eisa nono winon kon uya uyeporo'pʉ. To' uya uyeporo'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' tau, anpisin pʉra rɨ uya'kɨrɨ, ɨri pe rɨ e'nɨto' ku'sa' uya pʉra rɨ iyesi.\x - \xo 24:18-19 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 21:17-28\x* To' uye'sa' nin si ɨpiya' nesii'no urɨ nʉkupʉ'pʉ ekamase'na ɨpɨ'.  
\v 20 Mɨrɨ pe pʉra, pʉsamoro uya rɨ nɨrɨ ta e'pai man ɨri unkupʉ'pʉ pɨ' Esuwerʉ amʉ' Konsʉrʉʉi ton piyau esi a'tai.  
\v 21 E'tane pʉra rɨ, e'se'ne' pe rɨken umaimu tʉrʉ'pʉ uya to' koro'tau: Eri'nɨ tʉpo e'mʉ'sa'kan nɨto' apurɨ uya pɨ'. Mɨrɨ pɨkɨrɨ rɨken uyekama'popɨ'to' pe auya esi serɨ, serɨ pe,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya.\x - \xo 24:21 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 23:6\x* 
\p  
\v 22 Piri'kʉs, Ite'ma to'ka'nʉ'nin nʉ'pʉ uya Paarʉ ekama'popɨ'to' ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ. “Eke soisa amʉ' epuru uye'sa' a'tai, Raisayas itese', serɨ ɨko'tʉʉi konekato' pe uya nesii,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 23 Soisa amʉ' esa' apiyo'ma'pʉ iya, “Paarʉ erasunpanin pe, tewa ke pʉra Paarʉ iku'kɨ, itonpa ton uya rɨ Paarʉ mainanpato' pe i'se iye'to' rɨ ne'to' pe to' uya iku'kɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\s1 Piri'kʉs Esi'pʉ Paarʉ Usaurokʉ Eta Pɨ' 
\p  
\v 24 Emennʉ'pʉ po rɨ, Piri'kʉs mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ino'pʉ Turu'sira, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pasi, uyee'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya Paarʉ kɨ'ma'pʉ, isaurokʉ etato' pe tʉuya Sises Kʉrai apurɨto' eseru pɨ'.  
\v 25 Paarʉ usaurokʉ koro'tau, wakʉ pe ka'pon uko'manto' pɨ', ti'tui' ka'pon e'to' pɨ' tʉnkupʉnʉ pɨ' tʉuko'mamʉ yau, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ eseru aimenkato' weyu rɨ e'seporo pɨ', Piri'kʉs usenari'pa uya ta'pʉ, “Mɨrɨ kasa rɨken nɨ nesii, enta. Ɨkɨ'ma uya kanan mɨrɨ iweyu eposa' uya a'tai,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 26 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Paarʉ uya rɨ tʉrepa pʉrata ke tukai' iye'kupʉ'pʉ. Mɨrɨ pɨ' nin si, ikɨ'mapɨtʉ'pʉ iya, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ auro'kapɨtʉ'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 27 Asa'ron wʉipiya pata'pʉ pe, Piri'kʉs uya pata epuru pe te'to' nonka'pʉ. Mɨrɨ pata'pʉ ya', Porʉ'siyas Pesʉ'tas ena'pʉ pata epuru pe. Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton a'kwarʉ uye'to' pe, Paarʉ nɨmɨ'pʉ Piri'kʉs uya pariki'si tau. 
\c 25  
\s1 Paarʉ I'tuto' Pesʉ'tas Piyau 
\p  
\v 1 Isutiya po itepuru pe Pesʉ'tas esi'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Sisariya pona itɨ'pʉ, mɨrɨpan enna'po'pʉ Surusiran pona osorʉwau wʉi tʉpo.  
\v 2 Surusiran po, Pesʉ'tas piya' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton utɨ'pʉ Paarʉ eseru'tɨse'na, “Tu'kan nɨ ɨri ton ku'sa' iya,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 3 Kamoro uya Pesʉ'tas apiyontɨ'pʉ Surusiran pona Paarʉ uye'to' pe ekamato' pe iya, mɨrɨpan ekama'popɨ'to' pe. E'tane to' e'kama'pʉ asanta piyau tʉron kon e'so'nanto' pe Surusiran pona itɨ a'tai iwɨnin nan pe.  
\v 4 E'tane Pesʉ'tas uya to' eikʉ'pʉ, “Sisariya po a'sisa' pe Paarʉ esi mɨrɨ. Serɨ pe'ne rɨ utɨ mɨrɨ Sisariya pona.  
\v 5 Ɨyepuru kon amʉ' enno'tɨ' uya'kɨrɨ to' utɨto' pe, ɨri ton kupʉ iya mʉkayatʉi'ne' pɨ' Paarʉ patakase'na to' utɨto' pe, i'napai rɨ iyesi yau,” ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 6 8 pe mɨrɨ pe pʉra 10 kaisarɨ wʉi Surusiran po tesi kon tʉpo, Pesʉ'tas utɨ'pʉ Sisariya pona, mɨrɨpan a'kɨrɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' utɨ'pʉ. Iyema'sa' yau, Pesʉ'tas ereuta'pʉ aimenkan apon pona, mɨrɨpan uya Paarʉ ne'to' pe to' uya ekama'po'pʉ ekama'popɨ'to' pe tʉuya.  
\v 7 Mɨrɨ yau, soisa amʉ' epuru uya Paarʉ nee'pʉ. Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton Surusiran poi iye'sa' kon esi'pʉ iwoi. “Tu'kan nɨ ɨri ku'sa' Paarʉ uya,” ta'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton uya Pesʉ'tas pɨ', e'tane i'napai rɨ iyesi tukai' to' uya i'tu pʉra iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 8 Mɨrɨ yau, tiwano' pe Paarʉ e'wa'kʉtʉ'pʉ, “Ɨri pe rɨ ina, Esuwerʉ amʉ' iwano' main, Mosi' winon winɨkʉi' usauro'sa' pʉra man, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ina use'mato', ɨpʉremato' iwʉ' eseru pʉreme'sa' uya pʉra rɨ man, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Sisa pɨ' rɨ nɨrɨ ɨri ku'sa' uya pʉra rɨ iyesi,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 9 E'tane Esuwerʉ amʉ' a'kwarʉ ɨnne'pai Pesʉ'tas esi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uya Paarʉ ekama'po'pʉ, “Surusiran pona pe' ɨtɨpai me'an? Mɨrɨ yau si, pʉsamoro uya ɨyekama'popɨ'to' pe upiyau,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 10 E'tane Paarʉ uya, “Kane, serɨ ɨpiyau e'mʉ'sa'kasa' na'ne' Sisa uya ɨku'sa' pɨ'. Serɨ yau kuru uyekama'popɨ'to' auya pe iyesi. I'tu auya ɨri pe rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pɨ' e'sa' pʉra iyesi.  
\v 11 E'tane uwɨto' ipɨkɨrɨ ku'sa' uya yau, ɨ'rɨ pe pʉra man ukota'ma, to' uya uwɨnɨ a'tai, e'tane ɨri ton ku'sa' uya pʉra man. Mɨrɨ pɨ', Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton ena' ɨnʉ' uya utʉrʉ pʉra iyesi mɨrɨ. Itepuru Sisa uya uyekama'popɨtʉ i'se esi!” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya Pesʉ'tas pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 12 Tʉkonsʉrʉʉi amʉ' pokon pe tʉuseta tʉpo, eikʉ'pʉ iya, “Sisa uya ɨyekama'popɨtʉ i'se ɨwesi, mɨrɨ pɨ' ɨutɨto' pe iyesi Sisa piya'!” ta'pʉ Pesʉ'tas uya ipɨ'. 
\s1 Pesʉ'tas Uya Teseru Oton Warinpa'pʉ Kin Akʉri'pa Pɨ' 
\p  
\v 13 Emennʉ'pʉ tʉpo rɨ, kin Akʉri'pa mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ino'pʉ Pones utɨ'pʉ Sisariya pona. Pesʉ'tas apurɨpɨ'se'na to' utɨ'pʉ.  
\v 14 Inke rɨ kin Akʉri'pa mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Pones uko'manpɨtʉ'pʉ; mɨrɨpan koro'tau, Pesʉ'tas uya Paarʉ ekareei ekama'pʉ Akʉri'pa pɨ'. “Moro ka'pon man a'sisa', Paarʉ itese', itepuru Piri'kʉs na'si'pʉ.  
\v 15 Surusiran pona utɨsa' a'tai, use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton eke ton kuru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton uya uyeseru kon i'se pʉra iyesi, ɨri ku'sa' iya ta uya i'se to' esi'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 16 “To' auro'ka'pʉ uya Roman amʉ' eseru esi inke pʉra ka'pon nonkanin nan pen iteyaton non ena'. Wapiya kuru a'sisa' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ iteyaton non utɨto' pe iyesi ekama'popɨ'nin piya'. Mɨrɨ yau, teyaton non pokon pe te'sepose isauro'to' pe, te'wa'kʉtʉ pe.  
\v 17 Mɨrɨ yau, Esuwerʉ amʉ' uyee'pʉ Sisariya pona, Paarʉ eseru aimenkato' a'tai. Ina uyee'pʉ ema'sa' yau, Paarʉ ne'to' pe to' uya ekama'pʉ uya.  
\v 18 Ɨri kuru rɨ na'kɨ wenai to' uya ikupʉ ta'pʉ uya e'tane, mɨrɨ pe pʉra iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 19 E'tane to' e'manenpato' Paarʉ pɨ' esi'pʉ Papa apurɨto' tʉuya'nokon pɨ'. To' e'manenpato' kanan esi'pʉ ka'pon, Sises itese' pɨkɨrɨ. Iyeri'sa' rʉ'pʉ e'tane si, Paarʉ uya, ‘Moro iyesi,’ ta.  
\v 20 Mɨrɨ enta' to' ekama'popɨ'to' ike i'tu uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan to' eseru koneka i'tu uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ. Mɨrɨ pɨ', Paarʉ ekama'po'pʉ uya Surusiran pona itɨto' pe mɨrɨ yau ekama'popɨ'to' pe,  
\v 21 e'tane Paarʉ esi'pʉ i'se pʉra. Roman amʉ' epuru Sisa uya kuru tekama'popɨtʉ i'se iyesi'pʉ, e'tane a'sisa' pe rɨ iye'to' pe ennoko uya pona rɨ Sisa piya',” ta'pʉ Pesʉ'tas uya kin Akʉri'pa pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 22 “Urɨ pe kuru imaimu ɨnetapai e'ai',” ta'pʉ Akʉri'pa uya Pesʉ'tas pɨ'. 
\p “Awanapai rɨ etato' pe ikupʉ uya mɨrɨ. Isaurokʉ etase'na mɨsipʉi',” ta'pʉ Pesʉ'tas uya. 
\s1 Paarʉ E'wa'kʉtʉ'pʉ Akʉri'pa Piyau 
\p  
\v 23 Iyema'sa' yau, Akʉri'pa mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Pones utɨ'pʉ amʉran nɨto' iwʉ' ta' tʉwaai ke, tʉsoisaai amʉ' ke eke pe tesi kon ekamanin pe. Eke ton soisa amʉ' epuru pe te'san mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon nɨ eke ton pe te'san Sisariya po uyee'pʉ to' a'kɨrɨ. Pesʉ'tas uya ta pɨ' Paarʉ nee'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 24 Mɨrɨpan uya ta'pʉ, “Kin Akʉri'pa mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon nɨ serɨ yau na'ne' nan, pʉse rɨ pe' menyatʉu?” ta'pʉ Pesʉ'tas uya to' pɨ'. “Tanporon kon Esuwerʉ amʉ' serɨ yau Sisariya pon kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Surusiran pon kon uya, ipɨkɨrɨ upɨ' tʉmaimu kon tʉpɨ'sa' man. To' ukɨ'pɨ'nʉnpɨtʉ'pʉ, ‘Mɨrɨ enta' kʉ'ko'manin!’ tukai'.  
\v 25 Iwɨto' ipɨkɨrɨ pʉra rɨ iyesi tukai' i'tu'pʉ uya e'tane, Sisa uya kuru tekama'popɨtʉ i'se iye'sa'. Mɨrɨpan Ron pona enno'to' pe uya e'kamasa'.  
\v 26 Itepuru ena' unmenukanʉ i'tu uya pʉra iyesi, mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ' pʉse rɨ senno'ai' tawon, apʉne pʉra ɨri ku'sa' iya pʉra iyesi pɨ'. Mɨrɨ pe iyesi pɨ', ɨpiya'nokon ine'sa' uya, ɨmɨrɨ kuru kin Akʉri'pa piya'. Ekama'popɨtʉ uya'nokon tʉpo, itepuru Sisa ena' unmenukanʉ oton nin si i'tu uya mɨrɨ.  
\v 27 Mɨrɨ ton ɨri ku'sa' iya tawon kareta pʉra iye'tane a'sisa' ennoko Ron pona pʉra iyesi,” ta'pʉ Pesʉ'tas uya to' pɨ'. 
\c 26  
\s1 Kin Akʉri'pa Piyau Paarʉ Usaurokʉ'pʉ Teseru Pɨ' 
\p  
\v 1 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, kin Akʉri'pa uya ta'pʉ Paarʉ pɨ', “Ɨmɨrɨ pe ausaurokʉ pa ɨku'sa' man,” ta'pʉ iya. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Paarʉ uya temiyatʉ anʉmʉ'pʉ tʉusauro'to' pe. Mɨrɨ a'tai tʉmɨrɨ pe usauro'nɨ pɨ' iye'sara'tɨ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 2 “Kin Akʉri'pa, wakʉ pe serɨ esi uiwano' pe usekamato' pe, to' nʉsauro'ai'ne' upɨ' pɨ'. Ito'ka'nʉkʉ uya tu'kan nɨ urɨ pɨ' kasi pe Esuwerʉ amʉ' usauro'to' upɨ' ekama uya ɨpɨ',  
\v 3 apʉne pʉra kuru tanporon nɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' uko'manto' eseru mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ to' manenpanin ton eseru i'tu auya wenai nɨrɨ ɨseseru yawon kon pe pʉra to' esi. Mɨrɨ wenai, uyeta auya i'se e'ai' wakʉ pe. 
\p  
\v 4 “Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya wakʉ pe uko'mamʉ'pʉ eseru i'tu mɨrɨ, mʉre pe esi'pʉ si'kɨrɨ utonpa ton koro'tau Surusiran po.  
\v 5 To' uya ui'tusa' wapiyaro' si'kɨrɨ, to' uya nɨrɨ upataka e'paino upatakapai tesi kon a'tai, mɨrɨ sa'man ɨpʉreman nɨto' eseru pe te'sen yau uko'mamʉ'pʉ Pari'si pe.\x - \xo 26:5 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 23:6; Piri'pai 3:5\x* 
\v 6 Serɨ pe si Papa uya ta'pʉ na'ne' penaro' kon ina tamokori ton pɨ' rɨ iyau e'ku'to' pɨkɨrɨ, serɨ pe uyekama'popɨtʉ auya na'ne'.  
\v 7 Serɨ ekamasa' rʉ'pʉ enupɨkɨrɨ 12 kaisaron kon Esuwerʉ pon kon esi mɨrɨ. Papa apurɨ pɨ' esii'ma wʉi nai mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ewarupɨ nau, epoto' pe tʉuya'nokon. Kin, serɨ pɨ' e'ku'to' wenai Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya uyewa'noma mɨrɨ.  
\v 8 Ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' Papa uya iyeri'sa' i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ apurɨ auya'nokon pʉra iyesi?\x - \xo 26:8 \xt 2 Ma'kapis 7:9\x* 
\p  
\v 9 “Urɨ nɨrɨ uya apurɨ'pʉ man wakʉ pe na'kɨ iyesi tukai' tanporon yau rɨ Nasare' pon Sises ewa'noma pɨ' esi'pʉ.  
\v 10 Mɨrɨ na'ne' kuru kupʉ pɨ' esi'pʉ mɨrɨ Surusiran po. Esuwerʉ amʉ' use'man nɨto' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton eke ton kuru uya iku'kɨ tasa' maimu awɨrɨ, tu'kan kon Sises apurɨnin nan emaika'pʉ uya pariki'si ta'. To' uma'tato' pe to' ku'sa' a'tai, mɨrɨ kasa rɨ to' nʉma'tai tawon pe rɨ e'pɨtʉ'pʉ.  
\v 11 Inke rɨ, utɨpɨtʉ'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' usenupato' ton iwʉ' kaisa rɨ'ne to' kota'mapɨtʉ pɨ'. Miyarɨ rɨ to' a'kwarʉka pɨ' ɨri pe Papa pɨ' asauro'tɨ' tawon pe e'pɨtʉ'pʉ. Pana' pe usakorooi yau tʉutɨsen pe e'pɨ'tai ɨnno'nan pata ton ya' to' poni'simato' pe uya.\x - \xo 26:11 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 8:3; 22:4-5\x* 
\s1 Paarʉ Uya Ekama'pʉ Sises Apurɨnin Pe Tena'pʉ Rʉ'pʉ 
\r (Inkupʉ'pʉ 9:1-19; 22:6-16) 
\p  
\v 12 “Mɨrɨ ton a'tai'ne utɨ a'tai, use'mato' tʉrawasomanin nan epuru ton eke ton kuru uya uyenno'sa' pɨ' tʉmeruntɨrʉ ke utɨto' pe uku'sa' utɨ koro'tau Tamaskas pata e'ma tau.  
\v 13 Kin sɨ, pʉre'po'si a'tai, wʉi enu esi koro'tau, asanta tau esi koro'tau, a'kwa ene'pʉ uya Epʉn winɨpai. A'kwa pe kuru wʉi enu entai iye'wei'tɨ'pʉ uwoi mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ utonpa pe te'san woi.  
\v 14 Tanporo ina uta'mo'ka'pʉ non pona. Mɨrɨ yau, main eta'pʉ uya, Arami' pe,\f + \fr 26:14 \fq Arami' pe; \ft mɨrɨ pe pʉra, \fq Esuwerʉ amʉ' maimu, \ft Ipuru tukai' tesa'san.\f* ‘Saarʉ, Saarʉ, ɨ'rɨ pe iyesi pɨ' uponi'sima auya? Ɨiwano' pe rɨ e'ne' mʉmoronkayai' tɨwɨrɨ rɨ urɨ poni'sima auya kaisa rɨ, tesa' yʉʉi pona te'wɨpɨ'sen itikʉn paka waraino kasa.’ 
\p  
\v 15 “Mɨrɨ tʉpo, ekama'po'pʉ uya, ‘Ɨnʉ' ɨmɨrɨ, uyepuru?’ ta'pʉ uya. 
\p “‘Urɨ kʉrɨ rɨ Sises, mʉponi'simayai'ne',’ tukai' Itepuru uya umaimu eikʉ'pʉ.  
\v 16 ‘Serɨ pe, e'mʉ'sa'ka', ɨpiya' usenpoikasa' serɨ upoitorʉ pe ɨkonekase'na. Serɨ ɨyenu ya' senpoikayai'ne', mɨrɨ tʉpo, serɨ pe kanyauro'kayai'ne' ekamanin pe ɨwesi pa.  
\v 17 Ɨpika'tɨ uya mɨrɨ ɨtonpa ton Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen namai'. Ɨyennoko uya to' piya'  
\v 18 to' enu a'kokapɨ'se'na, to' era'tɨto' pe ewarupɨ apai a'kwa winɨkʉi' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Se'tan\f + \fr 26:18 \fq Se'tan\ft —Makoi ese' isakon, \fq Papa eseru ewaruma'tɨnin \ft ta e'kwa pe.\f* meruntɨrʉ apai Papa winɨkʉi'. Uyapurɨto' to' uya winɨ, tʉmakooi kon pɨ' usentu'mato' epoto' pe to' uya, wakʉ ton ka'pon amʉ' pata'se' yau to' e'to' pe,’ ta'pʉ iya upɨ'. 
\p  
\v 19 “Mɨrɨ wenai, kin Akʉri'pa, uyenu uta'kwakasa' a'tai, unene'pʉ Epʉn winon maimu awɨrɨ esi'pʉ.  
\v 20 Iyepiya'tɨ pe kuru, itekare ekama'pʉ uya Tamaskas pata awon kon pɨ', Surusiran pon kon mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporo Isutiya pata pon kon pana ya' nɨrɨ. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, itekare ekama'pʉ uya Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen pana ya' to' era'tɨto' pe tʉmakooi kon apai Papa winɨkʉi'. To' auro'ka'pʉ uya i'napai rɨ to' uko'manto' pe tʉmakooi kon apai tera'tɨsa' kon ekamanin pe.\x - \xo 26:20 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 9:20, 28-29\x* 
\v 21 Mɨrɨ wenai kuru, Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya uya'si'pʉ mɨrɨ use'man nɨto', ɨpʉreman nɨto' iwʉ' pʉ'kʉ tau. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, to' esi'pʉ uwɨnɨ i'se.  
\v 22 E'tane Papa uya upika'tɨsa' serɨ pona rɨ. Mɨrɨ wenai, serɨ pe e'mʉ'sa'kasa' serɨ ekamase'na ɨnʉ' pe Sises esi tukai' eke ton mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ sepa' nan nɨ pana ya', tanporo Sises pɨ' ukayai'ne' esi mɨrɨ itekare Mosi' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon pu'kena' ton nʉmenuka'pʉ poro.  
\v 23 Pu'kena' ton uya imenuka'pʉ Kʉrai\f + \fr 26:23 \fq Kʉrai \ft (Kiri' maimu yau); mɨrɨ pe pʉra, \fq Me'saya \ft (Ipuru maimu yau), asa'rɨ rɨ marɨ iyesi, \fq Papa Nanʉmʉ'pʉ \ft ta e'kwa pe.\f* kota'mato' oton, mɨrɨ tʉpo, iwɨto' oton, mɨrɨpan te'mʉ'sa'ka ton terikʉ'pʉ apai iyeri'sa' kon e'mʉ'sa'ka tɨpiya pe Esuwerʉ amʉ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen nɨ nɨrɨ pika'tɨse'na to' weyu ekamai', tawon,” ta'pʉ iya.\x - \xo 26:23 \xt 1 Koren 15:20; Aisaya 42:6; 49:6\x* 
\s1 I'tupɨ'to' Si U'matʉ'pʉ 
\p  
\v 24 Serɨ airɨ, Paarʉ wanʉ'tɨpa'pʉ kopʉna Pesʉ'tas uya isekama koro'tau. Ikɨ'pɨ'nʉmʉ'pʉ, “Ta'kwarʉ ke pʉra me'ai', Paarʉ!” tukai'. “Eke pe kuru ɨusenupasa' ayano'ma pɨ' man. Mɨrɨ uya aya'kwarʉ pʉra ɨku'sa' man,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 25 E'tane, “Uya'kwarʉ pʉra esi pen serɨ, eke tʉnamasen Pesʉ'tas,” tukai' Paarʉ uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ. “E'tane ukayai'ne' esi mɨrɨ i'napairon pe kuru tʉto'ka'nʉ'sen pe rɨ.  
\v 26 Serɨ ton ukayai'ne' i'tu ɨmɨrɨ, kin Akʉri'pa uya mɨrɨ; mɨrɨ wenai, usaurokʉ kuru rɨ, usaurokʉ nɨrɨ eta auya pe si'tuyai'. Sapurɨyai' serɨ ton iye'ku'sa' Sises pɨ' i'tu auya tukai', apʉne pʉra tu'kan kon uya Sises pɨ' iye'ku'sa' etasa' pɨ',” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 27 Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Paarʉ uya kin Akʉri'pa ekama'po'pʉ, “Pu'kena' ton nʉmenuka'pʉ pe' mapurɨyan? Apurɨ auya pe kuru rɨ si'tuyai',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 28 “Inke pʉra pe' Kʉri'san pe enato' pe ukupʉ auya tukai' ɨusenuminka?” ta'pʉ Akʉri'pa uya Paarʉ pɨ'. 
\p  
\v 29 “Inke pʉra rɨ, mɨrɨ pe pʉra inke rɨ, ɨpʉrema serɨ Papa pɨ', ɨmɨrɨ rɨken pen e'tane tanporo kamoro uyeta pɨ' na'ne' nan nɨ marɨ serɨ pe, enato' pe urɨ na'ne' kasa apurɨnin pe, a'sisa' pe pʉra rɨken,” tukai' Paarʉ uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 30 Kin, kopʉna, Pones, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tanporon kon to' a'kɨrɨ te'san e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ.  
\v 31 Itau te'to' kon ɨutɨ nɨmɨ'pʉ to' uya, asaurokʉi'ma tʉtonpa kon amʉ' pokon pe. “Pʉse rɨ uya ɨri rɨ tʉwɨto' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ta'sito' iwenai ku'sa' pʉra rɨ iyesi,” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 32 Akʉri'pa uya ta'pʉ Pesʉ'tas pɨ', “Pʉse rɨ uya Sisa uya tekama'popɨ'to' pe tasa' pʉra iyesi yau, inonka'pʉ nesii'no rɨ,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\c 27  
\s1 Paarʉ Utɨ'pʉ Sisariya Apai Opa'wʉ Kʉri' Pona 
\p  
\v 1 Ina utɨto' pe I'tari pona tukai' iye'ku'sa' pe iyesi'pʉ a'tai, Paarʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon a'sisa' kon nonka'pʉ to' uya soisa amʉ' epuru, Isuriyas itese' ena', “tamʉ' tawon kon Sisa Soisaai Amʉ',” tato' kon.  
\v 2 Kanau epotorʉ'pʉ ya' ina ekanwa'tɨ'pʉ pata Atʉrami'tiyan, Eisa awon apai. Kanau tʉutɨsen pe te'sen ereutapɨtʉ'pʉ Eisa awo'nan tʉron nɨ ton nɨ pata ton yau. Aresta'kos, Sises apurɨnin Tesaroni'ka winon esi'pʉ ina tonpa pe, Ma'sitoniya apaino. 
\p  
\v 3 Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, Saitan pata eporo'pʉ ina uya. Mɨrɨ yau, Isuriyas uya Paarʉ auro'ka'pʉ mannʉ' pe te'se, tʉtonpa ton ense'na itɨto' pe inonka'pʉ iya, i'se rɨ iye'to' ke to' uya ipika'tɨto' pe.  
\v 4 Mɨrɨ apai, ina kanan utɨ'pʉ parau po Sai'pʉras opa'wʉ pata winɨkʉi', mɨrɨ airɨ tʉtʉi pe iyesi pɨ', apʉne pʉra pana' pe kuru a'setun uyee'pʉ ina winɨkʉi'.  
\v 5 Parau po Siri'siya mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Panperiya poro iwa rɨ ina e'kwɨrɨtʉ'pʉ. Ina uya Maira eporo'pʉ Iri'siya awon.  
\v 6 Mɨrɨ yau, soisa amʉ' epuru uya Arisantiriya pata apai kanau uye'sa' eta'pʉ. Utɨn pɨ' iyesi'pʉ I'tari winɨkʉi', mɨrɨpan ya' ina kanwa'tɨ'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 7 Inke rɨ wʉi tenno'pɨ'se tɨnɨn pɨ' kuru ina utɨ'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, Kʉnitas eporo i'se ina usi'tu'pʉ, e'tane pana' pe kuru a'setun uyee'pʉ; mɨrɨ wenai, to'sa rɨ kanau utɨ'pʉ pen ina utɨto' ya'. Kʉri' opa'wʉ winɨkʉi' ina utɨ'pʉ, apʉne pʉra a'setun pʉra mɨrɨ poro iyesi pɨ', Sarʉmone nono utɨsa' parau ka' woi.  
\v 8 Mɨrɨ apai, ina utama'pʉ sa'man yau, pana' pe rɨ a'setun esi koro'tau. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, ina uyee'pʉ Wakʉ Peya' tato' ya', a'ko pe pata Raseya piya' rɨ. 
\p  
\v 9 Oko pe ina esi emapu'tɨ'pʉ ɨsɨ pe a'setun esi uya. Serɨ a'tai'ne rɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' useruma weyu pata'pʉ pe\f + \fr 27:9 \fq Esuwerʉ amʉ' useruma weyu pata'pʉ pe. \ft Mɨrɨ esi'pʉ Esuwerʉ amʉ' ekonekato' ɨri pe tesi'pʉ kon apai weyu rʉ'pʉ pata'pʉ pe (Yon Ki'porʉ), kanau epotorʉ'pʉ yau utɨn esi'pʉ sa'man pe kuru rɨ.\f* iyesi'pʉ. Mɨrɨ wenai, Paarʉ uya to' auro'ka'pʉ:  
\v 10 “Utonpa ton, ɨsɨ yau kuru e'nɨ tukai' senyai'. A'setun uya kanau, apuru, urɨ'nokon nɨ nɨrɨ ma'tanʉkʉ poken iyesi,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 11 E'tane Paarʉ usauro'to' uya soisa amʉ' epuru ewankama'pʉ pen. “Kanau anin mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ kanau esa' uya auro'kan nɨto' awɨrɨ, utɨnpai'nokon,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 12 Kanau ereutato' pata esi'pʉ wakʉ pe iyau e'nɨ poken pʉra, komi' pe pata e'to' weyu e'seposa' a'tai, tu'kan kon uya, “Miyarɨ rɨ utɨnpai'nokon nɨ,” ta'pʉ. Pini'kʉs itese' pata Kʉri' pon eporo tʉuya'nokon tukai' to' esi'pʉ, mɨrɨ yau komi' pe pata e'to' weyu enno'to' pe tʉuya'nokon. Serɨ Kʉri' pata esi'pʉ mɨrɨ asa'ron winɨpai ɨsi'ratoi pe kanau ereutapɨ'to' pata'se' pe. 
\s1 Ɨsɨ Kuru A'setun Uya Kanau Arɨ'pʉ Ite'ma Tapai 
\p  
\v 13 Mararon A'setun e'sara'tɨsa' a'tai uye'nɨ pɨ', i'se te'ton kon uya teposa' kon pe to' uya ekama'pʉ. Mɨrɨ a'tai, wa'ka pun kanau ku'nin peten anʉmʉ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan utɨ'pʉ Kʉri' ka'ta poro.  
\v 14 Inke kuru iye'sa' koro'tau pʉra rɨ, pana'pan a'setun, kuranau warai uyee'pʉ opa'wʉ pata winɨpai kanau wɨse'na, Wʉi Enu Enuku Enwo'netʉ Winon A'setun tukai' tesa'sen.  
\v 15 Kanau wɨnɨ'pʉ iya pana' pe, miyarɨ rɨ itɨto' pʉra rɨ iye'to' temapu'tɨi'. Mɨrɨ pɨ', a'setun uya kanau epotorʉ'pʉ ato' pe ina uya inonka'pʉ.  
\v 16 Mɨrɨ yau, wʉi enu enuku kamisi winɨkʉi' aiko Kauta opa'wʉri awɨrɨ ina utɨ'pʉ, a'setun pʉra mɨrɨ awɨrɨ iyesi wenai. Epika'tɨn nɨto' kanwa kupʉ poken pʉra iyesi pɨ'. Mɨrɨ wenai, ina uya anʉmʉ'pʉ kanau epotorʉ'pʉ ya'.  
\v 17 Kanau anʉmʉ tʉpo, to' uya si'na' ke ewa'tɨ'pʉ kanau epotorʉ'pʉ pona. Enari'ke' to' esi'pʉ ta'muna kon Sɨritis wɨ'sɨpu pona tukai'. Kanau anin kareku nu'tɨ'pʉ to' uya, tɨnɨn pɨ' itɨto' pe.  
\v 18 Miyarɨ rɨ pana' pe a'setun esi'pʉ uye'nɨ pɨ'. Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, kanau pʉro'po te'sen ka'pon amʉ' apuruui ton ma'kɨrɨ'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 19 Itosorʉwano wʉi a'tai, kanau apuruui amʉ' ma'kɨrɨ'pʉ to' uya kanau yapai asi'ono pe parɨ kanau e'to' pe.  
\v 20 Inke kuru ewarupɨ pe pata esi'pʉ; wʉi enu e'wei'tɨ pʉra, sirikɨ amʉ' nɨrɨ usene pʉra, apʉne pʉra a'setun nɨ esi wenai uye'nɨ pɨ'. Inke rʉ'kwɨ rɨ wakʉ pɨ' te'ku'pɨtʉ kon tʉpo, ina e'nonka'pʉ. 
\p  
\v 21 Inke ina enta'nasa' pʉra ina uko'mansa' koro'tau, Paarʉ e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ to' pɨ' tase'na, “Utonpa ton, kanyauro'katantʉune' utɨnpai'nokon pʉra Kʉri' pata apai ukataine' tetai' pʉra ɨwesi'pʉ kon. Epika'tɨn nɨ nesii'no, apuru ton nɨ uma'ta pʉra nesii'no.  
\v 22 E'tane serɨ pe ɨpɨ'nokon ta uya pana' pe aya'kwarʉ kon nesii, apʉne pʉra ɨnʉ' rɨ uma'ta pe pʉra iyesi. Kanau rɨken uma'tato' oton.  
\v 23 Nesiine' ewarupɨ nau, Papa, urɨ na'ne' itiwano' pe mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ ipoitorʉ pe e'tʉrawasomayai'ne' inserʉʉi e'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ upiyau.  
\v 24 ‘Kenari'nʉmʉi Paarʉ! Me'mʉ'sa'kai' rɨ, ɨyekama'popɨ'to' Sisa uya yau. Papa uya nɨrɨ tʉusentu'ma wenai kamoro kanau yau iye'sa' kon aya'kɨrɨ pika'tɨsa' mɨrɨ.’  
\v 25 Mɨrɨ wenai utonpa ton, kenari'nʉntʉu! Papa apurɨto' uya esi pɨ' iye'kupʉ rɨ inserʉ nekama'pʉ awɨrɨ. Mɨrɨ kasa kuru inserʉ uya uyauro'ka'pʉ mɨrɨ.  
\v 26 Mɨrɨ e'tane rɨ, a'munan pe man opa'wʉ tonpa ton pona rɨ; kanau rɨ uta'morʉka,” ta'pʉ iya. 
\s1 Paarʉ Uya Tʉtonpa Ton Pori'ma'pʉ 
\p  
\v 27 14 kaisaron wʉi yau, parau Atʉriyati' po utɨn pɨ' ina e'tane, anomʉra' kanau anin nan uya a'mun pata eporo tukai' i'tu'pʉ.  
\v 28 Mɨrɨ a'tai, i'tuto' si'na' ton ennasikapɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya. Mɨrɨ a'tai, to' uya eporo'pʉ 120 pi' i'nau iyesi tukai'. Emennʉ'pʉ iwa to' uya kanan i'tukaa'pʉ; 90 pi' i'nau iyesi tukai' kanan to' uya eporo'pʉ.  
\v 29 Tɨ' pona sipa'sipa uya ina arɨ tukai' to' enari'nʉmʉ'pʉ. 4 kaisaron ton wa'ka pun kanau ku'nin peten eno'ma'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon enurikʉ'pʉ pata emakʉ i'se.  
\v 30 Tapʉrʉnto' kon pe kanau anin nan uya epika'tɨn nɨto' kanwa nu'tɨ'pʉ tuna ka', kanau a'sinin ton nu'tɨ tʉuya'nokon pe itese'.  
\v 31 Mɨrɨ a'tai, Paarʉ uya ta'pʉ soisa amʉ' epuru pɨ' mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ soisa amʉ' pɨ' rɨ, “Pʉsamo kanau yau te'tʉrawasomasan esi a'tai rɨken kanau yau, ɨyepika'tɨto' oton kon mɨrɨ,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 32 Mɨrɨ pɨ', soisa amʉ' uya si'na' ton akʉ'pɨtʉ'pʉ tuna ka' epika'tɨn nɨto' kanwa uta'mo'kato' pe. 
\p  
\v 33 Pata emakʉ rawɨrɨ rɨ, tanporo to' enta'nato' pe ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya. “14 kaisa rɨ wʉi ɨwe'sa' kon sa'man yau tenta'nai' pʉra,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya.  
\v 34 “Serɨ pe si enta'natɨ' ta uya ɨpɨ'nokon, nurɨne ɨwesi kon pa. Ɨnʉ' uya rɨ tikin nɨ rɨ ti'pai i'po' eno'mato' oton pen mɨrɨ,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 35 Serɨ ta'pʉ tʉuya tʉpo, tʉyu anʉmʉ'pʉ iya, tenki ta'pʉ iya Papa pɨ', mɨrɨpan pɨ' iyenta'na'pʉ tanporon kon enu airɨ.  
\v 36 Tanporon kon pori'ma'pʉ iya, mɨrɨpan kon nɨrɨ enta'na'pʉ.  
\v 37 Tanporo 276 kaisa rɨ\f + \fr 27:37 \ft Tʉron nɨ imenukasa' ton uya, \fq 275 kaisa rɨ \ft ta; tʉron kon uya, \fq 76 kaisarɨ rɨ nawon \ft ta.\f* ina esi'pʉ kanau yau.  
\v 38 Tanporo i'se te'to' kon pe tenta'na kon tʉpo, to' uya a'nai', wi' tato' tʉnarɨnʉ kon ma'kɨrɨ'pʉ parau ka' asi'ono pe kanau enato' pe. 
\s1 Sipa'sipa Uya Kanau Aure Ma'tanʉkʉ'pʉ 
\p  
\v 39 Pata ema'sa' a'tai, a'mun pata eposa' tʉuya'nokon to'ka'nʉkʉ to' uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ, e'tane ikupai yau ite'pi ene'pʉ to' uya. Miyarɨ rɨ kanau arɨ pɨ' to' e'ku'sa' pe iyesi a'tai, iyereuta nesii'no a'mun pona.  
\v 40 Wa'ka pun kanau ku'nin peten ewa ton akʉ'pɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan nonka'pʉ to' uya parau ka'. Mɨrɨ a'tai'ne rɨ, kanau a'sito' ike ewa ton amʉ' eukapɨtʉ'pʉ to' uya. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, iputu pon kanau anin kareku i'mʉ'sa'ka'pʉ to' uya, a'setun uya tato' kon pe parau ka'ta pona.  
\v 41 E'tane kanau putu a'muna'pʉ. Mɨrɨ apai, iye'wʉrʉuka'pʉ pen, pana' pe sipa'sipa e'wɨpɨtʉ uya iyaure i'kwɨtʉ'pʉ ipʉra. 
\p  
\v 42 Soisa amʉ' e'kupʉ'pʉ a'sisa' kon wɨnɨ pɨ' tʉupɨnʉnse to' apʉrʉmʉ namai',  
\v 43 e'tane soisa amʉ' epuru esi'pʉ Paarʉ ɨnpika'tɨpai, mɨrɨpan nɨrɨ esi'pʉ a'sisa' kon wɨnɨ soisa amʉ' uya i'se pʉra, mɨrɨ pɨ' to' ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ iya. Kamoro tʉupɨnʉnsan pɨ', “Ainʉntɨ' tuna ka' ɨupɨnʉmʉ kon pa a'mun pona,” ta'pʉ soisa amʉ' epuru uya.  
\v 44 To' tonpa ton nin si utɨto' pe to' pɨkɨrɨ iye'kwɨ'pɨ'sa' ton paranka pɨ' tʉuta'sipɨ'se, serɨ ta itepuru uya awɨrɨ ina e'sa' wenai, a'mun eporo'pʉ ina uya wakʉ pe rɨ. \fig Serɨ ta itepuru uya awɨrɨ ina e'sa' wenai, a'mun eporo'pʉ ina uya wakʉ pe rɨ.|src="CN02045B.tif" size="span" loc="ACT 27:13-44" copy="David C. Cook" ref="27:44" \fig* 
\c 28  
\s1 Marʉ'ta Itese' Opa'wʉ Po 
\p  
\v 1 Wakʉ pe kuru ina uya pata eposa' a'tai, ina uya Marʉ'ta itese' mɨrɨ opa'wʉ tukai' i'tu'pʉ.  
\v 2 Patawon amʉ' uya wakʉ pe kuru ina ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ. Apo' po'tɨ'pʉ to' uya, mɨrɨpan kon uya ina kɨ'ma'pʉ a'nose'na, apʉne pʉra tuna pe, ikomi' pe nɨrɨ pata esi pɨ'.  
\v 3 Paarʉ uya apo' pe te'ton amʉranʉ'sa' a'tai, ɨsɨ kuru ɨkʉi esi'pʉ i'koro'tau. A'ne' uya enpa'ka'pʉ, mɨrɨpan uta'si'pʉ itemiyatʉ pɨ'.  
\v 4 Patawon amʉ' uya ɨkʉi e'sinkasa' ene a'tai itemiyatʉ pɨ', to' uya ta'pʉ tiwano' kon pe, “Pʉse rɨ ka'pon esi pe man te'wɨsen pe, parau apai iyapʉrʉnsa' e'tane, kʉrɨ rɨ Papa mɨrɨ waraino kon poni'simanin uya si ima'tanʉkʉ pe man,” ta'pʉ to' uya.  
\v 5 E'tane Paarʉ uya ɨkʉi eno'ma'pʉ apo' ya', mɨrɨpan esi'pʉ e'ne' pe pʉra rɨ.  
\v 6 Ka'pon amʉ' esi'pʉ iya'mamʉ enupɨkɨrɨ, mɨrɨ tʉpo iyerikʉ tukai' itenupɨkɨrɨ to' esi'pʉ. E'tane inke rɨ itenupɨkɨrɨ tesi kon tʉpo, ɨ'rɨ rɨ e'kupʉ pʉra iyesi pɨ' ipɨ', teseru kon ensima'pʉ to' uya. “Papa pe man,” ta'pʉ to' uya. \fig Ɨsɨ kuru ɨkʉi uta'si'pʉ itemiyatʉ pɨ'.|src="CN02050B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 28:1-6" copy="David C. Cook" ref="28:3" \fig* 
\p  
\v 7 A'ko pe rɨ mɨrɨ yau iyesi'pʉ umɨ, eke opa'wʉ pata epuru, Pa'piriyas itese' mainarʉ. Ina ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ iya tiwʉ' ta' osorʉwau wʉi e'to' airɨ.  
\v 8 Ikʉipʉnʉ esi'pʉ e'ne' pe e'kɨɨi'man pɨ', mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ mʉnʉimɨ pɨ', mɨrɨpan piya' Paarʉ ewomʉ'pʉ ipʉremai', mɨrɨpan uya temiyatʉ nonka'pʉ ipona, mɨrɨpan epi'tɨ'pʉ iya.  
\v 9 Serɨ e'ku'sa' a'tai, tʉron kon e'ne' ton uyee'pʉ ipiya', mɨrɨpan kon usepi'tɨpɨtʉ'pʉ.  
\v 10 Ina nama'pʉ to' uya tu'kan winɨ rɨ. Ina utɨto' e'seposa' a'tai, to' uya ina repapɨtʉ'pʉ tu'kan ke rɨ ina i'kiyari mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ i'se ina e'to' ton nɨ kanau yau. \fig Paarʉ ewomʉ'pʉ ipʉremai', temiyatʉ nonka'pʉ iya ipona.|src="CN02053B.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 28:7-10" copy="David C. Cook" ref="28:8" \fig* 
\s1 Paarʉ Utɨ'pʉ Marʉ'ta Apai I'tari Pona 
\p  
\v 11 Osorʉwau kapʉi tʉpo, kanau epotorʉ'pʉ yau parau po ina utɨ'pʉ iko'mansa' komi' weyu pe pata esi wenai. Arisantiriya winon pe kanau esi'pʉ. Kanau putu pɨ' Munui' Amʉ' Papa tato' ipɨ' pe yʉi ewa'pɨ'sa' ton esi'pʉ.\f + \fr 28:11 \ft To' ese' ton esi Kastorʉ mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Poros tukai', kanau yau tʉupininsan ewakiri ton kuru.\f* 
\v 12 Ina uya Sire'kiyus eporo'pʉ. Mɨrɨ yau, osorʉwau wʉi ina uko'mamʉ'pʉ.  
\v 13 Mɨrɨ apai, ina kanan utɨ'pʉ, Resiyan tepose. Mɨrɨ ema'sa' yau, wʉi enu enuku kamisi winon pese'tɨ uyee'pʉ. Asa'rɨ wʉi pata'pʉ pe, Pu'tiyori eporo'pʉ ina uya.  
\v 14 Mɨrɨ yau, tʉtonpa kon amʉ' eporo'pʉ ina uya, mɨrɨpan kon uya ina kɨ'ma'pʉ tikin nɨ suntaaka e'to' poro ina uko'manto' pe tʉpiyau'nokon. Mɨrɨ kasa ina uya pata Ron eporo'pʉ.  
\v 15 To' uya ina uyepʉ Ron pona tukai' etasa' a'tai, to' uye'sa' esi'pʉ ɨnnon A'piyas tepose rɨ, tʉron kon nɨrɨ uye'sa' esi'pʉ Osorʉwau Patatʉse' tepose'ne rɨ ina e'matai. Pʉsamoro eposa' tʉuya a'tai, Paarʉ uya Papa pɨ' tenki ta'pʉ, mɨrɨpan pori'ma'pʉ to' uya mɨrɨ yau. 
\s1 Paarʉ Epa'ka'pʉ Ron Pona 
\p  
\v 16 Ina epa'kasa' a'tai Ron pona, tiwano' pe iko'manto' pe to' uya Paarʉ kupʉ'pʉ soisa tʉku'se erasuntɨnin pe. 
\p  
\v 17 Osorʉwau wʉi tʉpo, Esuwerʉ amʉ' epuru ton kɨ'ma'pʉ Paarʉ uya. To' amʉrasa' a'tai, ta'pʉ iya to' pɨ', “Utonpa ton, ɨ'rɨ rɨ ekamʉn mɨrɨ pe pʉra ɨ'rɨ rɨ penaro' kon ukʉipʉnʉ kon amʉ' nekama'pʉ pen nɨ ku'sa' uya pʉra iye'tane, a'sisa' pe e'ai'. A'sisa' rʉ'pʉ urɨ Surusiran po. Mɨrɨ tʉpo, Ron pon kon ena' inonkasa' rʉ'pʉ urɨ.  
\v 18 To' uya uyekama'popɨtʉ'pʉ tʉpo, unonkapai to' esi'pʉ, apʉne pʉra ɨri ku'sa' uya pʉra iyesi'pʉ uwɨto' ipɨkɨrɨ.  
\v 19 Esuwerʉ amʉ' esi'pʉ unonka i'se pʉra, mɨrɨ wenai enno'sa' urɨ Sisa uya uyeseru aimenkato' pe, ɨ'rɨ rɨ ekamʉn tʉto' uya pʉra rɨ iye'tane utonpa ton, Esuwerʉ amʉ' pɨ'.\x - \xo 28:19 \xt Inkupʉ'pʉ 25:11\x* 
\v 20 Mɨrɨ wenai, ɨyento' kon pe uya, ayauro'kato' kon pe uya ɨkɨ'masa' uya 'nokon mɨrɨ. A'sisa' pe e'ai', apʉne pʉra Esuwerʉ amʉ' pika'tɨnin pe ekamasa' rʉ'pʉ ese' pɨ' esi pɨ',” ta'pʉ iya. 
\p  
\v 21 To' uya imaimu eikʉ'pʉ, “Kareta rɨ eposa' ina uya pʉra man ɨmɨrɨ ekamanin. Ɨnʉ' yan nɨ uye'sa' mɨrɨ apai uya ɨyeseru patakasa' pʉra rɨ man.  
\v 22 E'tane anapurɨnʉ ɨnetapai ina man, apʉne pʉra serɨ emenna' iyamʉtʉ yau ɨwe'to' esi wakʉ pe pʉra tukai' tanporon kon usaurokʉ pɨ',” ta'pʉ to' uya. 
\p  
\v 23 To' uya tʉweyu kon koneka'pʉ tʉron nɨ wʉi a'tai kanan etato' pe tʉuya'nokon, mɨrɨpan kon uyee'pʉ tu'ke parɨ Paarʉ pata'se' ya'. Awanakʉi' si'kɨrɨ iko'mamʉ pona rɨ, Papa e'to' esa' wannɨ pe enpoika pɨ' iyesi'pʉ to' pana ya', ɨ'rɨ tukai' mɨrɨ ya' ewon nɨto' esi tukai' nɨrɨ. Main, Mosi' winon apai mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ tʉron kon nɨ pu'kena' ton eseru apai'ne rɨ to' uya Sises apurɨto' pe ikupʉ i'se iyesi'pʉ.  
\v 24 Tʉron kon uya inekamanʉ apurɨ'pʉ, e'tane tʉron kon uya apurɨ'pʉ pen.  
\v 25 Ɨsi'kaisa rɨ to' ekoneka pʉra iyesi'pʉ, mɨrɨpan kon e'sara'tɨ'pʉ inɨmɨ pɨ', iu'matʉ pe rɨ se tawon ekama iya tʉpo, “Wakʉ A'kwarʉ usaurokʉ'pʉ rɨ i'napairon pɨ' ukʉipʉnʉ kon pɨ'. Ta'pʉ iya na'ne' Aisaya pu'kena' awɨrɨ: 
\q1  
\v 26 “‘Enta kamoro ka'pon amʉ' piya' tase'na to' pɨ', 
\q1 “Tɨwɨrɨ rɨ eta auya'nokon, mɨrɨ e'tane ito'ka'nʉkʉ auya'nokon pʉra rɨ iyesi; 
\q2 tɨwɨrɨ rɨ ɨyenu kon tʉpɨtʉ auya'nokon, mɨrɨ e'tane ene auya'nokon pʉra iyesi,” 
\m tawon. 
\q1  
\v 27 Apʉne pʉra pʉsamoro ka'pon amʉ' ewan enasa' sa'man pe, 
\q2 tʉpana kon a'kopɨ'sa' to' uya, 
\q2 tenu kon nɨ a'kopɨ'sa' to' uya. 
\q1 To' uya tenu kon ke ene nesii'no, 
\q2 to' uya eta tʉpana kon ke nesii'no, 
\q2 to' uya tewan kon ke ito'ka'nʉkʉ nesii'no, 
\q1 mɨrɨpan kon era'tɨ uwinɨkʉi' nesii'no to' epi'tɨ uya nesii'no,’\f + \fr 28:27 \ft Aisaya 6:9-10\f* 
\m tawon,” ta'pʉ Paarʉ uya. 
\p  
\v 28 “Mɨrɨ wenai i'tu auya'nokon i'se e'ai', serɨ epika'tɨn nɨto' ekareei esi mɨrɨ Esuwerʉ amʉ' pen iwano' pe, mɨrɨpan anʉnto' oton to' uya,” ta'pʉ iya.  
\v 29 (Serɨ etasa' Esuwerʉ amʉ' uya a'tai, tʉmɨrɨ'nokon pe rɨ e'sei'pɨtʉi'ma to' enna'po'pʉ.)\f + \fr 28:29 \ft Tʉron nɨ imenukasa' ton v. 29 pʉra iyesi.\f* 
\p  
\v 30 Asa'rɨ wʉipiya e'to' airɨ, Paarʉ uko'mamʉ'pʉ tʉne'manʉ ɨutɨ tau, tikin nɨ'ne tʉuye'san ereutanʉkʉ'pʉ iya to' auro'kato' pe tʉuya.  
\v 31 Te'namai' pʉra, iwa'kʉ'pɨ'nin pʉra Papa e'to' esa' wannɨ pe pɨ' itekare ekama'pʉ iya, mɨrɨ awonsi'kɨ Itepuru Sises Kʉrai pɨ' enupan nʉ'pʉ iya.